is position as Christine C. Quinn’s chief liberal challenger before Anthony D. Weiner usurps that role.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/01/nyregion/wary-of-weiner-bill-de-blasio-assails-christine-c-quinn.html', 'snippet': 'Bill de Blasio has gone sharply negative in his bid for mayor, as if trying to establish his position as Christine C. Quinn’s chief liberal challenger before Anthony D. Weiner usurps that role.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bill de Blasio has hammered Christine C. Quinn over her closeness to the mayor, mocked her as the “best friend” of the real estate industry, and accused her of being soft on the police commissioner, Raymond W. Kelly.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/01/nyregion/NYCMAYOR/NYCMAYOR-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/01/nyregion/NYCMAYOR/NYCMAYOR-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/01/nyregion/NYCMAYOR/NYCMAYOR-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/01/nyregion/NYCMAYOR/NYCMAYOR-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/01/nyregion/NYCMAYOR/NYCMAYOR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/01/nyregion/NYCMAYOR/NYCMAYOR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0,