n-egg-and-whose-egg.html', 'snippet': 'Two new books offer interesting perspectives on the finding and keeping and eventual opening of eggs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Every year, springtime brings a flurry of books about birds and birth and babies and, inevitably, eggs. Of course, there’s Easter. And the seasonal school curriculum. And every so often, something that feels quite new. This season, two new books from small presses offer interesting perspectives on the finding and keeping and eventual opening of eggs.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/01/books/01childrens-1/01childrens-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/01/books/01childrens-1/01childrens-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/01/books/01childrens-1/01childrens-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/01/books/01childrens-1/01childrens-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/01/books/01childrens-1/01childrens-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/01/books/01childrens-1/01childrens-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/01/books/01childrens-1/01childrens-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'hei