'lead_paragraph': 'A company that describes itself as a vault for personal data has suffered an embarrassing heist: intruders penetrated its computer system and looted its customers’ names, addresses and in some cases, dates of birth and login passwords.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Thieves Break Into a Personal ‘Data Vault’ Company', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computer Security', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fertik, Michael', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Evernote Corp', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'LivingSocial.com', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-01T16:47:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Somini Sengupta', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Somini', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sengupta', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c2e63c23-6f4f-55af-ab6f-938d0ba13501', 'word_count': 232, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c2e63c23-6f4f-55af-ab6f-938d0ba13501'}, {'abstract': 'The increase in truck sales fed double-digit sales growth for Detroit and kept the industry on track to sell more than 15 million vehicles this year.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/02/business/trucks-help-detroit-carmakers-post-a-strong-april.html', 'snippet': 'The increase in truck sales fed double-digit sales growth for Detroit and kept the industry on track to sell more than 15 million vehicles this year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DETROIT — American automakers said on Wednesday that sales of pickup trucks rose sharply in April because of a revival in the housing market and increased demand from the oil and gas industry.', 'print_section