gs.nytimes.com/2013/05/01/how-to-weaken-a-president/', 'snippet': 'For some Republicans, visceral hatred of Obama is their only guiding star.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Republicans came up with all kinds of convoluted and made-up explanations for voting against gun background checks, and some are starting to do the same for the immigration bill. A few are even using the Boston bombing as an excuse. But for many lawmakers, the real reason is depressingly familiar. They don’t want to give President Obama anything he wants.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'How to Weaken a President', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Flake, Jeffrey L', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-01T17:14:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Firestone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Firestone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bd767585-06e2-5084-8c74-f8b39bfaca83', 'word_count': 488, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bd767585-06e2-5084-8c74-f8b39bfaca83'}, {'abstract': 'In this lesson, students research the digestive system in depth, and then create a detailed walk-through model to illustrate each compartment.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/01/gulp-dont-gag-modeling-the-complexity-of-the-digestive-system/', 'snippet': 'In this lesson, students research the digestive system in depth, and then create a detailed walk-through model to illustrate each compartment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Times’s Quentin Hardy talks with Mary Roach about her new book, “Gulp: Adventures on the Alimentary Canal.”', 'source': 'The N