 Celebrates Wagons And Their Owners', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Antique and Classic Cars', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ingrassia, Paul', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Automotive Hall of Fame', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Wake Forest University', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Detroit (Mich)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-01T18:35:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Preston', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Preston', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d6c317d6-3a9d-5416-a2d2-ff83f2a6ab8f', 'word_count': 1015, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d6c317d6-3a9d-5416-a2d2-ff83f2a6ab8f'}, {'abstract': 'Earlier versions of the forms to apply for coverage under the new health law ran to 21 pages.', 'web_url': 'https://bucks.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/01/shorter-forms-for-coverage-under-new-health-law/', 'snippet': 'Earlier versions of the forms to apply for coverage under the new health law ran to 21 pages.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Banks and mortgage lenders have made strides in simplifying their disclosure forms so consumers can more easily understand the types of fees and terms they are getting.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Shorter Forms for Coverage Under New Health Law', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Car