a path to citizenship for immigrants, but discord about which party would address those issues best.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/02/us/politics/poll-finds-strong-support-for-tightened-gun-laws-and-path-to-citizenship.html', 'snippet': 'A New York Times/CBS News Poll found broad support for background checks on gun buyers and a path to citizenship for immigrants, but discord about which party would address those issues best.', 'lead_paragraph': 'While the public overwhelmingly supports background checks for gun buyers and a path to citizenship for illegal immigrants, Americans largely retreat into their partisan camps when asked whether President Obama or Congressional Republicans will make the right decisions on those and other domestic issues facing the nation, according to the latest New York Times/CBS News Poll.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Americans’ Unity on Big Issues Doesn’t Bridge Partisan Gap', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New Poll Finds Unity on Gun Laws and Immigration, but a Split on Leadership', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Polls and Public Opinion', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kopicki, Allison', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CBS News', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gun Control', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Budget (US)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N