 music; Daft Punk takes electronic dance music to a new dimension.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Each week, Val Haller, a music-obsessed baby boomer and the founder of the Web site Valslist.com, matches tracks from her generation to those of her 20-something sons’ generation.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/02/booming/02match-booming-kool-daftpunk1/02match-booming-kool-daftpunk1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/02/booming/02match-booming-kool-daftpunk1/02match-booming-kool-daftpunk1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/02/booming/02match-booming-kool-daftpunk1/02match-booming-kool-daftpunk1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/02/booming/02match-booming-kool-daftpunk1/02match-booming-kool-daftpunk1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/02/booming/02match-booming-kool-daftpunk1/02match-booming-kool-daftpunk1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/02/booming/02match-booming-kool-daftpunk1/02match-booming-kool-daftpunk1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/02/booming/02match-booming-kool-daftpunk1/02match-booming-kool-daftpunk1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'If You Like Kool & the Gang, Try Daft Punk', 'kicker': 'Music Match', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baby Boomers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kool and the Gang', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Daft Punk', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-02T14:48:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Booming', 'byline': {'original': 'By Val Haller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Val', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Haller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1d834b0a-81a1-5672-b52b-86ff94fabceb', 'word_count': 878, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1d834b0a-81a1-5672-b52b-86ff94fabceb'}, {'abstract': 'The public service for George Jones at the Grand Ole Opry will be streamed online and shown on several cable channels.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/02/country-stars-tribute-to-george-jones-streaming-online/', 'snippet': 'The public service for George Jones at the Grand Ole Opry will be streamed online and shown on several cable channels.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Not many funerals are held at the Grand Ole Opry in Nashville.\xa0 But the service for George Jones, the hard-drinking singer considered by some critics to be the definitive country singer of the last half-century, is one of them.\xa0 Today his funeral at the music hall, the closest thing that country music has to a cathedral, will be streamed live at 11 a.m. Eastern time on the Opry’s Web site and in audio at wsmonline.com. It will also be broadcast live on several networks — CMT, GAC, RFD-TV and FamilyNet.\xa0 The service is bound to feature some good music.\xa0The lineup of performers includes Charlie Daniels, Vince Gill, Alan Jackson, Ronnie Milsap, Brad Paisley, the Oak Ridge Boys, Tanya Tucker and Wynonna.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/02/arts/02artsbeat-jones/02artsbeat-jones-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 389, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/02/arts/02artsbeat-jones/02artsbeat-jones-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 389}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/02/arts/02artsbeat-jones/02artsbeat-jones-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 664, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/02/arts/02artsbeat-jones/02artsbeat-jones-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1327, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/02/arts/02artsbeat-jones/02artsbeat-jones-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/02/arts/02artsbeat-jones/02artsbeat-jones-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/02/arts/02artsbeat-jones/02artsbeat-jones-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Country Stars’ Tribute to George Jones Streaming Online', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 