rs of a garage in TriBeCa violated safety rules by leaving exit doors locked or improperly propped open during Hurricane Sandy, according to a report.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/03/nyregion/violations-at-garage-in-tribeca-where-worker-drowned-in-hurricane-sandy.html', 'snippet': 'The owners of a garage in TriBeCa violated safety rules by leaving exit doors locked or improperly propped open during Hurricane Sandy, according to a report.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The owners of a garage in TriBeCa where a worker drowned during Hurricane Sandy violated federal safety rules by leaving exit doors locked or improperly propped open as storm waters filled the underground lot, according to a report by federal investigators.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Violations Found at Site of Garage Worker’s Drowning', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Occupational Safety and Health Administration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Narh, Anthony', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'TriBeCa (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Sandy (2012)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-02T19:04:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By J. David Goodman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'J.', 'middlename': 'David', 'lastname': 'Goodman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/43094f07-fa6d-52f3-9ea3-485c18843c5f', 'word_count': 396, 'uri': 'nyt://article/43094f07-fa6d-52f3-9ea3-485c18843c5f'}, {'abstract': 'Ways to reflect on and celebrate the end of the school year, no matter what age or level of students you teach.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/02/ideas-for-english-language-learners-celebrating-the-end-of-the-school-year/', 'snippet': 'Ways to reflect on and celebrate the end of the school year, no matter what age or level of students you teach.', 'lead_paragraph': 'School calendars are different across the nation, so while classes may be in session for another two months where you teach, in another district, it’s time for prom, awards season and commencement.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/03/education/edlife/20130203PHOTOBOOTH-slide-G7NZ-LN/20130203PHOTOBOOTH-slide-G7NZ-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/02/03/education/edlife/20130203PHOTOBOOTH-slide-G7NZ-LN/20130203PHOTOBOOTH-slide-G7NZ-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/03/education/edlife/20130203PHOTOBOOTH-slide-G7NZ-LN/20130203PHOTOBOOTH-slide-G7NZ-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/03/education/edlife/20130203PHOTOBOOTH-slide-G7NZ-LN/20130203PHOTOBOOTH-slide-G7NZ-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1536, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/03/education/edlife/20130203PHOTOBOOTH-slide-G7NZ-LN/20130203PHOTOBOOTH-slide-G7NZ-LN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', '