, {'abstract': 'James “Whitey” Bulger, the Boston mob leader set to be tried in June on a sweeping racketeering indictment, had argued that he was given immunity from prosecution for his crimes by a federal prosecutor, now dead.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/03/us/judge-rules-whitey-bulger-cant-tell-jury-he-had-immunity.html', 'snippet': 'James “Whitey” Bulger, the Boston mob leader set to be tried in June on a sweeping racketeering indictment, had argued that he was given immunity from prosecution for his crimes by a federal prosecutor, now dead.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BOSTON — A federal judge said in a ruling filed Thursday that James “Whitey” Bulger cannot tell a jury at his coming trial he had immunity from prosecution — a decision that is likely to hobble the defense strategy for the New England mob leader.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/03/us/BULGER/BULGER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 801, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/03/us/BULGER/BULGER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 801}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/03/us/BULGER/BULGER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/03/us/BULGER/BULGER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1728, 'width': 1295, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/03/us/BULGER/BULGER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'imag