7e6'}, {'abstract': 'In “Caroline and Jackie,” a surprise birthday party starts an eventful evening that includes ugly confrontations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/03/movies/caroline-and-jackie-directed-by-adam-christian-clark.html', 'snippet': 'In “Caroline and Jackie,” a surprise birthday party starts an eventful evening that includes ugly confrontations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You think your sister has come into town to celebrate her birthday over home-cooked pot roast. But no, the plan is actually a surprise early birthday party for you at a nearby restaurant. But no again, it’s actually an intervention. Your supposed anorexia, your supposed substance abuse problems, your very existence seem to be bothering the people you thought you loved.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/03/arts/03RDP_CAROLINE_SPAN/CAROLINE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 369, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/03/arts/03RDP_CAROLINE_SPAN/CAROLINE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 369}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/03/arts/03RDP_CAROLINE_SPAN/CAROLINE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 630, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/03/arts/03RDP_CAROLINE_SPAN/CAROLINE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 836, 'width': 1359, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/03/arts/03RDP_CAROLINE_SPAN/CAROLINE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'t