the Celtics can win at home on Friday night, they will be one victory from matching what their baseball brethren accomplished nearly a decade ago, as unthinkable as that feat was.', 'lead_paragraph': 'No N.B.A. team has escaped a 3-0 hole to win a best-of-seven postseason series. Then again, no major league baseball team had ever done it, either, until the Boston Red Sox ousted the Yankees in the 2004 American League Championship Series. Hmmm. Red Sox, Celtics. Yankees, Knicks. You get the point. If the Celtics can win at home on Friday night, they will be one victory from matching what their baseball brethren accomplished nearly a decade ago, as unthinkable as that feat was. So let’s review.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Nine Years Later, an Uncanny Echo', 'kicker': 'Off the Dribble', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Nine Years Later, an Uncanny Echo', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Boston Celtics', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Boston Red Sox', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Knicks', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-03T04:31:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f0249ccb-5fed-511a-9964-4d583c86d8ba', 'word_count': 486, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f0249ccb-5fed-511a-9964-4d583c86d8ba'}, {'abstract': 'The Bloomberg administration lost a legal battle to withhold a series of e-mail exchanges in 2010 between Cathleen P. Black and city officials over her appointment as schools chancellor.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/intera