certain authenticity of place.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/03/in-a-churchs-sanctuary-theater-with-a-dose-of-reality/', 'snippet': 'The Nativity Church on Second Avenue, where a revival of the play “Stand-Up Tragedy” is being staged, lends the production a certain authenticity of place.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Over the last few weeks, moments sacred and profane have played out each night in the boxy, cinderblock sanctuary of Nativity Church on Second Avenue. The altar, candles and tabernacle have been put away, replaced by a bare-bones set where the youthful cast of “Stand-Up Tragedy” confront and comfort one another under the gaze of an unblinking Christ.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/04/nyregion/03cityroom-sidestreet/03cityroom-sidestreet-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/04/nyregion/03cityroom-sidestreet/03cityroom-sidestreet-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/04/nyregion/03cityroom-sidestreet/03cityroom-sidestreet-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 615, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/04/nyregion/03cityroom-sidestreet/03cityroom-sidestreet-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1230, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/04/nyregion/03cityroom-sidestreet/03cityroom-sidestreet-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05