aterial': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/48a4cfb2-dcc4-519c-99e2-d76813bf0590', 'word_count': 557, 'uri': 'nyt://article/48a4cfb2-dcc4-519c-99e2-d76813bf0590'}, {'abstract': 'Since 1965, Vince Vespe has driven his Karmann Ghia convertible all over the United States and Mexico, and plans to keep the car until the end of his life.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/03/my-other-car-is-a-1965-volkswagen-karmann-ghia/', 'snippet': 'Since 1965, Vince Vespe has driven his Karmann Ghia convertible all over the United States and Mexico, and plans to keep the car until the end of his life.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Vince Vespe admits that dating a German woman – and perhaps hoping to make points with her father, a Volkswagen owner and aficionado – influenced his decision to buy a red, white-topped Volkswagen Karmann Ghia convertible in 1961. As it turned out, his relationship with the German car outlasted the one with the German woman.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'My Other Car Is: A 1965 Volkswagen Karmann Ghia', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Convertibles (Autos)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restoration and Renovation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Road Trips', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Volkswagen AG', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-03T16:37:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jim Koscs', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Koscs', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0b0e03a8-4a0e-5d15-bd35-653e0e002c02', 'word_count': 925, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0b0e03a8-4a0e-5d15-bd35-653e0e002c02'}, {'abstract': 'James Dobbins, a diplomat with a history of difficult assignments, will be appointed as special representative for the troubled region, an administration official said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/04/world/asia/james-dobbins-to-be-named-for-representative-for-afghanistan-and-pakistan.html', 'snippet': 'James Dobbins, a diplomat with a history of difficult assignments, will be appointed as special representative for the troubled region, an administration official said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Obama on Friday named James F. Dobbins, a veteran diplomat who oversaw the return of the United States to Afghanistan after the defeat of the Taliban in 2001, as his third special representative for Afghanistan and Pakistan, an administration official said on Friday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama Names Veteran Troubleshooter to Afghanistan-Pakistan Post', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Obama Names Diplomat for Afghanistan-Pakistan Post', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Landler, Mark', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dobbins, James F', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pakistan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diplomatic Service, Embassies and Consulates', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-03T16:42:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Landler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Landler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/93020aef-685a-5b9d-9b1c-419cda20c426', 'word_count': 292, 'uri': 'nyt://article/93020aef-685a-5b9d-9b1c-419cda20c426'}, {'abstract': 'The Metropolitan Museum of Art said new research backed up Cambodian claims that two 10th-century statues were improperly removed from the Koh Ker temple complex.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/04/arts/design/the-met-to-return-statues-to-cambodia.html', 'snippet': 'The Metropolitan Museum of Art said new research backed up Cambodian claims that two 10th-century statues were improperly removed from the Koh Ker temple complex.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Six weeks ago the Metropolitan Museum of Art sent two of its top executives to Cambodia to resolve a thorny dispute: whether two pieces of ancient Khmer art that the museum has long prominently exhibited were the product of looting.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/04/arts/04statue-1/04statue-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1185, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/04/arts/04statue-1/04statue-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1185}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/04/arts/04statue-1/04statue-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 519, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/04/arts/04statue-1/04statue-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1038, 'subType': 'superJumbo', '