'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/39e44da6-cfbe-5432-a900-9b59207f059e', 'word_count': 1296, 'uri': 'nyt://article/39e44da6-cfbe-5432-a900-9b59207f059e'}, {'abstract': 'Giant Finish, a New York-bred long shot, did not seem stressed after his late arrival, rolling in the grass and holding his head high.', 'web_url': 'https://therail.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/03/giant-finish-the-last-to-arrive-at-churchill-downs/', 'snippet': 'Giant Finish, a New York-bred long shot, did not seem stressed after his late arrival, rolling in the grass and holding his head high.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOUISVILLE, Ky. — Arriving late creates a certain amount of stress, even for a horse. So trainers go to great lengths to keep their horses calm by adhering to strict schedules and acclimating them to new surroundings. This is why some trainers bring their horses to a new track weeks in advance so that everything feels comfortable by race day. For races as important as the Kentucky Derby, this can be crucial.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Giant Finish, the Last to Arrive at Churchill Downs', 'kicker': 'The Rail', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Horse Racing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Kentucky Derby', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-03T16:52:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie June Stewart', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': 'June', 'lastname': 'Stewart', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/95472b69-e0a3-5e9d-9682-77c063010394', 'word_count': 286, 'uri': 'nyt://article/95472b69-e0a3-5e9d-9682-77c063010394'}, {'abstract': 'Shirley L. Huntley, a Queens Democrat who pleaded guilty in a corruption scandal this year, recorded officials at the direction of law enforcement, according to court papers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/04/nyregion/ex-senator-shirley-huntley-recorded-elected-officials.html', 'snippet': 'Shirley L. Huntley, a Queens Democrat who pleaded guilty in a corruption scandal this year, recorded officials at the direction of law enforcement, according to court papers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Soon after prosecutors and the Federal Bureau of Investigation revealed last month that a New York State assemblyman had been secretly making audio and video recordings for law enforcement, other legislators began nervously joking that they could never be sure who else was taping them. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/04/nyregion/Y-wired/Y-wired-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/04/nyregion/Y-wired/Y-wired-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/04/nyregion/Y-wired/Y-wired-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/04/nyregion/Y-wired/Y-wired-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1072, 'width': 1609, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/04/nyregion/Y-wired/Y-wired-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/04/nyregion/Y-wired/Y-wired-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbna