of credit derivatives, is cited in a Federal Energy Regulatory Commission document looking at the bank’s trading in the California and Michigan electricity markets.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/05/03/scrutiny-falls-on-a-pioneer-at-jpmorgan/', 'snippet': 'Blythe Masters, who helped pioneer the use of credit derivatives, is cited in a Federal Energy Regulatory Commission document looking at the bank’s trading in the California and Michigan electricity markets.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It started with a summer internship in London in 1987, when Blythe Masters first encountered derivatives. In the years since, she rose through the ranks at JPMorgan Chase to become one of the most powerful executives on Wall Street.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Scrutiny Falls on a Pioneer at JPMorgan', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Commodities', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Derivatives (Financial Instruments)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Energy and Power', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tett, Gillian', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Energy Regulatory Commission', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'JPMorgan Chase & Company', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-03T16:59:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Alden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organiz