ppet': 'A relentless multitasker, J. J. Abrams juggles directing and producing new “Star Trek” and “Star Wars” films.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SANTA MONICA, Calif. — A conversation with J. J. Abrams is more like a series of interruptions and distractions, punctuated by occasional exchanges of dialogue. The latest diversion to appear on his iPhone screen one evening in March, as he unwound here at the offices of his Bad Robot production company, was a photograph sent by his producing partner, Bryan Burk, of two tip jars side by side on a coffee-shop counter: one labeled “Star Wars,” and the other “Star Trek.”', 'print_section': 'MT', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/05/arts/05ITZKOFF_SPAN/05Itzkoff2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/05/arts/05ITZKOFF_SPAN/05Itzkoff2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/05/arts/05ITZKOFF_SPAN/05Itzkoff2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/05/arts/05ITZKOFF_SPAN/05Itzkoff2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1361, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/05/arts/05ITZKOFF_SPAN/05ITZKOFF_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/05/arts/05ITZKOFF_SPAN/05ITZKOFF_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbL