n-medical-billing-errors-weigh-on-your-credit-score/', 'snippet': 'Bucks readers discuss whether their credit scores have been hurt by medical bills.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A single collection action on your credit report can inflict significant damage to your credit score. And that’s the case whether you’re waiting for your insurance company to pay a medical bill that went to collections, or if you’ve simply decided to ignore the bill.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'When Medical Billing Errors Weigh on Your Credit Score', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'How to Heal Billing Errors', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Credit Scores', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Personal Finances', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-03T19:28:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tara Siegel Bernard', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tara', 'middlename': 'Siegel', 'lastname': 'Bernard', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1ddfbc08-c7ec-5160-9a50-26af60f73eae', 'word_count': 192, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1ddfbc08-c7ec-5160-9a50-26af60f73eae'}, {'abstract': 'Kobe Bryant is trying to stop his mother, Pamela Bryant, from auctioning off some of his memorabilia, worth an estimated $1.5 million.', 'web_url': 'https://offthedribble.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/03/bryants-latest-court-battle-trying-to-stop-his-moms-auction/', 'snippet': 'Kobe Bryant is trying to stop his mother, Pamela Bryant, from auctioning off some of his memorabilia, worth an estimated $1.5 million.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It has been no secret that Kobe Bryant’s family relationships have gone cold at times, but the latest twist might represent th