an airy, light-filled space that doubles the gallery’s square footage, with skylights, glass floors and the columns of the High Line running through, all protected by a cast concrete facade.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '303 Gallery Finds a New Home', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-05-03T20:40:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie Baumgardner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Baumgardner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7e70024b-09e0-5e4a-ac18-1f7a7783e41b', 'word_count': 397, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7e70024b-09e0-5e4a-ac18-1f7a7783e41b'}, {'abstract': 'New York State has set aside $140 million over the last year-and-a-half for a national advertising campaign. The following commercials were the initial productions of the campaign.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2013/05/03/nyregion/03cuomo-ads-new-new-york.html', 'snippet': 'New York State has set aside $140 million over the last year-and-a-half for a national advertising campaign. The following commercials were the initial productions of the campaign.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York State has set aside $140 million over the last year-and-a-half for a national advertising campaign. The following commercials were the initial productions of the campaign.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘The New New York’ Ad Campaign', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Political Advertising', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETI