 as a changed man. His words may indicate otherwise.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/04/sports/floyd-mayweather-returns-to-fight-robert-guerrero.html', 'snippet': 'The boxer Floyd Mayweather Jr., set for his first fight in a year, is described as a changed man. His words may indicate otherwise.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LAS VEGAS — Floyd Mayweather Jr. entered the MGM Grand Garden Arena flanked by camera crews and boom microphones and four bodyguards roughly the size of Fiats. Sunglasses on, cellphones in hand, he trailed them upstairs, where a series of interviews would simultaneously bolster and diminish the chosen narrative for his latest fight.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/04/sports/y-jp-mayweather/y-jp-mayweather-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 460, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/04/sports/y-jp-mayweather/y-jp-mayweather-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 460}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/04/sports/y-jp-mayweather/y-jp-mayweather-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 784, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/04/sports/y-jp-mayweather/y-jp-mayweather-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1569, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/04/sports/y-jp-mayweather/y-jp-mayweather-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/04/sports/y-jp-mayweather/y-jp-mayweather-thumbStand