fourth quarter before steadying themselves to outlast the Celtics. They clinched their first playoff series victory since 2000.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/04/sports/basketball/over-for-celtics-but-not-easy-win-for-knicks.html', 'snippet': 'The Knicks nearly gave away a 26-point lead in the fourth quarter before steadying themselves to outlast the Celtics. They clinched their first playoff series victory since 2000.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BOSTON — The wait had been long, humiliating, often torturous, and it would not end without one final jolt of stress, one last anxious sensation before the moment of exhilaration finally, mercifully arrived. Delayed gratification never felt this good.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/04/sports/basketball/04knicks2-img/04knicks2-img-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 383, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/04/sports/basketball/04knicks2-img/04knicks2-img-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 383}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/04/sports/basketball/04knicks2-img/04knicks2-img-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 654, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/04/sports/basketball/04knicks2-img/04knicks2-img-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1307, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/04/sports/basketball/04knicks2-img/04knicks2-img-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'