5f'}, {'abstract': 'Corey Johnson, who plans to run for the New York City Council, came out 13 years ago but has another disclosure to make: He’s H.I.V. positive.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/05/nyregion/the-lingering-stigma-of-hiv.html', 'snippet': 'Corey Johnson, who plans to run for the New York City Council, came out 13 years ago but has another disclosure to make: He’s H.I.V. positive.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Thirteen years ago, Corey Johnson, then an 18-year-old high school student in Middleton, Mass., the son of a truck driver and a cafeteria worker, came out about his homosexuality, and it was no small thing. The captain of his football team, Mr. Johnson also wrestled and played lacrosse and baseball. Not long after his disclosure, he was asked to speak at the Millennium March for Equality in Washington. He became the subject of a  column by Robert Lipsyte in The New York Times, which, to Mr. Johnson’s great surprise, ran on the paper’s front page on a Sunday. A certain celebrity quickly attended him. ', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/05/nyregion/05BIGCITY_SPAN/05BIGCITY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/05/nyregion/05BIGCITY_SPAN/05BIGCITY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/05/nyregion/05BIGCITY_SPAN/05BIGCITY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/05/nyregion/05BIGCITY_SPAN/05BIGCITY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/05/nyregion/05BIGCITY_SPAN/05BIGCITY_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/05/nyregion/05BIGCITY_SPAN/05BIGCITY_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/05/nyregion/05BIGCITY_SPAN/05BIGCITY_SPAN-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Out, but Not About That', 'kicker': 'Big City', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Out, but Not About That', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Corey', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Acquired Immune Deficiency Syndrome', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'City Council (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Duane, Thomas K', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-04T03:56:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ginia Bellafante', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ginia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bellafante', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1bc91a9c-436d-5854-b3b3-db4b694b5431', 'word_count': 801, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1bc91a9c-436d-5854-b3b3-db4b694b5431'}, {'abstract': 'The Celtics never led and scored only 47 points through the first three quarters, yet they still nearly managed to steal Game 6 against the Knicks with a scintillating late run.', 'w