company in Dublin, the world’s No. 2-ranked golfer has put himself in a position to build a sports empire.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/05/sports/golf/the-branding-of-rory-mcilroy.html', 'snippet': 'Thanks to a boutique management company in Dublin, the world’s No. 2-ranked golfer has put himself in a position to build a sports empire.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C. — It was time for Rory McIlroy to face the television cameras after another well-played round at the Wells Fargo Championship. Emerging Friday from the scoring area at Quail Hollow, McIlroy reached into his golf bag and slipped on an Omega Seamaster Planet Ocean watch with a blue rubber strap. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/05/sports/sub-MCILROY/sub-MCILROY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 372, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/05/sports/sub-MCILROY/sub-MCILROY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 372}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/05/sports/sub-MCILROY/sub-MCILROY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 636, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/05/sports/sub-MCILROY/sub-MCILROY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1271, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/05/sports/sub-MCILROY/sub-MCILROY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/05/sports/sub-MCILROY/sub-MCILROY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth