 may soon receive his fourth Most Valuable Player award, largely for his offensive prowess, but his defensive skills may be unmatched.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/05/sports/basketball/On-Defense-James-Is-Shining-Brightly.html', 'snippet': 'LeBron James may soon receive his fourth Most Valuable Player award, largely for his offensive prowess, but his defensive skills may be unmatched.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MILWAUKEE — The Heat were looking to sweep the Bucks last Sunday, but with about five minutes remaining in the third quarter, Miami’s lead was down to 4 points. LeBron James, irritated by his team’s lack of intensity on defense, punched the chair next to him during a timeout, inserted his mouth guard and methodically halted Milwaukee’s momentum.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/05/sports/dog-yLEBRON/dog-yLEBRON-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/05/sports/dog-yLEBRON/dog-yLEBRON-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/05/sports/dog-yLEBRON/dog-yLEBRON-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/05/sports/dog-yLEBRON/dog-yLEBRON-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/05/sports/dog-yLEBRON/dog-yLEBRON-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnai