ls Take 2-0 Series Lead Over Rangers', 'kicker': 'Game 2: Capitals 1, Rangers 0, OT', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'One Puck in Crowd and One in Net Add Up to Second Loss for Rangers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Rangers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Klein, Jeff Z', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Washington Capitals', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Green, Mike', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-04T20:05:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Z. Klein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': 'Z.', 'lastname': 'Klein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e017308b-3e85-59b2-8847-1116b9119802', 'word_count': 833, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e017308b-3e85-59b2-8847-1116b9119802'}, {'abstract': 'Eight soldiers from the American-led military coalition were killed in Afghanistan: five by a roadside bomb, two by an Afghan soldier who shot his trainers and one by small-arms fire.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/05/world/asia/blast-kills-7-soldiers-in-afghanistan.html', 'snippet': 'Eight soldiers from the American-led military coalition were killed in Afghanistan: five by a roadside bomb, two by an Afghan soldier who shot his trainers and one by small-arms fire.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KABUL, Afghanistan — Eight soldiers with the American-led military coalition were killed Saturday, making it the bloodiest day this year for Western troops fighting here.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '8 Soldiers Die in At