tside of the Syrian capital in recent days, apparently by Israeli forces, were likely to increase pressure on President Obama to offer more forceful support to the Syrian rebels.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/05/mccain-says-airstrikes-in-syria-put-pressure-on-obama-to-act/', 'snippet': 'Senator John McCain said that the two airstrikes just outside of the Syrian capital in recent days, apparently by Israeli forces, were likely to increase pressure on President Obama to offer more forceful support to the Syrian rebels.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Senator John McCain, who has long advocated for more forceful United States support of the Syrian rebels, said Sunday that the two airstrikes just outside of the Syrian capital in recent days — which the Syrian government said were carried out by Israel — were likely to increase pressure on President Obama to act.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'McCain Says Airstrikes in Syria Put Pressure on Obama to Act', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dempsey, Martin E', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'King, Peter T', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCain, John', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-05T15:47:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Knowlton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlenam