uses an early-20th-century setting and film noir imagery to emphasize not just the work’s darkness but also its strangeness.” Still, he said, Ms. Radvanovsky was “splendid,” and Mr. Hvorostovsky sang “with his trademark dark sound and supple phrasing, which poignantly brought to life this suffering husband’s love.”', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on Sunday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On Sunday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-05-05T16:50:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Shattuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shattuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/871a981e-99f2-5ffc-bf75-9fea3579c22e', 'word_count': 675, 'uri': 'nyt://article/871a981e-99f2-5ffc-bf75-9fea3579c22e'}, {'abstract': 'The Environmental Protection Agency’s $500 million proposal to clean the Gowanus Canal has worried Brooklyn residents about the effects on the air and a beloved swimming pool.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/06/nyregion/epa-plan-to-clean-up-gowanus-canal-meets-local-resistance.html', 'snippet': 'The Environmental Protection Agency’s $500 million proposal to clean the Gowanus Canal has worried Brooklyn residents about the effects on the air and a beloved swimming pool.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Almost everybody wants the Gowanus Canal cleansed of its toxic gunk.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/06/nyregion/06gowanus_1/06gowanus_1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 3