 Kern have made of Woodstock? That question was asked but not answered on Saturday evening at the 92nd Street Y by Deborah Grace Winer, the artistic director of the venerable Lyrics and Lyricists series, in the opening-night concert of its season’s second-to-last program. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Honoring Songbook’s Dean', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Honoring Songbook’s Dean', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kern, Jerome', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-05T21:56:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephen Holden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Holden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/00a00577-2976-548e-b965-993713c652ca', 'word_count': 366, 'uri': 'nyt://article/00a00577-2976-548e-b965-993713c652ca'}, {'abstract': 'Starter Andy Pettitte allowed four walks, his highest total since 2010, and Josh Donaldson’s home run against reliever Boone Logan gave the A’s a victory.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/06/sports/baseball/athletics-edge-yankees-as-andy-pettitte-struggles-again.html', 'snippet': 'Starter Andy Pettitte allowed four walks, his highest total since 2010, and Josh Donaldson’s home run against reliever Boone Logan gave the A’s a victory.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After more than 18 seasons in the major leagues, Yankees starter Andy Pettitte knows what the ball is supposed to feel like once it leaves his hand. There is a certain subtlety that makes it difficult for him to explain the feeling, but he knows by touch. He knows almost immediately after he throws a pitch how it will arrive at home plate without even seeing it land in the catcher’s mitt.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/06/sports/baseball/06yankees-pic/06yankees-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 458, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/06/sports/baseball/06yankees-pic/06yankees-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 458}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/06/sports/baseball/06yankees-pic/06yankees-pic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 782, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/06/sports/baseball/06yankees-pic/06yankees-pic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1564, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/06/sports/baseball/06yankees-pic/06yankees-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/06/sports/baseball/06yankees-pic/06yankees-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/06/sports/baseball/06yankees-pic/06yankees-pic-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'With Pettitte Missing His Touch, Yankees Fall to Athletics', 'kicker': 'Athletics 5, Yankees 4', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With Pettitte Missi