ks struggled on offense against the Pacers’ aggressive, physical defense in Game 1.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/06/sports/basketball/with-aggressive-defense-pacers-shut-down-knicks.html', 'snippet': 'Indiana led for the entire second half, by as many as 16 points, as the Knicks struggled on offense against the Pacers’ aggressive, physical defense in Game 1.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The challenge necessarily grows bigger as the N.B.A. playoffs progress, and the Knicks are a seasoned enough group to understand this basic truth. It was, however, not the size of the challenge but the actual size of the players standing in their path that put the first real crimp in the Knicks’ postseason thrill ride.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/06/sports/basketball/06knicks3-img/06knicks3-img-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 389, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/06/sports/basketball/06knicks3-img/06knicks3-img-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 389}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/06/sports/basketball/06knicks3-img/06knicks3-img-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 665, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/06/sports/basketball/06knicks3-img/06knicks3-img-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1329, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/06/sports/basketball/06knicks3-img/06knicks3-img-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'le