ement backgrounds.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/05/05/a-call-for-new-blood-on-the-jpmorgan-board/', 'snippet': 'Institutional Shareholder Services says three directors on the risk policy committee lack risk management backgrounds.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An influential shareholder advisory firm has recommended that investors withhold their support for three JPMorgan Chase directors, citing “material failures of stewardship and risk oversight” in the wake of a big trading loss last year.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Call for New Blood on the JPMorgan Board', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Call for New Blood On the JPMorgan Board', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Boards of Directors', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shareholder Rights and Activism', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cote, David M', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Crown, James S', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dimon, James', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Flynn, Timothy P', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Futter, Ellen V', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Institutional Shareholder Services Inc', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'JPMorgan Chase & Company', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-05T23:27:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Susanne Craig and Jessica Silver-Greenberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Susanne', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Craig', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Jessica', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Silver-Greenberg', 'qualifier':