, 'word_count': 947, 'uri': 'nyt://article/096c4ae8-c030-574f-b3a0-b481f4dd67df'}, {'abstract': 'The Knicks had trouble fending off the Pacers’ Roy Hibbert, who dominated inside and limited the shooting of Carmelo Anthony.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/06/sports/basketball/knicks-have-trouble-fending-off-pacers-roy-hibbert.html', 'snippet': 'The Knicks had trouble fending off the Pacers’ Roy Hibbert, who dominated inside and limited the shooting of Carmelo Anthony.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Knicks tried to challenge Roy Hibbert from every angle. J. R. Smith tried to drive past him. Tyson Chandler attempted to go above him for rebounds. Carmelo Anthony, his jump shot inconsistent, at one point tried to dunk over Hibbert. But Hibbert, the Indiana Pacers’ 7-foot-2 center, stood his ground. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/06/sports/GARDEN/GARDEN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/06/sports/GARDEN/GARDEN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/06/sports/GARDEN/GARDEN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/06/sports/GARDEN/GARDEN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/06/sports/GARDEN/GARDEN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images