ct': 'Judy Battista, the N.F.L. reporter for The Times, will answer questions from readers.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/06/have-an-n-f-l-question-judy-battista-has-answers-8/', 'snippet': 'Judy Battista, the N.F.L. reporter for The Times, will answer questions from readers.', 'lead_paragraph': '10:57 a.m. | Updated How good is No. 1 pick Eric Fisher? Was Geno Smith selected too early–or too late? Which teams had the best drafts (and which teams the worst)? Judy Battista, the N.F.L. reporter for The Times, will answer questions from readers this week. Put your question in the Comments section below, and answers will appear on The Fifth Down.Comments for this feature have been closed. Answers will appear Monday on The Fifth Down.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Have an N.F.L. Question? Judy Battista Has Answers', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Draft and Recruitment (Sports)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fisher, Eric', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, Geno', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Football League', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-06T15:47:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9333debb-ff35-5a0e-9326-c55fa5f51ead', 'word_count': 76, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9333debb-ff35-5a0e-9326-c55fa5f51ead'}, {'abstract': 'Read the full indictment of John L. Sampson on embezzlement charges.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2013/05/07/nyregion/07sampson-document.ht