e in employment rates for adults 25 to 34 years old. Whereas the United States had perhaps the highest employment rate for this age group among large, wealthy economies in 2012, it has one of the lowest today.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Where the Jobs for the Young Are and Aren’t', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'States (US)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Unemployment', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-06T17:57:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Leonhardt', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Leonhardt', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/edd1ce27-6759-5593-a079-eb8672c44be5', 'word_count': 448, 'uri': 'nyt://article/edd1ce27-6759-5593-a079-eb8672c44be5'}, {'abstract': 'China was on vacation much of last week for the May 1 Worker’s Day holiday, but executives at two of China’s most important online companies were busy completing a deal that may reshape the country’s Internet.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/05/06/chinas-changing-internet-landscape/', 'snippet': 'China was on vacation much of last week for the May 1 Worker’s Day holiday, but executives at two of China’s most important online companies were busy completing a deal that may reshape the country’s Internet.', 'lead_paragraph': 'China was on vacation much of last week for the May 1 Worker’s Day holiday, but executives at two of China’s most important online companies we