/article/8a3833eb-d13b-5907-bf37-88dbd1775c7c', 'word_count': 1129, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8a3833eb-d13b-5907-bf37-88dbd1775c7c'}, {'abstract': 'The Kronos Quartet played its last show at Carnegie Hall with Jeffrey Zeigler as part of the ensemble.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/07/arts/music/kronos-quartet-at-carnegie-hall.html', 'snippet': 'The Kronos Quartet played its last show at Carnegie Hall with Jeffrey Zeigler as part of the ensemble.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Kronos Quartet took to the stage of a sold-out Zankel Hall on Friday evening with what would be its last Carnegie Hall performance with Jeffrey Zeigler, its cellist of eight years who will leave this month. As the ensemble celebrates 40 years of blazing trails in the string-quartet repertory, it was appropriate that the program was largely about looking back. Just as appropriately, it was entirely made up of new music.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/07/arts/subkronos/subkronos-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 788, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/07/arts/subkronos/subkronos-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 788}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/07/arts/subkronos/subkronos-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 780, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/07/arts/subkronos/subkronos-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1560, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/07/arts/subkronos/subkronos-thumbStandard.jpg', 