na Pacers, when he suddenly revealed a new weapon in his arsenal of offensive moves. After hardly ever having attempted the shot in his career, James began deftly dropping in 12-foot running floaters over the outstretched arms of Roy Hibbert, the Pacers’ 7-foot-2 center.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/07/sports/07dribble/07dribble-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 457, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/07/sports/07dribble/07dribble-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 457}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/07/sports/07dribble/07dribble-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 781, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/07/sports/07dribble/07dribble-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1561, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/07/sports/07dribble/07dribble-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/07/sports/07dribble/07dribble-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/07/sports/07dribble/07dribble-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Needing to Solve Pacers’ Big Man in the Middle', 'kicker': 'Off the Dribble', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ne