novation.html', 'snippet': 'A cautionary tale about home renovation based on the popular children’s book “If You Give a Mouse a Cookie.”', 'lead_paragraph': '“If You Give a Mouse a Cookie,” the popular children’s story about a demanding rodent, has given rise to more than a dozen sequels and now one architectural parody. Described as a “house-warning gift” by its author, Seth Kaufman, “If You Give an Architect a Contract” (Sukuma Books) adapts the style of Laura Joffe Numeroff’s 1985 illustrated classic in presenting a series of anxiety-provoking hypothetical statements about home renovation.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/06/garden/06books/06books-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 675, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/06/garden/06books/06books-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 675}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/06/garden/06books/06books-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 911, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/06/garden/06books/06books-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1821, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/06/garden/06books/06books-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/06/garden/06books/06books-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/06/garden/06books/06books-thumbLarge