 deficit in coming decades.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/06/estimate-of-immigration-overhauls-cost-gets-mixed-reviews-on-right/', 'snippet': 'A Heritage Foundation study predicted that a proposal now in the Senate would vastly increase the government deficit in coming decades.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A researcher whose fiscal calculations have provided crucial support in the past for conservative opponents of an immigration overhaul released a report on Monday, predicting that a proposal now in the Senate would vastly increase the government deficit in coming decades. But this year the estimates, by Robert Rector of the Heritage Foundation, have received decidedly mixed reviews from conservatives. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Estimate of Immigration Overhaul’s Cost Gets Mixed Reviews on Right', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Budget (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Barbour, Haley', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Norquist, Grover G', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rector, Robert', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Heritage Foundation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-06T23:37:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julia Preston', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Preston', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ae88db51-c1b5-5188-9aa0-c212ae8d94c6', 'word_count': 561, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ae88db51-c1b5-5188-9aa0-c212ae8d94c6'}, {'abstract': 'Two broken elevators in the Metropolitan Correctional Center delayed sentencing for Mansour J. Arbabsiar, who took part in a plot to assassinate the Saudi ambassador to the United States.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/07/nyregion/broken-elevators-separate-lawyers-and-clients-at-jail.html', 'snippet': 'Two broken elevators in the Metropolitan Correctional Center delayed sentencing for Mansour J. Arbabsiar, who took part in a plot to assassinate the Saudi ambassador to the United States.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are all sorts of reasons, legitimate and otherwise, why a trial or court proceeding might be delayed. But seldom does a high-profile sentencing in Manhattan get waylaid by something so mundane: a broken elevator.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jail’s Broken Elevators Delay High-Profile Sentencing', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jail’s Broken Elevators Delay High-Profile Sentencing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metropolitan Correctional Center (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elevators and Escalators', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Arbabsiar, Mansour J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sentences (Criminal)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Assassinations and Attempted Assassinations', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Bureau of Prisons', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prisons and Prisoners', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Saudi Arabia', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-06T23:47:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New