 bible of mental disorders is released, the federal government’s most prominent psychiatric expert said it had a scientific “lack of validity.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/07/health/psychiatrys-new-guide-falls-short-experts-say.html', 'snippet': 'Weeks before a new edition of the so-called bible of mental disorders is released, the federal government’s most prominent psychiatric expert said it had a scientific “lack of validity.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Just weeks before the long-awaited publication of a new edition of the so-called bible of mental disorders, the federal government’s most prominent psychiatric expert has said the book suffers from a scientific “lack of validity.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Psychiatry’s Guide Is Out of Touch With Science, Experts Say', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Psychiatry’s New Guide Falls Short, Experts Say', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders (Book)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Belluck, Pam', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mental Health and Disorders', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carey, Benedict', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Psychiatry and Psychiatrists', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Insel, Thomas R', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Institute of Mental Health', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN PSYCHIATRIC ASSN', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kupfer, David J', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-07T01:09:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Pam Belluck and Benedict Carey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Pam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Belluck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Benedict', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/611ac5f5-b458-5b9f-89be-eeafe52034e0', 'word_count': 1005, 'uri': 'nyt://article/611ac5f5-b458-5b9f-89be-eeafe52034e0'}, {'abstract': 'Prone to losing things on the road, Michael Gross, chief executive of the Morgans Hotel Group, once lost his wedding ring. He has a tighter one now.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/07/business/a-succession-of-items-lost-in-transit.html', 'snippet': 'Prone to losing things on the road, Michael Gross, chief executive of the Morgans Hotel Group, once lost his wedding ring. He has a tighter one now.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MY family traveled a lot when I was growing up, and one of the more memorable trips was to Tanzania. We went on this amazing safari, and I don’t know if it was the jet lag or just some bad curry, but I convinced myself that I had caught malaria. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/07/business/Flier/Flier-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 528, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/07/business/Flier/Flier-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 528}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/07/business/Flier/Flier-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 901, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'c