.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s On Tuesday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On Today', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-05-07T05:00:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Shattuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shattuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/dd25608b-d84f-5d5f-a13f-0ff936413034', 'word_count': 673, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dd25608b-d84f-5d5f-a13f-0ff936413034'}, {'abstract': 'Only now am I starting to see Mom as someone other than my mother, and the older I get the more right she is.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/07/booming/a-night-of-karaoke-and-moms-in-the-lead.html', 'snippet': 'Only now am I starting to see Mom as someone other than my mother, and the older I get the more right she is.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was my husband’s first trip to my hometown of Snellville, Ga., and to ensure that we’d return, my mother was determined to show us a good time.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/07/booming/07children-booming-mom/07children-booming-mom-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 449, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/07/booming/07children-booming-mom/07children-booming-mom-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 449}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/07/booming/07children-booming-mom/07children-booming-mom-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 66