t': 127, 'uri': 'nyt://article/26e15f63-46f3-5128-a133-de00188d22e6'}, {'abstract': 'Built from 1967 to 1970, the 2000 GT is Toyota’s E-Type. This one sold for nearly $1.2 million a couple of weekends ago.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/07/after-auction-the-1967-2000-gt-is-now-the-most-expensive-toyota-in-history/', 'snippet': 'Built from 1967 to 1970, the 2000 GT is Toyota’s E-Type. This one sold for nearly $1.2 million a couple of weekends ago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It received little more than passing mention in the Lavishly Expensive Roadster Edition of Wheelies, but something significant happened a couple of weekends ago. It wasn’t earth shattering, but it was noteworthy: RM Auctions sold a 1967 Toyota 2000 GT for nearly $1.2 million. It ended up being one of the higher priced cars in a batch that included Ferraris, Porsches and one-off concept cars like a 1954 Chrysler GS-1 Special that sold for $616,000.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'After Auction, the 1967 2000 GT Is Now the Most Expensive Toyota in History', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Antique and Classic Cars', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'RM Auctions', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Toyota Motor Corporation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-07T15:35:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Preston', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Preston', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0743c028-ebb3-5f63-8b4a-764a427441a5', 'word_count': 405, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0743c028-ebb3-5f63-8b4a-764a427441a5'}, {'abstract': 'Adolfo Carrión Jr., a former Bronx borough president of Puerto Rican descent, is seeking to become New York’s first Latino mayor, though John Purroy Mitchel has roots in Latin America.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/07/candidate-hoping-to-be-first-hispanic-mayor-may-be-100-years-too-late/', 'snippet': 'Adolfo Carrión Jr., a former Bronx borough president of Puerto Rican descent, is seeking to become New York’s first Latino mayor, though John Purroy Mitchel has roots in Latin America.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The demography of the New York City mayoral campaign may already have shifted under at least one candidate’s prospective feat, even before November, when Adolfo Carrión Jr. hopes to be elected the city’s first Hispanic mayor. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/08/nyregion/07cityroom-mitchel/07cityroom-mitchel-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 896, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/08/nyregion/07cityroom-mitchel/07cityroom-mitchel-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 896}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/08/nyregion/07cityroom-mitchel/07cityroom-mitchel-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 686, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/08/nyregion/07cityroom-mitchel/07cityroom-mitchel-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1372, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/08/nyregion/07cityroom-mitchel/07cityroom-mitchel-thumbStandard.jpg', 'h