signed by several artists.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/07/garden/bernardauds-new-collection-of-tableware.html', 'snippet': 'The French porcelain manufacturer celebrates its 150th anniversary with tableware designed by several artists.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To celebrate its 150th anniversary, the French porcelain manufacturer Bernardaud has created a collection of tableware designed by several artists, including Sophie Calle, Jeff Koons and David Lynch. “We’ve always worked with the world of creators, whether they’re artists or designers,” said Michel Bernardaud, the company’s chairman. “But this year, we decided to put a special emphasis on this relationship.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/07/garden/07CURRENTS_GOODS/07CURRENTS_GOODS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/07/garden/07CURRENTS_GOODS/07CURRENTS_GOODS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/07/garden/07CURRENTS_GOODS/07CURRENTS_GOODS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/07/garden/07CURRENTS_GOODS/07CURRENTS_GOODS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/07/garden/07CURRENTS_GOODS/07CURRENTS_GOODS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/07/garden/07CURRENTS_GOODS/07CURRENTS_GOODS-thumbStandard.jpg'