 next week, reviving efforts to pass the once-every-five-years spending bill that sets the nation’s food and farm policy. The last farm bill was passed in 2008.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/07/congress-set-to-begin-work-on-farm-bill/', 'snippet': 'The Senate Agriculture Committee announced Tuesday that it would begin working on a new farm bill next week, reviving efforts to pass the once-every-five-years spending bill that sets the nation’s food and farm policy. The last farm bill was passe...', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Senate Agriculture Committee announced on Tuesday that it would begin working on a new farm bill next week, reviving efforts to pass the once-every-five-years spending bill that sets the nation’s food and farm policy. The last farm bill was passed in 2008.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Congress Set to Begin Work on Farm Bill', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Agriculture and Farming', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Farm Bill (US)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cantor, Eric', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lucas, Frank D', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-07T17:55:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ron Nixon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ron', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nixon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6a50e2cb-9947-5fb0-b953-82c82571c867', 'word_count': 424, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6a50e2cb-9947-5fb0-b953-82c82571c867'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Jones will return to the theater’s Off Broadway stage next spring in a new drama by Sarah Treem, “When We Were Young and Unafraid.”', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/07/cherry-jones-to-return-to-manhattan-theater-club-in-new-play/', 'snippet': 'Ms. Jones will return to the theater’s Off Broadway stage next spring in a new drama by Sarah Treem, “When We Were Young and Unafraid.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'The two-time Tony Award winner Cherry Jones will return to Manhattan Theater Club next spring to star in a new drama by Sarah Treem, “When We Were Young and Unafraid,” playing a woman in the early 1970s who turns her bed and breakfast into a refuge for women in need. It will be the first time Ms. Jones has acted on Manhattan Theater Club’s Off Broadway stage since her critically acclaimed, Tony-winning performance as Sister Aloysius in John Patrick Shanley’s play “Doubt,” which began there in 2004 before moving to Broadway a few months later.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/08/arts/08artsbeat-cherry/08artsbeat-cherry-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 856, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/08/arts/08artsbeat-cherry/08artsbeat-cherry-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 856}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/08/arts/08artsbeat-cherry/08artsbeat-cherry-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 718, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/20