e}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/74c70ce7-9a54-5f8f-a677-62eeebcfd7da', 'word_count': 892, 'uri': 'nyt://article/74c70ce7-9a54-5f8f-a677-62eeebcfd7da'}, {'abstract': 'John Tomic was charged with assaulting the hitting partner of his son, Bernard, in Madrid last week, an accusation he has disputed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/08/sports/tennis/john-tomic-barred-from-receiving-credentials-for-atp-events.html', 'snippet': 'John Tomic was charged with assaulting the hitting partner of his son, Bernard, in Madrid last week, an accusation he has disputed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The ATP, the governing body of the men’s tennis Tour, announced Tuesday that it had barred John Tomic, the coach and father of the rising Australian player Bernard Tomic, from receiving credentials at all of its events until further notice.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/08/sports/08tennis/08tennis-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 475, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/08/sports/08tennis/08tennis-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 475}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/08/sports/08tennis/08tennis-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 810, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/08/sports/08tennis/08tennis-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1621, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/08/sports/08tennis/08tennis-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', '