': 'In 2005, Kidnap Suspect’s Daughter Spoke of Seeing Her Friend for the Last Time', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Kidnapping', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Castro, Ariel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'DeJesus, Gina', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-08T00:11:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Preston', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Preston', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8ae011a2-c0cb-50d3-9767-683c585b21f7', 'word_count': 393, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8ae011a2-c0cb-50d3-9767-683c585b21f7'}, {'abstract': 'Five years ago Brandt Snedeker was in somewhat the same position as Tiger Woods was at this year’s Masters, when a fan called in to say he had broken a tour rule.', 'web_url': 'https://onpar.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/07/snedeker-not-a-fan-of-fans-having-a-say-in-policing-players/', 'snippet': 'Five years ago Brandt Snedeker was in somewhat the same position as Tiger Woods was at this year’s Masters, when a fan called in to say he had broken a tour rule.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PONTE VEDRA BEACH, Fla. — Five years before a television viewer flagged Tiger Woods for a violation at the Masters, Brandt Snedeker was summoned to a Saturday meeting of the rules committee at Augusta National, same as Woods last month, to explain something they said raised a red flag after his Friday round. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Snedeker Not a Fan of Fans Having a Say in Policing Players', 'kicker': 'On Par', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'