hanges announced Wednesday by the dominant Conservatives followed sharp gains in local elections last week by a populist party that wants to curb migration.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/09/world/europe/britain-urges-tougher-immigration-laws.html', 'snippet': 'The proposed changes announced Wednesday by the dominant Conservatives followed sharp gains in local elections last week by a populist party that wants to curb migration.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Britain moved to toughen immigration rules on Wednesday as the government tried to regain the initiative after recent electoral gains by a populist party that wants the country to curb immigration and leave the European Union.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'British Government Moves to Toughen Rules on Immigrants', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'British Government Moves to Toughen Rules on Immigrants', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Castle, Stephen', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Conservative Party (Great Britain)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Kingdom Independence Party', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cameron, David', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Elizabeth II, Queen of Great Britain', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-08T11:49:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephen Castle', 'per