re. The joint venture suggests one tactical response to the pressures now facing the record business, especially in and around the jazz field.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Blue Note to Partner With ArtistShare', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crowdfunding (Internet)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hodge, Derrick', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'James, Jose', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lundvall, Bruce', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schneider, Maria', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Blue Note Records', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kickstarter', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-08T12:00:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nate Chinen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chinen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c9bb4e27-8d8b-5056-8e95-ef49b099b1d2', 'word_count': 330, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c9bb4e27-8d8b-5056-8e95-ef49b099b1d2'}, {'abstract': '“Modern Vampires of the City,” Vampire Weekend’s new album, often turns the group’s music inside out.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/12/arts/music/vampire-weekends-evolution-in-modern-vampires-of-the-city.html', 'snippet': '“Modern Vampires of the City,” Vampire Weekend’s new album, often turns the group’s music inside out.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Are we symmetrical?” asked Rostam Batmanglij. It was the kind of question — concise, mathematical, a little nerdy, a little tense — that might be expected from the keyboardist of Vampire Weekend, a band that packs complex ideas into twisted pop songs.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/12/arts/12VAMPIRE1_SPAN/12VAMPIRE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/12/arts/12VAMPIRE1_SPAN/12VAMPIRE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/12/arts/12VAMPIRE1_SPAN/12VAMPIRE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/12/arts/12VAMPIRE1_SPAN/12VAMPIRE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/12/arts/12VAMPIRE1_SPAN/12VAMPIRE1_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/12/arts/12VAMPIRE1_SPAN/12VAMPIRE1_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/12/arts/12VAMPIRE1_SPAN/12VAMPIRE1_SPAN-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Setting Their Sights on Wider Vistas', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Setting Their Sights on Wider Vistas', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank