'nyt://article/c726a05d-7976-5187-9b26-512730d81234', 'word_count': 405, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c726a05d-7976-5187-9b26-512730d81234'}, {'abstract': 'Shares of Manchester United, which went public in New York last year, fell after Alex Ferguson announced his retirement as manager of the English soccer team.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/05/08/manchester-united-investors-see-risk-in-managers-exit/', 'snippet': 'Shares of Manchester United, which went public in New York last year, fell after Alex Ferguson announced his retirement as manager of the English soccer team.', 'lead_paragraph': '5:37 p.m. | Updated LONDON – When a successful chief executive finally bows out, investors often fret that his replacement won’t be able to replicate past glories.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Manchester United Investors See Risk in Manager’s Exit', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Initial Public Offerings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ferguson, Alex', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'English Premier League', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Manchester United (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Stock Exchange', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-08T14:51:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Scott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Scott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a357ab5f-e37f-5ff1-b551-72b21f461194', 'word_count': 435, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a357ab5f-e37f-5ff1-b551-72b21f461194'}, {'abstract': 'As many racing fans look forward to the classics, some of us like to look back, preoccupied as much with racing heroes of the past like Harry Bassett and Colin as we are with who will win the big races in 2013.', 'web_url': 'https://therail.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/08/a-love-of-history-and-horses/', 'snippet': 'As many racing fans look forward to the classics, some of us like to look back, preoccupied as much with racing heroes of the past like Harry Bassett and Colin as we are with who will win the big races in 2013.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As many racing fans look forward to the classics, some of us like to look back, preoccupied as much with racing heroes of the past like Harry Bassett and Colin as we are with who will win the big races in 2013. Annie Johnson is one of these people. She runs the Web site Antebellum Turf Times, which looks like a vintage racing broadsheet and contains features such as “How To Catch A Wild Turkey, Circa 1831″ — and the 1845 Constitution of the Adams County, Mississippi, Jockey Club. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Love of History and Horses', 'kicker': 'The Rail', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Horse Racing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-08T14:53:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eliza McGraw', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eliza', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McGraw', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c98168b5-9d4d-54cf-8b34-2c8a69a322dc', 'word_count': 664, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c98168b5-9d4d-54cf-8b34-2c8a69a322dc'}, {'abstract': 'Airbnb added identity verification to its site last month.', 'web_url': 'https://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/08/who-you-say-you-are/', 'snippet': 'Airbnb added identity verification to its site last month.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ever think twice about using Airbnb, the Web site for short-term home and apartment stays, for fear the traveler or host could be posing under a false name to run a Nigerian prince-style scheme on you? To put your mind at ease, Airbnb added identity verification last month to its site so you can be sure the person you’re e-mailing is who he says he is. Users can upload a photo of their driver’s license or passport and confirm personal historical data about themselves, and Airbnb will compare that information with their Facebook or LinkedIn profiles or Airbnb reviews to verify their backgrounds.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Who You Say You Are', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lodging: Who You Say You Are', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Airbnb', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-08T15:00:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Emily Brennan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emily', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brennan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8ace07b2-c0ea-503d-9c95-fe7f2b88a9f1', 'word_count': 103, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8ace07b2-c0ea-503d-9c95-fe7f2b88a9f1'}, {'abstract': 'The former adviser, Vladislav Y. Surkov, had coined the phrase “sovereign democracy” to describe the new Russian system, with popular but closely manipulated elections.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/09/world/europe/vladislav-surkov-putins-domestic-policy-aide-is-ousted.html', 'snippet': 'The former adviser, Vladislav Y. Surkov, had coined the phrase “sovereign democracy” to describe the new Russian system, with popular but closely manipulated elections.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOSCOW — The Kremlin on Wednesday announced the resignation of Vladislav Y. Surkov, in recent years a close aide to Prime Minister Dmitri A. Medvedev and one of the architects of Russia’s highly centralized political system, now under strain from protests and a slowing economy.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/world/europe/altmoscow/altmoscow-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 840, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/09/world/europe/altmoscow/altmoscow-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 840}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/world/europe/altmoscow/altmoscow-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 732, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/world/europe/altmoscow/altmoscow-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1463, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/world/europe/altmoscow/altmoscow-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/09/world/europe/altmoscow/altmoscow-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/world/europe/altmoscow/altmoscow-thumbLarge.