 the plan in Game 1.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Knicks’ offense may rise and fall with their 3-point shooting, but their attack is a straightforward mix of efficient pick-and-rolls and wing isolations for Carmelo Anthony. As the team proved in the regular season, its personnel and style are suited for high scoring. With Anthony at power forward and relatively unathletic players on the perimeter, however, defending requires a bit of smoke and mirrors.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/sports/DRIBBLE/DRIBBLE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 739, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/09/sports/DRIBBLE/DRIBBLE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 739}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/sports/DRIBBLE/DRIBBLE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 832, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/sports/DRIBBLE/DRIBBLE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1663, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/sports/DRIBBLE/DRIBBLE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/09/sports/DRIBBLE/DRIBBLE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/sports/DRIBBLE/DRIBBLE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], '