nue to turn out at much lower rates than other groups, and that women turn out at higher rates than men.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The turnout rate of black voters surpassed the rate for whites for the first time on record in 2012, as more black voters went to the polls than in 2008 and fewer whites did, according to a Census Bureau report released Wednesday. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For First Time on Record, Black Voting Rate Outpaced Rate for Whites in 2012', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For First Time on Record, Black Voting Rate Outpaced Rate for Whites in 2012', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wheaton, Sarah', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voting and Voters', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Census', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-08T20:57:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sarah Wheaton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sarah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wheaton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1d0b5547-c1d1-5406-9b65-0b530668ddd1', 'word_count': 757, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1d0b5547-c1d1-5406-9b65-0b530668ddd1'}, {'abstract': 'Prudence in using your phone can help thwart thieves, and there are ways to protect your information in the event the phone is stolen.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/09/technology/personaltech/outsmarting-smartphone-thieves.html', 'snippet': 'Prudence in using your phone can help thwart thieves, and there are ways to protect your information in the event the phone is stolen.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN FRANCISCO — In the month since two men violently shoved him to the ground and stole his iPhone 5, Dalton Huckaby has almost completely stopped calling his mother. It usually takes him a full day to text his friends back. Nothing personal, but Mr. Huckaby is just too frightened to take his replacement iPhone out in public.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/business/TOOLKIT/TOOLKIT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/09/business/TOOLKIT/TOOLKIT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 683}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/business/TOOLKIT/TOOLKIT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 899, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/business/TOOLKIT/TOOLKIT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1798, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/business/TOOLKIT/TOOLKIT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/09/business/TOOLKIT/TOOLKIT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/business/TOOLKIT/TOOLKIT-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType