: 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/550a7b6f-f1c9-5467-8595-e2b177d9b911', 'word_count': 988, 'uri': 'nyt://article/550a7b6f-f1c9-5467-8595-e2b177d9b911'}, {'abstract': 'The 17-year-old Utah soccer goalie accused of punching a referee who later died was charged on Wednesday and could face five years in prison if convicted.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/09/sports/teenager-charged-with-homicide-by-assault-in-referees-death.html', 'snippet': 'The 17-year-old Utah soccer goalie accused of punching a referee who later died was charged on Wednesday and could face five years in prison if convicted.', 'lead_paragraph': '\xa0The 17-year-old Utah soccer player accused of punching a referee who later died was charged Wednesday with homicide by assault, a charge that could carry a penalty of up to five years in prison if he is convicted.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Teenager Charged With Homicide by Assault in Referee’s Death', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Charge in Referee’s Death', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Borden, Sam', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Officiating (Sports)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Assaults', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Utah', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Portillo, Ricardo', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Salt Lake City (Utah)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-08T21:14:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Borden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Borden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/80e9ca31-8e2d-5040-9ce0-d1e58184efe6', 'word_count': 316, 'uri': 'nyt://article/80e9ca31-8e2d-5040-9ce0-d1e58184efe6'}, {'abstract': 'An Amherst computer scientist hired by D-Wave Systems found that one of its computers, said to be using quantum properties, achieved speeds 3,600 times that of a conventional computer in one test. But for theorists, questions remain.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/08/a-quantum-computer-aces-its-test/', 'snippet': 'An Amherst computer scientist hired by D-Wave Systems found that one of its computers, said to be using quantum properties, achieved speeds 3,600 times that of a conventional computer in one test. But for theorists, questions remain.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The long-sought quantum computer, a machine potentially far ahead of today’s best supercomputers, is almost as hard to define as it is to build. For at least a few particular uses, however, the unusual computer made by D-Wave Systems now seems to be very fast indeed.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/08/business/08bits-quantum/QUANTUM2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 929, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/08/business/08bits-quantum/QUANTUM2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 929}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/08/business/08bits-quantum/QUANTUM2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 662, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/08/business/08bits-quantum/QUANTUM2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width