th vote. Black voters turned out at a higher rate than any other group in 2012, passing whites for the first time on record.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2013/05/08/us/politics/a-shifting-electorate.html', 'snippet': 'The overall turnout rate fell by nearly two percentage points from the 2008 to 2012 election, driven in part by a large drop in the youth vote. Black voters turned out at a higher rate than any other group in 2012, passing whites for the first tim...', 'lead_paragraph': 'The overall turnout rate fell by nearly two percentage points from the 2008 to 2012 election, driven in part by a large drop in the youth vote. Black voters turned out at a higher rate than any other group in 2012, passing whites for the first time on record.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Shifting Electorate', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voting and Voters', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-08T21:25:29+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'U.S.', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/1a2c8a95-d756-5c79-8eb2-2e8e51076042', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/1a2c8a95-d756-5c79-8eb2-2e8e51076042'}, {'abstract': 'Kenny Chesney has his seventh No. 1 album on the Billboard 200 chart as “Life on a Rock” sold 153,000 copies in its first week.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/08/chesney-tops-album-chart/', 'snippet': 'Kenny Chesney has his seventh No. 1 album on the Billboard 200 chart as “Life on a Rock” sold 153,000 copies in its first week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Kenny Chesney has his seventh No. 1 album on the Billboard 200 chart as “Life on a Rock” sold 153,000 copies in its first week, according to Nielsen SoundScan. Garth Brooks is the only country act with more No. 1 songs on the chart, with eight. Last week’s No. 1, Michael Bublé’s “To Be Loved,” slipped to No. 2 in its second week, with 96,000 in sales. Justin Timberlake’s “20/20 Experience” holds at No. 3 with 68,000. Fantasia’s “Side Effects of You” was No. 4 in its second week, with 36,000, while “The Heist,” from Macklemore & Ryan Lewis, rose from No. 11 to No. 5, with 35,000.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Chesney Tops Album Chart', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Chesney Conquers Chart', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chesney, Kenny', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-08T21:27:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By James C. McKinley Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'McKinley', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4d71554a-935d-56c2-9d26-d143df9baace', 'word_count': 329, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4d71554a-935d-56c2-9d26-d143df9baace'}, {'abstract': 'A look at the visual effects process for creating Tony Stark’s suits in “Iron Man 3.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2013/05/08/movies/iron-man-suits.html', 'snippet': 'A look at the visual effects process for creating Tony Stark’s suits in “Iron Man 3.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'A look at the visual effects process for creating Tony Stark’s suits in “Iron Man 3.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url'