 'Forty years after opening its first showroom in Manhattan, the French furniture company is back with a second.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/09/garden/roche-bobois-opens-a-second-store-in-manhattan.html', 'snippet': 'Forty years after opening its first showroom in Manhattan, the French furniture company is back with a second.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Forty years ago, Roche Bobois, the French producer of lush modern furniture, opened its first American showroom on Madison Avenue and 35th Street in New York. Gilles Bonan, the company’s chief executive, said that, after the French, Americans are the most avid Roche Bobois customers, drawn by the furniture’s comfort, quality and “what I call the French flair.”', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/garden/09OPEN1_SPAN/09CURR1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/09/garden/09OPEN1_SPAN/09CURR1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/garden/09OPEN1_SPAN/09CURR1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/garden/09OPEN1_SPAN/09CURR1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1362, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/garden/09OPEN1_SPAN/09CURR1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/09/garden/09OPEN1_SPAN/09CURR1-thumbStandar