ands and exchanged congratulatory greetings. Each won his last start: Scott at the Masters, and Horschel at the Zurich Classic of New Orleans.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Recent Winners Meet at the Podium', 'kicker': 'On Par', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Players Championship (Golf)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Horschel, Billy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Scott, Adam (1980- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-09T00:21:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karen Crouse', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Crouse', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8c3b21b6-1ea0-53ea-99ce-9df7b5f39ffd', 'word_count': 405, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8c3b21b6-1ea0-53ea-99ce-9df7b5f39ffd'}, {'abstract': 'A day before a Senate committee was to take up a bill, a 2009 dissertation by a Heritage Foundation analyst added fuel to the debate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/09/us/heritage-analysts-dissertation-on-immigrant-iq-causes-furor.html', 'snippet': 'A day before a Senate committee was to take up a bill, a 2009 dissertation by a Heritage Foundation analyst added fuel to the debate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The revelation that a co-author of a Heritage Foundation study critical of the Senate’s bipartisan immigration proposal had recently argued that Hispanic immigrants are less intelligent than white Americans touched off a furor on Wednesday, undercutting the conservative foundation’s attempt to become a major force in the immigration debate.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The Ne