2013/05/09/soccer-coachs-departure-trumps-british-news/', 'snippet': 'The retirement of the Manchester United manager Sir Alex Ferguson, after a quarter-century reign, is the number one talking point in Britain this week and has prompted tributes from the country’s top politicians.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — In a week that saw the state opening of Parliament and an intensified debate over membership in the European Union, another news item dominated Thursday’s headlines in Britain — the retirement of a veteran soccer coach.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/blogs/09rdv-ferguson/09rdv-ferguson-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 368, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/09/blogs/09rdv-ferguson/09rdv-ferguson-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 368}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/blogs/09rdv-ferguson/09rdv-ferguson-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 629, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/blogs/09rdv-ferguson/09rdv-ferguson-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1257, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/blogs/09rdv-ferguson/09rdv-ferguson-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/09/blogs/09rdv-ferguson/09rdv-ferguson-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/blogs/09rdv-ferguson/09rdv-ferguson-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Soccer Coach’s Departure Trumps British News', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ferguson, Alex', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Manchester United (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'England', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-09T10:08:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Harvey Morris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Harvey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Morris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0fd5a925-e1ec-50a7-aa95-f133115cd128', 'word_count': 585, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0fd5a925-e1ec-50a7-aa95-f133115cd128'}, {'abstract': 'A veteran high Himalayas guide on how climbing in Nepal has changed in recent years and his life as a sherpa.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/09/veteran-mt-everest-guide-norbu-sherpa-on-changes-in-climbing-and-the-tough-life-of-a-sherpa/', 'snippet': 'A veteran high Himalayas guide on how climbing in Nepal has changed in recent years and his life as a sherpa.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW DELHI — Norbu Sherpa, 32, has been working as a climbing guide in the high mountains of Nepal, over 6,000 meters (19,685 feet) for more than a decade. He has been a member of seven expeditions to Everest, the highest peak in the world, at 8,848 meters (29,029 feet), and reached the summit five times. Norbu, who was educated in Darjeeling, is currently part of a National Cadet Corps Everest team from India.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/world/asia/09-sherpa-IndiaInk/09-sherpa-IndiaInk-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 663, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/09/world/asia/09-sherpa-IndiaInk/09-sherpa-IndiaInk-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 663}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/world/asia/09-sherpa-IndiaInk/09-sherpa-IndiaInk-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 927, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/world/asia/09-sherpa-IndiaInk/09-sherpa-IndiaInk-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2002, 'width': 1812, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/world/asia/09-sherpa-IndiaInk/09-sherpa-IndiaInk-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/09/world/asia/09-sherpa-IndiaInk/09-sherpa-IndiaInk-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/world/asia/09-sherpa-IndiaInk/09-sherpa-IndiaInk-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Conversation With: Mount Everest Guide Norbu Sherpa', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mountain Climbi