ization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/56603d91-8b21-57a7-bfa8-d7d3bed9dacd', 'word_count': 351, 'uri': 'nyt://article/56603d91-8b21-57a7-bfa8-d7d3bed9dacd'}, {'abstract': 'An official at a Worcester funeral home said Tamerlan  Tsarnaev’s body was moved late Wednesday night and entombed outside Massachusetts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/10/us/tamerlan-tsarnaev-boston-bombing-interred.html', 'snippet': 'An official at a Worcester funeral home said Tamerlan  Tsarnaev’s body was moved late Wednesday night and entombed outside Massachusetts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BOSTON — The body of Tamerlan Tsarnaev, the suspect in the Boston Marathon bombing who died after a shootout with the police last month, has been interred in an undisclosed location, the Worcester Police Department said in a statement on Thursday morning.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bombing Suspect’s Body Interred in Undisclosed Location', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Boston Marathon Bombings (2013)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tsarnaev, Tamerlan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tsarnaev, Dzhokhar A', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Worcester (Mass)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-09T15:00:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jess Bidgood', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jess', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bidgood', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2c6413c4-28b6-558d-ad35-d3b5eb93fef8', 'word_count': 604, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2c6413c4-28b6-558d-ad35-d3b5eb93fef8'}, {'abstract': 'A lesson in diplomacy and civics can be found among more than 930,000 City Council documents that have been microfilmed and digitized and are being made available by the LaGuardia and Wagner Archives at LaGuardia Community College.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/09/a-treasure-trove-of-documents-courtesy-of-the-city-council/', 'snippet': 'A lesson in diplomacy and civics can be found among more than 930,000 City Council documents that have been microfilmed and digitized and are being made available by the LaGuardia and Wagner Archives at LaGuardia Community College.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jessica Reinis of Boerum Hill was only in the fourth grade at the Brooklyn Friends school, but she had plenty of questions for Carol Bellamy, who, from 1977 to 1985, was the City Council president:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Treasure Trove of Documents, Courtesy of the City Council', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Archives and Records', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'City Councils', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lieberman, Richard K', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'City Council (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'LaGuardia Community College', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-09T15:03:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Roberts', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Roberts', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c3cac56e-b080-5dfe-8bc4-4f126408046d', 'word_count': 625, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c3cac56e-b080-5dfe-8bc4-4f126408046d'}, {'abstract': 'A Marine Corps veteran reflects on the sacrifices his wife made in raising their children during his two combat deployments.', 'web_url': 'https://atwar.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/09/celebrating-a-wife-who-spent-many-a-mothers-day-alone/', 'snippet': 'A Marine Corps veteran reflects on the sacrifices his wife made in raising their children during his two combat deployments.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mother’s Day has almost arrived, and as I struggle to come up with gift ideas, my thoughts turn toward the many holidays and family events I missed due to training, field operations and deployments. My four years in the Marines Corps included two combat tours in Afghanistan that included trials and tribulations that I will remember for the rest of my days. But I have come to realize that, compared to my wife, I had the easier job. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Celebrating a Wife Who Has Had to Spend Mother’s Day Alone', 'kicker': 'At War', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Babies and Infants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': "Mother's Day", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Marine Corps', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Marja (Afghanistan)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-09T15:05:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Zachary Bell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Zachary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_materi