ut and appearance of the original.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A PDF does one thing very well: it presents an accurate image that can be viewed on just about any device. Unfortunately, PDFs also cause grief for anyone who wants to use the data they contain. Governments, in particular, have a habit of releasing PDFs when the information would be more useful and accessible as a spreadsheet. The tools for extracting text from PDFs can be flaky, but Lu Wang’s pdf2htmlEX project solves this problem. Pdf2htmlEX takes PDFs and converts them into HTML5 documents while preserving the layout and appearance of the original. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Cool Tools: pdf2html', 'kicker': 'Open', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-05-09T15:24:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Derek Willis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Derek', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Willis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e697e057-3061-525e-bf6e-43b807a97c71', 'word_count': 132, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e697e057-3061-525e-bf6e-43b807a97c71'}, {'abstract': 'Declan Walsh, The Times’s Islamabad bureau chief, previews the upcoming election on May 11, which promises the first democratic transfer of power from one civilian government to another.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/world/asia/100000002216269/pakistans-historic-elections.html', 'snippet': 'Declan Walsh, The Times’s Islamabad bureau chief, previews the upcoming election on May 11, which promises the first democratic transfer of power from one civilian government to another.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Declan Walsh, The Times’s Islamabad bureau chief, previews the upcoming election on May 11, which promises the first democratic transfer of power from one civilian government to another.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/world/video-pakistanelectionsprimer/video-pakistanelectionsprimer-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/09/world/video-pakistanelectionsprimer/video-pakistanelectionsprimer-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/world/video-pakistanelectionsprimer/video-pakistanelectionsprimer-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/09/world/video-pakistanelectionsprimer/video-pakistanelectionsprimer-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/09/world/video-pakistanelectionsprimer/video-pakistanelectionsprimer-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Pakistan’s Pivotal Elections', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pakistan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Khan, Ismail', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sharif, Nawaz', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-09T15:27:44+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'Zena Barakat and Declan Walsh', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Zena', 'middlename