nyt://article/765ecd51-68d5-53cd-b5bb-108de367de7e'}, {'abstract': 'New York City Ballet’s spring gala included a performance by Queen Latifah and by the clarinetist Richard Stoltzman.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/10/arts/dance/new-york-city-ballet-season-gala-with-robbins-and-balanchine.html', 'snippet': 'New York City Ballet’s spring gala included a performance by Queen Latifah and by the clarinetist Richard Stoltzman.', 'lead_paragraph': 'American music! What’s its stylistic range, and what’s its dance potential? New York City Ballet’s spring gala on Wednesday — with no fanfares, no speeches and no onstage toasts — focused simply on this theme. Though too few of the principals danced, it was an entirely happy occasion to open the company’s season.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/10/arts/10GALA_SPAN/10GALA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 302, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/10/arts/10GALA_SPAN/10GALA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 302}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/10/arts/10GALA_SPAN/10GALA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 516, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/10/arts/10GALA_SPAN/10GALA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1032, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/10/arts/10GALA_SPAN/10GALA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/10/arts/10GALA_