/b65d7cff-ea37-5489-a60d-a646cbbd986c'}, {'abstract': 'Among those returning to the network are Sean Hayes of “Will and Grace” and the creator of “Parenthood.” Also, the network will bring back “Parks and Recreation.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/10/business/media/nbc-announces-5-new-shows-with-familiar-names-attached.html', 'snippet': 'Among those returning to the network are Sean Hayes of “Will and Grace” and the creator of “Parenthood.” Also, the network will bring back “Parks and Recreation.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'NBC began its latest rebuilding effort on Thursday by announcing that it had ordered five new series: three comedies and two dramas. These shows do not represent the network’s entire list of new entries; more series are expected to be announced on Friday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'NBC Announces 5 New Shows, With Familiar Names Attached', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Upfronts (Television)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Broadcasting Co', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ABRAMS, J J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hayes, Sean', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': '1600 Penn (TV Program)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Whitney (TV Program)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Parks and Recreation (TV Program)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-09T22:32:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Carter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, '