unt': 1450, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5ed9eaf6-3cab-59da-92f9-4e8b619140cc'}, {'abstract': 'There are over 110 facilities statewide that store at least 10,000 pounds of ammonium nitrate, the source of an explosion at a fertilizer plant that killed at least 14 people.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/10/us/texas-chemical-depots-fall-under-a-jumble-of-regulations.html', 'snippet': 'There are over 110 facilities statewide that store at least 10,000 pounds of ammonium nitrate, the source of an explosion at a fertilizer plant that killed at least 14 people.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW BRAUNFELS — Off a dirt road connected to ever-flowing Interstate 35, a little metal sign on a wooden fence is the only indication of what lies ahead. Nearby, Buckley Powder, a mining and construction supply company, stores large quantities of ammonium nitrate, the source of the explosion at a fertilizer depot that killed at least 14 people and injured hundreds more last month in West.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/10/us/10ttExplode1/10ttExplode1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/10/us/10ttExplode1/10ttExplode1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/10/us/10ttExplode1/10ttExplode1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/10/us/10ttExplode1/10ttExplode1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None