 girls were never encouraged to take auto-shop courses. Now I want to know more about what’s under the hood. Like, where’s the radiator?', 'lead_paragraph': 'I took my car, after its winter storage, to a Manhattan dealership last month for a spring tune-up. This is the shop that years ago charged me about $99 — its hourly rate at the time, as I recall — to make a replacement ignition key. That won’t happen again; the hourly rate is now $129.95.', 'print_section': 'AU', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/12/booming/12repair-wadler-booming/12repair-wadler-booming-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 440, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/12/booming/12repair-wadler-booming/12repair-wadler-booming-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 440}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/12/booming/12repair-wadler-booming/12repair-wadler-booming-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 751, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/12/booming/12repair-wadler-booming/12repair-wadler-booming-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1375, 'width': 1875, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/12/booming/12repair-wadler-booming/12repair-wadler-booming-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/12/booming/12repair-wadler-booming/12repair-wadler-booming-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': Non