 anterior cruciate ligament in the first playoff game of last season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GREENBURGH, N.Y. — With three full days between Games 2 and 3 of the Eastern Conference semifinal series between the Knicks and the Indiana Pacers, the replay of Iman Shumpert’s one-handed slam dunk in the second quarter Tuesday has had a chance to really sink in, playing in highlight packages in what has seemed like an unending loop.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/10/sports/knicks/knicks-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 607, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/10/sports/knicks/knicks-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 607}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/10/sports/knicks/knicks-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1013, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/10/sports/knicks/knicks-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2025, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/10/sports/knicks/knicks-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/10/sports/knicks/knicks-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/10/sports/knicks/knicks-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'His Knee Fine, Knicks’ Shumpert Is Soaring Again', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'His Knee Fine, Knicks’ Shumpert Is Soaring Again', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Knicks', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shumpert, Iman', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Indiana Pacers', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Woodson, Mike', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-10T02:04:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Zach Schonbrun', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Zach', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schonbrun', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/926cc791-3228-5cb0-b68d-08cc27bedfe4', 'word_count': 804, 'uri': 'nyt://article/926cc791-3228-5cb0-b68d-08cc27bedfe4'}, {'abstract': 'In a rambling statement on Thursday lasting almost an hour, Gen. Efraín Ríos Montt said he had never authorized or proposed attacks on any ethnic groups.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/10/world/americas/efrain-rios-montt-denies-role-in-guatemalan-massacres.html', 'snippet': 'In a rambling statement on Thursday lasting almost an hour, Gen. Efraín Ríos Montt said he had never authorized or proposed attacks on any ethnic groups.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GUATEMALA CITY — Gen. Efraín Ríos Montt, the former dictator who ruled Guatemala during one of the bloodiest periods of its long civil war, faced the court trying him for genocide on Thursday and denied any role in the horrors narrated by Mayan survivors of massacres committed in the remote highlands three decades ago.