. C. Sabathia pitched four strong innings before the rain came, and the Yankees won a second straight game over the Rockies as five relievers helped secure the victory.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/10/sports/baseball/robinson-cano-gets-1500th-hit-in-yankees-win-over-rockies.html', 'snippet': 'C. C. Sabathia pitched four strong innings before the rain came, and the Yankees won a second straight game over the Rockies as five relievers helped secure the victory.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DENVER — The Yankees came to Coors Field on Tuesday with their mounting injuries threatening to overwhelm them. They managed four singles and could not score a run. The next day, Manager Joe Girardi even had a pitcher bat eighth to generate some offense.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/10/sports/yankees-1/yankees-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 412, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/10/sports/yankees-1/yankees-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 412}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/10/sports/yankees-1/yankees-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 704, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/10/sports/yankees-1/yankees-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1407, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/10/sports/yankees-1/yankees-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/10/sports/yankees-1/