f7a469ed-60f3-595d-8f6d-e0bd81694d4b', 'word_count': 366, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f7a469ed-60f3-595d-8f6d-e0bd81694d4b'}, {'abstract': 'Governments urge smokers to quit, but they also collect billions in tobacco taxes. In France, a big drop in cigarette sales has reportedly alarmed both manufacturers and the treasury.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/10/should-governments-cash-in-on-smokers/', 'snippet': 'Governments urge smokers to quit, but they also collect billions in tobacco taxes. In France, a big drop in cigarette sales has reportedly alarmed both manufacturers and the treasury.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Governments have an ambivalent attitude about tobacco, on the one hand lecturing smokers at every turn to abandon nicotine, while with the other hand raking in cigarette sales taxes to finance their treasuries.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/10/blogs/10rdv-tobacco/10rdv-tobacco-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/10/blogs/10rdv-tobacco/10rdv-tobacco-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/10/blogs/10rdv-tobacco/10rdv-tobacco-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/10/blogs/10rdv-tobacco/10rdv-tobacco-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/10/blogs/10rdv-tobacco/10rdv-tobacco-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnai