a37ed68-c1df-5763-8156-0ae3ed2cdf0c'}, {'abstract': 'Three recent STEM-related articles that inspired simple student projects exploring video design and gaming.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/10/common-core-practice-hit-films-glowing-trees-and-an-underwater-menagerie/', 'snippet': 'Three recent STEM-related articles that inspired simple student projects exploring video design and gaming.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A few weeks ago, Mrs. Gross, Mr. Olsen and their students explored how they might pair Times content with basic computer coding to practice Common Core skills. This week they show how the news and the standards can be jumping-off points for exploring video design and gaming. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/08/business/GLOW-LN/GLOW-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/08/business/GLOW-LN/GLOW-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/08/business/GLOW-LN/GLOW-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 631, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/08/business/GLOW-LN/GLOW-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1263, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/08/business/GLOW-LN/GLOW-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/08/business/GLOW-LN/GLOW-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 't