t', 'value': 'Interscholastic Athletics', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Athletics and Sports', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Charlotte', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ottmueller, Aria', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chandler (Ariz)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Emory (Tex)', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-10T15:30:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeré Longman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeré', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Longman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/11af7ccb-325e-538a-bb19-01077343a752', 'word_count': 1300, 'uri': 'nyt://article/11af7ccb-325e-538a-bb19-01077343a752'}, {'abstract': 'When booking a place to stay, don’t think only about location and beautiful rooms. Consider this crop of hotels that include stunning gardens on their list of luxurious amenities.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/10/in-nature-room-with-a-view/', 'snippet': 'When booking a place to stay, don’t think only about location and beautiful rooms. Consider this crop of hotels that include stunning gardens on their list of luxurious amenities.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Some of the most thrilling nuances of a great landscape only become apparent in the brightness of dawn or when the afternoon light casts sharp shadows. But since many of the best gardens are private, gaining access to them at these magic hours can be a challenge. Thankfully, this is changing, as hoteliers across the globe have tapped major landscape architects to plant and design the greenery around their hotels. The result: a set of properties with outdoor spaces that are destinations in and of themselves. From the manicured grounds of a manor house in the Cotswolds, to a walled courtyard in Stockholm, to a working Cape Dutch farm in South Africa (and even to the lush tropicals planted by Arnaud MauriËres and Eric Ossart at Dar Al Hossoun in Morocco), these are gardens worth traveling for.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '40', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Nature | Room With a View', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Room With a View', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-05-10T15:30:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lindsey Taylor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lindsey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Taylor', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9bf711e5-1788-5057-981e-8aa4f3390d7d', 'word_count': 1000, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9bf711e5-1788-5057-981e-8aa4f3390d7d'}, {'abstract': 'The anemic economy has left millions struggling to get ahead. Student debt is making it even harder for many of them, as they delay purchases of things like homes and cars.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/11/business/economy/student-loan-debt-weighing-down-younger-us-workers.html', 'snippet': 'The anemic economy has left millions struggling to get ahead. Student debt is making it even harder for many of them, as they delay purchases of things like homes and cars.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The anemic economy has left millions of younger working Americans struggling to get ahead. The added millstone of student loan debt, which recently exceeded $1 trillion in total, is making it even harder for many of them, delaying purchases of things like homes, cars and other big-ticket items and acting as a drag on growth, economists said. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/11/business/economy/11studentloans/11studentloans-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/11/business/economy/11studentloans/11studentloans-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/11/business/economy/11studentloans/11studentloans-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/11/business/economy/11studentloans/11studentloans-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/11/business/economy/11studentloans/11studentloans-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/11/business/economy/11studentloans/11studentloans-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/11/business/economy/11studentloans/11studentloans-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Student Debt Slows Growth as Young Spend Less', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Heavy Load of Student Loan Debt Is Weighing on the Economy, Too', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'valu