79f-5ff2-84a3-28519292a524', 'word_count': 785, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f563242f-f79f-5ff2-84a3-28519292a524'}, {'abstract': 'Claudia Moreira Salles will have a show in TriBeCa, her first solo exhibition outside Brazil, after creating furniture and interiors for than three decades.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/10/garden/a-brazilian-designer-finally-gets-her-due-in-new-york.html', 'snippet': 'Claudia Moreira Salles will have a show in TriBeCa, her first solo exhibition outside Brazil, after creating furniture and interiors for than three decades.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Brazilian designers have reached higher levels of recognition (and sales) lately, but for every Oscar Niemeyer and Sergio Rodrigues there are flocks of Brazilian designers flying under the radar. Claudia Moreira Salles could be considered a real find by many, despite more than 30 years’ creating furniture and interiors for architects including Ricardo Legorreta and projects like the rooftop bar of the Hotel Americano in Chelsea.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/10/garden/10shows/10shows-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 193, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/10/garden/10shows/10shows-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 193}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/10/garden/10shows/10shows-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 329, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/10/garden/10shows/10shows-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 659, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'i