rk iteration has become the latest stop for wealthy buyers of contemporary art, a well-established, defining marker of social status.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/12/fashion/the-elite-browse-and-forage-at-frieze-art-fair.html', 'snippet': 'The Frieze Art Fair’s New York iteration has become the latest stop for wealthy buyers of contemporary art, a well-established, defining marker of social status.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Just go with it,” Patty Smyth, the rocker, said to her husband, the tennis legend John McEnroe, urging him to tip up a coupe of Bobby Burns, a potent cocktail of whiskey, sweet vermouth, Bénédictine and a twist of lemon. “Go with the flow.”', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/12/fashion/20130512FRIEZE-slide-00V9/20130512FRIEZE-slide-00V9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/12/fashion/20130512FRIEZE-slide-00V9/20130512FRIEZE-slide-00V9-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/12/fashion/20130512FRIEZE-slide-00V9/20130512FRIEZE-slide-00V9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/12/fashion/20130512FRIEZE-slide-00V9/20130512FRIEZE-slide-00V9-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/12/fashion/20130512FRIEZE-slide-00V9/20130512FRIEZE-slide-00V9-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail