ragraph': 'Some Mother’s Day tributes are less wholesome than others, and thank heaven for that. “Mammas” — a set of short films, two to three minutes each, appearing Sunday on the Sundance Channel and sundancechannel.com — reflects the distinctive character of its creator, Isabella Rossellini: a blend of innocence, sophistication and sly smuttiness. It’s a long way from flowers, chocolates and brunch.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Isabella Rossellini’s Sly Maternal Instinct', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rossellini, Isabella', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sundance Channel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-10T22:34:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mike Hale', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mike', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hale', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bffe72a9-e2e3-523a-a6dc-1575abcac637', 'word_count': 349, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bffe72a9-e2e3-523a-a6dc-1575abcac637'}, {'abstract': 'The Rose Room restaurant in Mount Kisco provides an elegant setting for customers and a good excuse for getting dressed up.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/12/nyregion/a-review-of-the-rose-room-restaurant-in-mount-kisco.html', 'snippet': 'The Rose Room restaurant in Mount Kisco provides an elegant setting for customers and a good excuse for getting dressed up.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Rose Room, which opened in Mount Kisco in February, is a place of hits and misses. ', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge