l-inning wins this week. After Thursday’s hit, Baxter became the first pinch-hitter since 1991 to have game-ending at-bats twice in a three-day span.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Secret of Baxter’s Success', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Baxter, Mike', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Collins, Terry L', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Familia, Jeurys', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-10T23:57:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jorge Arangure Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jorge', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Arangure', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9942470a-9a7f-57ec-a598-34adfe50f1da', 'word_count': 664, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9942470a-9a7f-57ec-a598-34adfe50f1da'}, {'abstract': 'T’s Summer Travel issue is all about trying something new.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/10/now-online-t-summer-travel-2013/', 'snippet': 'T’s Summer Travel issue is all about trying something new.', 'lead_paragraph': 'T’s Summer Travel issue is all about trying something new: whether it’s staying in a stranger’s home (Gideon Lewis-Kraus writes about Airbnb), taking a trip alone (Andrew O’Hagan delights in traveling solo) or considering a place off the beaten path (Adam Sachs has a love-hate relationship with Marin County, Calif.). Inside, there is T’s usual mix of art, entertainment and fashion with a profile on the artist James Turrell by Edward Helmore, a visit with the actor Rupert Everett by Sarah Lyall and a round-up of black bikinis and leather cover-ups photographed by Craig McDean and styled by Joe McKenna. And don’t forget to drop in on Saturdays Surf NYC in Japan, check out our selection of hotel gardens or read about Italy’’s Spoleto Festival. See all from the issue >>', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'T Summer Travel 2013', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-05-11T00:00:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By T Editors', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/62d1bba4-c525-542c-8103-ff7844846508', 'word_count': 131, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62d1bba4-c525-542c-8103-ff7844846508'}, {'abstract': 'A guide to cultural and recreational events in New Jersey.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/12/nyregion/events-in-new-jersey.html', 'snippet': 'A guide to cultural and recreational events in New Jersey.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A guide to cultural and recreational events in New Jersey. Items for the calendar should be sent at least three weeks in advance to njtowns@nytimes.com.', 'print_section': 'NJ', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Events in New Jersey', 'kicker': 'Calendar', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New Jersey', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Culture (Arts)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-11T00:00:40+0000', 'document_type': 'arti