f Manchester can be traced to the dissatisfaction of Manchester United fans with the takeover by Malcolm Glazer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/11/sports/soccer/out-of-love-for-man-u-fans-built-breakaway-club.html', 'snippet': 'The origins of F.C. United of Manchester can be traced to the dissatisfaction of Manchester United fans with the takeover by Malcolm Glazer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MANCHESTER, England — The e-mails and phone calls flow in regularly from all over the world, as soccer players, parents and fans want to get in touch with the club here known as United. The club’s staff members understand the interest in the team that famously wears red and black, so they do their best to reply to each request, whether it comes from Africa or Asia or America.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/11/sports/y-manchester-1/y-manchester-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/11/sports/y-manchester-1/y-manchester-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/11/sports/y-manchester-1/y-manchester-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/11/sports/y-manchester-1/y-manchester-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/11/sports/y-manchester-1/y-manchester-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': '