/interactive/de2e8a7c-d7ee-519b-94ea-62e24e5ce227'}, {'abstract': 'Senators’ bipartisanship and problem-solving hold firm against borderline insanity.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/12/opinion/sunday/first-steps-to-a-better-immigration-bill.html', 'snippet': 'Senators’ bipartisanship and problem-solving hold firm against borderline insanity.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After the Senate Judiciary Committee ended its first day of marking up an\xa0867-page immigration bill on Thursday, plunging into the details of what could be the most ambitious overhaul of the system in a quarter-century, one thing was clear: it is a lot better to be deep in the weeds of a complicated bill than trapped in the desert of a stalemate, which is where immigration reform has been since the last big bipartisan bill collapsed in 2007.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'First Steps to a Better Immigration Bill', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'First Steps to a Better Immigration Bill', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Grassley, Charles E', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cruz, Ted', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sessions, Jefferson B III', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schumer, Charles E', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Leahy, Patrick J', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lee, Michael S', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hirono, Mazie K', 'rank': 11, 'm