heimer’s center; the groom is a urology resident, also in Chicago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Cho Virginia Basden, the daughter of Jill Richards Basden and the Rev. Michael P. Basden of Naples, Fla., was married there Saturday to Dr. Daniel John Mazur, a son of Lillian Ekaczyk Mazur and Glen A. Mazur of New Lenox, Ill., at Trinity-by-the-Cove Episcopal Church, where the bride’s father is the rector. The Right Rev. Jeffrey D. Lee, the godfather of the bride and the bishop of the Episcopal diocese of Chicago, performed the ceremony with the Rev. Stephen Gerth, an Episcopal priest, assisting.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/12/fashion/weddings/12BASDENjpg/12BASDENjpg-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 388, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/12/fashion/weddings/12BASDENjpg/12BASDENjpg-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 388}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/12/fashion/weddings/12BASDENjpg/12BASDENjpg-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 663, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/12/fashion/weddings/12BASDENjpg/12BASDENjpg-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1325, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/12/fashion/weddings/12BASDENjpg/12BASDENjpg-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/12/fashion/weddings/12BASDENjpg/12BASDENjpg-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'ra