ragraph': 'If the young women who packed 54 Below at 11 p.m. on Friday didn’t emit the piercing screams you would hear at a Justin Bieber concert, it was because Aaron Tveit, the handsome 29-year-old star they came to adore, is a decade older, and these fans were in their late teens and 20s. But the atmosphere suggested a more restrained version of the fervor exhibited by Beliebers.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pop, American Songbook and Young Charm', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pop, American Songbook and Young Charm', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tveit, Aaron', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-12T20:06:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephen Holden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Holden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/dcee7381-2d64-5df5-abdc-5b1fdd170fe6', 'word_count': 323, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dcee7381-2d64-5df5-abdc-5b1fdd170fe6'}, {'abstract': 'After Esfandiar Rahim Mashaei and former President Ali Akbar Hashemi Rafsanjani registered for the June election, the country’s governing establishment responded with anger.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/13/world/middleeast/two-last-minute-presidential-candidates-in-iran-draw-strong-reactions.html', 'snippet': 'After Esfandiar Rahim Mashaei and former President Ali Akbar Hashemi Rafsanjani registered for the June election, the country’s governing establishment responded with anger.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TEHRAN — A day after two game-changing politicians signed up at the last