y’s barn, said the Kentucky Derby winner Orb looked and felt great before a workout scheduled for Monday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jenn Patterson, an exercise rider for Shug McGaughey, has a morning set list that reads like a who’s who of elite equine athletes. It includes the multiple Grade I winner Point of Entry, the Virginia Derby winner Air Support, and Imaging, who is scheduled to contest the Dixie Stakes on the undercard of the Preakness Stakes next Saturday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Orb’s Exercise Rider Shares Insight Before Preakness', 'kicker': 'The Rail', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Horse Racing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Kentucky Derby', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Preakness Stakes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McGaughey, Shug', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-12T20:26:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alex Brown', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alex', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brown', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/63680a0b-078d-5cd2-a6a4-8d0740d0b553', 'word_count': 752, 'uri': 'nyt://article/63680a0b-078d-5cd2-a6a4-8d0740d0b553'}, {'abstract': 'The following tax-exempt fixed-income issues are scheduled for pricing this week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/13/business/treasury-auctions-set-for-this-week.html', 'snippet': 'The following tax-exempt fixed-income issues are scheduled for pricing this week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Treasury’s schedule of financing this week includes Monday’s regular weekly auction of new three- and six-month bills and an auction of four-week bills on Tuesday.', '