orts/baseball/imperfect-harvey-plus-impotent-offense-equals-mets-futility-against-pirates.html', 'snippet': 'Mets ace Matt Harvey was erratic early, but his teammates offered little support on offense, managing just four hits in a loss to the Pirates.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The margin of error for the Mets, in the midst of an offensive slumber, is minuscule. The slightest misstep — an uncharacteristic inning from their ace, Matt Harvey, or a badly placed pitch by the usually reliable closer Bobby Parnell, or an unlucky bounce to a Pirates infielder — can spell disaster.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/13/sports/METS/METS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 431, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/13/sports/METS/METS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 431}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/13/sports/METS/METS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 736, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/13/sports/METS/METS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1290, 'width': 1794, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/13/sports/METS/METS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/13/sports/METS/METS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/13/sports/METS/METS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'wid