://article/46bb044f-714a-50f7-a9f2-1b3e2116b6f9'}, {'abstract': 'The Minnesota Orchestra, which has made remarkable artistic achievements over the past decade, lost an entire season to a lockout of the musicians by management.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/13/arts/music/lockout-for-the-minnesota-orchestra-grows-more-painful.html', 'snippet': 'The Minnesota Orchestra, which has made remarkable artistic achievements over the past decade, lost an entire season to a lockout of the musicians by management.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the Finnish conductor Osmo Vanska took over as music director of the Minnesota Orchestra in 2003, he told the players that he wanted it to be “the best orchestra in this country in four or five years,” he recounted in a 2006 interview.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/13/arts/ENSEMBLE/ENSEMBLE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 830, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/13/arts/ENSEMBLE/ENSEMBLE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 830}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/13/arts/ENSEMBLE/ENSEMBLE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 741, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/13/arts/ENSEMBLE/ENSEMBLE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1481, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/13/arts/ENSEMBLE/ENSEMBLE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/13/arts/ENSEM