/2013/05/13/2-award-givers-thumbs-turn-up-for-durang/', 'snippet': 'The Outer Critics Circle and the New York Drama Critics’ Circle named Christopher Durang’s comedy “Vanya and Sonia and Masha and Spike” as the best play of the 2012-13 season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two associations of theater writers and reviewers, the Outer Critics Circle and the New York Drama Critics’ Circle, have named Christopher Durang’s comedy “Vanya and Sonia and Masha and Spike,” with David Hyde Pierce, as the best play of the 2012-13 season. They did not agree, though, on best musical: The Outer Critics gave that award to “Kinky Boots,” and the New York Drama Critics went with “Matilda the Musical.” ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '2 Award-Givers’ Thumbs Turn Up for Durang', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Awards, Decorations and Honors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-13T04:01:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam W. Kepler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Kepler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ac00789c-a93a-5e77-87cd-876e00f605e6', 'word_count': 167, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ac00789c-a93a-5e77-87cd-876e00f605e6'}, {'abstract': 'Good news for new mothers: A study suggests that carefully regulated formula feeding before your milk comes in will not harm your baby’s ability to breast-feed. And done properly, it may even help in the long run.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/13/how-formula-can-complement-breast-feeding/', 'snippet': 'Good news for new mothers: A study suggests that carefully regulated f