 'snippet': 'The vote on splitting Jamie Dimon’s roles at JPMorgan Chase could hinge on views about the lead director. | Bloomberg News admits its reporters viewed information about clients’ use of its terminals. | Representative Maxine Waters has adopted a so...', 'lead_paragraph': 'The shareholder vote at JPMorgan Chase on splitting Jamie Dimon’s roles of chairman and chief executive could hinge on whether Lee R. Raymond, the lead director, is seen as strong enough to stand up to Mr. Dimon, Jessica Silver-Greenberg and Susanne Craig report in DealBook.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'JPMorgan’s Lead Director in Focus', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-05-13T11:53:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Alden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/78bf2749-6deb-5ae5-adea-614c2015ba1c', 'word_count': 1915, 'uri': 'nyt://article/78bf2749-6deb-5ae5-adea-614c2015ba1c'}, {'abstract': 'Among the stars of the network’s new comedies are Andy Samberg and Andre Braugher. Other new entries include an animated show, a reality show and an “event series.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/14/business/media/foxs-new-schedule-tries-to-shore-up-tuesdays-comedy-lineup.html', 'snippet': 'Among the stars of the network’s new comedies are Andy Samberg and Andre Braugher. Other new entries include an animated show, a reality show and an “event series.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Fox network unveiled a prime-time schedule on Monday that includes sweeping changes and — like the schedules expected from its network competitors — a copious injection of new