fore It Built the Enclave, Buick Built Tanks', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Military Vehicles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World War II (1939-45)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Buick Division of General Motors Corp', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Flint (Mich)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-13T12:00:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Stenquist', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stenquist', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f254e164-1a98-56dd-b785-3d0749fad809', 'word_count': 410, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f254e164-1a98-56dd-b785-3d0749fad809'}, {'abstract': 'A reported Communist Party directive seemed to reflect determination to preserve top-down political control in the face of potential economic liberalizati0n.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/14/world/asia/chinese-leaders-warn-of-dangerous-western-values.html', 'snippet': 'A reported Communist Party directive seemed to reflect determination to preserve top-down political control in the face of potential economic liberalizati0n.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HONG KONG — The Chinese Communist Party has warned officials to combat “dangerous” Western values and other perceived ideological threats, in a directive that analysts said on Monday reflected the determination of China’s leader to preserve top-down political control even as he considers economic liberalization.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'sourc