dfield celebrated his last day in charge of the International Space Station by releasing an elaborately produced cover version of David Bowie’s “Space Oddity,” recorded around the office in his spare time.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/13/astronaut-covers-space-oddity-from-space/', 'snippet': 'The Canadian astronaut Chris Hadfield celebrated his last day in charge of the International Space Station by releasing an elaborately produced cover version of David Bowie’s “Space Oddity,” recorded around the office in his spare time.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Canadian astronaut Chris Hadfield, who has documented his five months in charge of the International Space Station in great detail in Twitter photographs and YouTube videos, celebrated his last day aboard the craft by releasing an elaborately produced cover version of David Bowie’s “Space Oddity.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Astronaut Covers ‘Space Oddity’ From Space', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Space Station', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bowie, David', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hadfield, Chris', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Canadian Space Agency', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Canada', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-13T16:30:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/813b68f8-929f-5fc3-8dc0-3525b4b8f9f7', 'word_count': 536, 'uri': 'nyt://article/813b68f8-929f-5fc3-8d