 middle of a downpour. But yesterday I photographed people inside the rain, and not a drop of water fell on my equipment.', 'lead_paragraph': ' As a photographer, I would normally avoid using my camera in the middle of a downpour. But yesterday, at the opening of “EXPO 1,” a show at MoMA devoted to ecological issues, I photographed people inside the rain, and not a drop of water fell on my equipment.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/13/magazine/13-rain-5/13-rain-5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/13/magazine/13-rain-5/13-rain-5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/13/magazine/13-rain-5/13-rain-5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/13/magazine/13-rain-5/13-rain-5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/13/magazine/13-rain-5/13-rain-5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/13/magazine/13-rain-5/13-rain-5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/13/magazine/13-rain-5/13-rain-5-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'No Rain on Me', 'kicker': 'The 6th Floor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Museum of Modern Art', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-13T22:17:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Marvin Orellana', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Marvin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Orellana', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/18e2ba53-ae82-5f21-a2c2-60827957710c', 'word_count': 205, 'uri': 'nyt://article/18e2ba53-ae82-5f21-a2c2-60827957710c'}, {'abstract': 'A survey by the Pew Research Center suggests the European Union may struggle to take the steps needed to make it viable over the long term.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/14/business/global/poll-shows-european-union-loses-favor-in-europe.html', 'snippet': 'A survey by the Pew Research Center suggests the European Union may struggle to take the steps needed to make it viable over the long term.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BRUSSELS — Europeans have never been wild about the European Union. With the region sapped by the euro crisis, confidence in the institution and the benefits it was supposed to provide is flagging faster and further than ever before, according to an influential opinion survey released Monday. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/14/business/EUROPOLL/EUROPOLL-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/14/business/EUROPOLL/EUROPOLL-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0,