year-was-an-adventure-worth-taking/', 'snippet': 'This Friday, I will be the third person in my entire family to graduate from high school. This is so important to me, and it’s so strange that my senior year is coming to an end.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This Friday, I will be the third person in my entire family to graduate from high school. This is so important to me, and it’s so strange that my senior year is coming to an end. Sometimes it has been exciting and sometimes it has been mundane, but it has certainly been an adventure worth taking.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/education/envpls13-chandler-buckingham/envpls13-chandler-buckingham-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 563, 'width': 480, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/education/envpls13-chandler-buckingham/envpls13-chandler-buckingham-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 563, 'width': 480, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/education/envpls13-chandler-buckingham/envpls13-chandler-buckingham-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/03/education/envpls13-chandler-buckingham/envpls13-chandler-buckingham-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/03/education/envpls13-chandler-buckingham/envpls13-chandler-buckingham-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Thrilling and Maddening’ Senior Year Was an