, 'word_count': 866, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f57c9339-5338-56f4-be2e-fe142f19f2ca'}, {'abstract': 'The leather goods brand has created 41 bespoke pieces using exotic skins and semiprecious stones.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/14/feeling-for-asprey-private-collection-handbags/', 'snippet': 'The leather goods brand has created 41 bespoke pieces using exotic skins and semiprecious stones.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As a second act to her debut collection for Asprey last summer, the accessories designer Katie Hillier unveils another line of handbags, called the Private Collection, for the English jewelry and leather goods brand early next month. Hillier worked with a small team to create 41 bespoke pieces that, she says, “appeal to clients that are looking for a unique piece of art.” Influenced by hand-painted mosaic motifs, Hillier used a rainbow of exotic skins and semiprecious stones to dress up the simple, timeless designs. One standout is this Rothkoesque bag in crocodile with over four carats of diamonds.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Feeling For | Asprey Private Collection Handbags', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Handbags and Purses', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-14T21:30:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Edward Barsamian', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Edward', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barsamian', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/114685c9-6a5e-563c-b7e6-64aea2a85adf', 'word_count': 128, 'uri': 'nyt://article/114685c9-6a5e-563c-b7e6-64aea2a85adf'}, {'abstract': '“The Hotel Colors,” Eliza Bent’s debut play about a day in the life of a group of bedraggled 