e in the United States with limited funds seemed to be just that: a dream. However, I am grateful to have had friends and family who were supportive.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/14/education/video-envpls-sush-11/video-envpls-sush-11-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/14/education/video-envpls-sush-11/video-envpls-sush-11-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/14/education/video-envpls-sush-11/video-envpls-sush-11-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/14/education/video-envpls-sush-11/video-envpls-sush-11-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/14/education/video-envpls-sush-11/video-envpls-sush-11-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Envelope Please: Sush Krishnamoorthy', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-05-14T21:44:33+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Education', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/d71d6716-bf94-5f1b-b5c6-10037329b143', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/d71d6716-bf94-5f1b-b5c6-10037329b143'}, {'abstract': '“Becoming Traviata” follows the soprano Natalie Dessay through rehearsals in this documentary directed by Philippe Béziat.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/15/movies/becoming-traviata-directed-by-philippe-beziat.html', 'snippet': '“Becoming Traviata” follows the soprano Natalie Dessay through rehearsals in this documentary directed by Philippe Béziat.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A behind-the-scenes look at an Aix-en-Provence staging of Verdi’s “Traviata,” the impressionistic, handsomely shot “Becoming Traviata,” directed by Philippe Béziat, may not be fully satisfying as a documentary. But it has what any good movie needs: a star — the ever-game soprano Natalie Dessay.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/15/arts/filmroundup/filmroundup-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 336, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/15/arts/filmroundup/filmroundup-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 336}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/15/arts/filmroundup/filmroundup-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 574, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/15/arts/filmroundup/filmroundup-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1076, 'width': 1920, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/15/arts/filmroundup/filmroundup-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/15/arts/filmroundup/filmroundup-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/15/a