w', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/2fd4992c-833d-5259-9d9f-eeeda3240884', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/2fd4992c-833d-5259-9d9f-eeeda3240884'}, {'abstract': 'Mariners Harbor, in northwestern Staten Island, is a place within the city limits where a sizable house in good condition is within reach for a civil servant.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/19/realestate/coastal-perch-in-staten-island-varied-nests-on-offer.html', 'snippet': 'Mariners Harbor, in northwestern Staten Island, is a place within the city limits where a sizable house in good condition is within reach for a civil servant.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The city trend toward transforming decayed industrial shoreline into public space has not yet made landfall in the northwestern Staten Island neighborhood of Mariners Harbor. But José Marrero, betting that the tides of gentrification wash over every area eventually, moved here a decade ago from a two-bedroom rental in Coney Island. ', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/realestate/19LIVING_SPAN/Living-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/19/realestate/19LIVING_SPAN/Living-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/realestate/19LIVING_SPAN/Living-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/realestate/19LIVING_SPAN/Living-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 