 L.P. is growing to resemble the Wall Street firms that are its clients.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/05/15/dimon-and-blankfein-foxhole-buddies/', 'snippet': 'Jamie Dimon of JPMorgan Chase has received advice from Lloyd C. Blankfein of Goldman Sachs. | Activist investing has traditionally been greeted with hostility in Japan. | Daniel S. Loeb is taking a polite approach with Sony. | Bloomberg L.P. is gr...', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jamie Dimon, wrestling with the fallout from JPMorgan Chase’s multibillion-dollar trading loss, has received advice from a rival, Lloyd C. Blankfein of Goldman Sachs, Susanne Craig and Jessica Silver-Greenberg report in DealBook. “The two executives have talked privately a number of times in recent months about the challenges that Mr. Dimon is facing, people with knowledge of the relationship but not authorized to speak on the matter, have said.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dimon and Blankfein, Foxhole Buddies', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-05-15T12:04:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Alden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/764fc948-a70b-52ca-8769-e5a817b66f14', 'word_count': 1964, 'uri': 'nyt://article/764fc948-a70b-52ca-8769-e5a817b66f14'}, {'abstract': 'Seismologists directed by Japan’s new nuclear regulator said the fault showed signs of being geologically active, suggesting a high earthquake risk.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/16/world/asia/japanese-reactor-is-said-to-sit-above-fault-line.html', 'snippet': 'Seismologists directed by Japan’s new nuclear regula