n intact, with the new comedies  appearing next to franchises like “The Big Bang Theory” and “How I Met Your Mother.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Four new comedies are coming to the CBS schedule in the fall, each guarded by comedies that are already successful, like “How I Met Your Mother” and “The Big Bang Theory,” the network announced on Wednesday morning.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'CBS’s Schedule Adds 4 Comedies, Each Guarded by a Successful One', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Upfronts (Television)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CBS Corporation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-15T14:48:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Stelter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stelter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c81fac2e-e4e0-519d-9dc4-cb4b98a73248', 'word_count': 412, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c81fac2e-e4e0-519d-9dc4-cb4b98a73248'}, {'abstract': 'The financial crisis is not the only reason Americans cite for “derailing” their retirement plans, a new survey from Ameriprise Financial says.', 'web_url': 'https://bucks.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/15/why-retirement-savings-are-falling-short/', 'snippet': 'The financial crisis is not the only reason Americans cite for “derailing” their retirement plans, a new survey from Ameriprise Financial says.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s not just the recession that has set back Americans’ retirement savings, a new survey from Ameriprise Financial says.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Why Retirement Savings Are Falling Short', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pensions and Retirement Plans', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recession and Depression', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Savings', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ameriprise Financial Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-15T14:52:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ann Carrns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carrns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5d27965c-51bb-58a8-a055-dd214168f1b1', 'word_count': 336, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5d27965c-51bb-58a8-a055-dd214168f1b1'}, {'abstract': 'The report released on Wednesday by state ethics regulators offered a scathing assessment not just of Assemblyman Vito J. Lopez, but also of the Assembly speaker, Sheldon Silver, and his staff.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/16/nyregion/vito-lopez-accused-of-harassment-will-not-face-charges.html', 'snippet': 'The report released on Wednesday by state ethics regulators offered a scathing assessment not just of Assemblyman Vito J. Lopez, but also of the Assembly speaker, Sheldon Silver, and his staff.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One woman who worked for Assemblyman Vito J. Lopez said she contracted pink eye after he pressured her to put drops in his eyes. Another woman described being repeatedly groped by him until he forced his hands up her legs. Several employees said Mr. Lopez told them to wear low-cut blouses and high heels, or stay in hotel rooms with him overnight. Two women were so repulsed that they began secretly taping their interactions with Mr. Lopez. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/01/nyregion/01lopez1/01lopez1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/01/nyregion/01lopez1/01lopez1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/01/nyregion/01lopez1/01lopez1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/01/nyregion/01lopez1/01lopez1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/01/nyregion/01lopez1/01lopez1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/01/nyregion/01lopez1/01lopez1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/01/nyregion/01lopez1/01lopez1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Report Finds Lawmaker Was Shielded by Leaders', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ethics Panel Finds Lopez Was Shielded by Leaders', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hakim, Danny', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name':