ue': 'ADMISSIONS STANDARDS', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-15T17:24:46+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Education', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/4a62e4d6-ae11-559a-a00c-649c37151b8d', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/4a62e4d6-ae11-559a-a00c-649c37151b8d'}, {'abstract': 'Cardinal Timothy M. Dolan did not intend to question Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo’s standing in the Catholic Church, a spokesman said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/16/nyregion/cardinal-dolan-clarifies-remarks-about-cuomo.html', 'snippet': 'Cardinal Timothy M. Dolan did not intend to question Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo’s standing in the Catholic Church, a spokesman said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ALBANY – Cardinal Timothy M. Dolan did not intend to question Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo’s standing in the Roman Catholic Church, despite the governor’s support for abortion rights, the cardinal’s spokesman said on Wednesday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Archbishop Clarifies Remarks About Cuomo', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dolan Clarifies\r\nRadio Remarks\r\nAbout Governor', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dolan, Timothy M', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Roman Catholic Church', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ABORTION', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-15T17:26:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jesse McKinley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jesse', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McKinley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/11dc90ba-c4e3-5654-a4b4-501d97f31b9c', 'word_count': 264, 'uri': 'nyt://article/11dc90ba-c4e3-5654-a4b4-501d97f31b9c'}, {'abstract': 'Each spring, a woman would show her breasts and be cited or arrested, but in February, the police made sure officers knew the behavior wasn’t illegal.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/16/nyregion/a-police-roll-call-reminder-women-may-go-topless.html', 'snippet': 'Each spring, a woman would show her breasts and be cited or arrested, but in February, the police made sure officers knew the behavior wasn’t illegal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the cold of February, as New York City police officers gathered for their daily orders at roll call, they were given a rather unusual command, for both its timing and its substance: If they happened upon a topless woman, they were not to arrest her. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/16/nyregion/TOPLESS/TOPLESS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 382, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/16/nyregion/TOPLESS/TOPLESS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 382}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/16/nyregion/TOPLESS/TOPLESS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 651, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/16/nyregion/TOPLESS/TOPLESS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 925, 'width': 1454, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/16/nyregion/TOPLESS/TOPLESS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'h