 comments from readers of the Home section, drawn from letters and postings at nytimes.com, about Anne Raver’s article on a mysterious strain of downy mold\xa0killing one of the home gardener’s favorite annual flowers, Impatiens walleriana. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Defense of an Impatiens Abuser', 'kicker': 'Comments', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Defense Of an Impatiens Abuser', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gardens and Gardening', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Flowers and Plants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-15T22:18:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/5731da7f-49f5-5dd9-9a86-5763941916bd', 'word_count': 355, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5731da7f-49f5-5dd9-9a86-5763941916bd'}, {'abstract': 'The Milanese designer Paola Navone introduces a 20-piece bedroom collection at Anthropologie.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/16/garden/furnishings-by-paola-navone-for-anthropologie.html', 'snippet': 'The Milanese designer Paola Navone introduces a 20-piece bedroom collection at Anthropologie.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Milanese designer Paola Navone is famous (at least in Europe) for mixing North African and Asian artisanal handicrafts into modern goods. But now her reputation is about to make an Atlantic crossing. She recently introduced an outdoor furniture collection for Janus et Cie, and she’s working on interiors for the Como Hotel in the South Beach district of Miami, which will be presented in the fall. This week, Anthropologie, the quirkily stylish lifestyle chain, will release what Ms. Navone has described as her “dream bedroom collection.” This 20-piece line includes bed linens, furniture, suitcases, lighting and accessories. Prices range from $10 for a mercury-glass mushroom to $4,200 for a four-poster bed. Information: (212) 343-7070 or anthropologie.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/16/garden/16FURNITURE_SPAN/16CURR8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 505, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/16/garden/16FURNITURE_SPAN/16CURR8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 505}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/16/garden/16FURNITURE_SPAN/16CURR8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 861, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/16/garden/16FURNITURE_SPAN/16CURR8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1388, 'width': 1650, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/16/garden/16FURNITURE_SPAN/16CURR8-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/16/garden/16FURNITURE_SPAN/16CURR8-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/16/garden/16FURNITURE_SPAN/16CURR8-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bedding Fit for a Dreamer', 'kicker': 'Currents | Furniture', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bedding Fit for A Dreamer', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beds and Bedding', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hirst, Arlene', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Furniture', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Navone, Paola', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-15T22:19:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By Arlene Hirst', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Arlene', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hirst', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/06e21b4f-612f-530a-9e5c-dcaaa03c9495', 'word_count': 117, 'uri': 'nyt://article/06e21b4f-612f-530a-9e5c-dcaaa03c9495'}, {'abstract': 'Art Deco masterworks from a palace in Madrid will be up for auction on May 23.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/16/garden/even-duchesses-have-tag-sales.html', 'snippet': 'Art Deco masterworks from a palace in Madrid will be up for auction on May 23.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Most people don’t associate bathrooms with patinated floor lamps that have carved bronze birds for feet. Then again, most people don’t live in a palace. In the early 1920s, Armand Albert Rateau, an Art Deco master, created furniture for the Liria Palace in Madrid for the apartments of the Duchess of Alba, María del Rosario de Silva y Gurtubay, who married the 17th Duke of Alba in 1920. The palace was damaged in the Spanish Civil War, and some of Rateau’s pieces are lost to time. Now, the House of Alba is selling the rest of her collection at Christie’s France. Among the seven Rateau pieces included in the May 23 sale are the lamps (estimated at about $1.95 million to $2.6 million each); a carved and gilded wood daybed (shown, $520,000 to $780,000); and a Carrara marble tub (about $195,000 to $260,000). If only we could all scrub like royalty. Information: christies.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/16/garden/16EVENTS_SPAN/16EVENTS_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 378, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/16/garden/16EVENTS_SPAN/16EVENTS_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 378}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/16/garden/16EVENTS_SPAN/16EVENTS_SPAN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 645, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/16/garden/16EVENTS_SPAN/16EVENTS_SPAN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1291, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/16/garden/16EVENTS_SPAN/16EVENTS_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/16/garden/16EVENTS_SPAN/16EVENTS_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/16/garden/16EVENTS_SPAN/16EVENTS_SPAN-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Even Duchesses Have Tag Sales', 'kicker': 'Current | Events', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Even Duchesses Have Tag Sales', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Madrid (Spain)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nineteen Hundred Twenties', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ART DECO', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Auctions', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Christie's", 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Furniture', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interior Design and Furnishings', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rateau, Armand Albert', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-15T22:19:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Kurutz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kurutz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/62031500-86cf-5766-871d-0382f80e2655', 'word_count': 153, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62031500-86cf-5766-871d-0382f80e2655'}, {'abstract': 'Sales at Modernica, Broadway Panhandler and A+R.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/16/garden/garden-stovetop-and-wireless-accessories.html', 'snippet': 'Sales at Modernica, Broadway Panhandler and A+R.', 'lead_paragraph': 'From Friday through Sunday, Modernica will take 15 percent off all furniture, lighting, ceramics and garden accessories on its Web site, including items already on sale (a Case Study fiberglass rocker, originally $439, will be about $373; a George Nelson medium saucer Bubble lamp, originally $329, will be about $280). Use “FactorySale” as the code at checkout; modernica.net, (323) 933-0383.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/16/garden/16DEALS/16CURR3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 988, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'imag