 whose fractured ankle prevented him from being a part of a proposed Yankees trade for Cliff Lee in 2010, started at third base Wednesday night.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/15/yankee-realizes-dream-as-he-debuts-in-majors-on-his-26th-birthday/', 'snippet': 'David Adams, whose fractured ankle prevented him from being a part of a proposed Yankees trade for Cliff Lee in 2010, started at third base Wednesday night.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Had it not been for a small fracture in his right ankle, David Adams might have been playing Wednesday night’s game against the Yankees instead of for them, and Cliff Lee might have been on the mound wearing pinstripes.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Major League Debut on His 26th Birthday', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sports Injuries', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-16T02:01:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8ddb4e94-1844-550c-a520-dab8a94c5f66', 'word_count': 770, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8ddb4e94-1844-550c-a520-dab8a94c5f66'}, {'abstract': 'Exports grew 3.8 percent, pushed higher by strong shipments of cars and other manufactured goods to the United States.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/16/business/global/japans-economy-growing-at-3-5-annualized-rate.html', 'snippet': 'Exports grew 3.8 percent, pushed higher by strong shipments of cars and other manufactured goods to the United States.', 'lead_paragr