, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/16/sports/baseball/16batterup/16batterup-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/16/sports/baseball/16batterup/16batterup-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/16/sports/baseball/16batterup/16batterup-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Tale of Wrong-Way McKenry', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pittsburgh Pirates', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-16T17:43:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/045bf7d7-ab00-56a7-aee2-85d3e0eead92', 'word_count': 89, 'uri': 'nyt://article/045bf7d7-ab00-56a7-aee2-85d3e0eead92'}, {'abstract': 'An obsession with the least-visited National Park Service property in the country animates an argument for vanishing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/19/travel/a-case-for-getting-far-far-away.html', 'snippet': 'An obsession with the least-visited National Park Service property in the country animates an argument for vanishing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For a decade now I’ve been obsessed with one of the most overlooked patches of real estate on the American Monopoly board — a place I’ve never even seen and that you’ve probably never heard of called Aniakchak National Monument and Preserve. Aniakchak, which is in Alaska, is the least-visited of the 401 National Park Service properties. Just 19 people stopped by Aniakchak last year, which makes the runner-up, Port Chicago Naval Magazine National Memorial in California — visitors: 533 — a logjam of humanity by comparison.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/travel/19ESSAY_SPAN/19ESSAY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 298, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/19/travel/19ESSAY_SPAN/19ESSAY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 298}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/travel/19ESSAY_SPAN/19ESSAY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 508, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/travel/19ESSAY_SPAN/19ESSAY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1016, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/travel/19ESSAY_SPAN/19ESSAY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/19/travel/19ESSAY_SPAN/19ESSAY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/travel/19ESSAY_SPAN/19ESSAY-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Case for Getting Far, Far Away', 'kicker': 'Personal Journeys', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Deep in the Heart of Nowhere', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Solomon, Christopher', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'National Parks, Monuments and Seashores', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Aniakchak National Monument and Preserve (Alaska)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ALASKA', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-16T17:46:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christopher Solomon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christopher', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Solomon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/72f840f5-2db5-59ac-a312-3ba4bdaaa6a3', 'word_count': 1376, 'uri': 'nyt://article/72f840f5-2db5-59ac-a312-3ba4bdaaa6a3'}, {'abstract': 'One of the hardest parts about developing leukemia at age 22 was how restrictive it was: My treatments left me highly susceptible to infection, airplanes were strictly off limits and even a trip to my neighborhood bodega required a protective face mask.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/16/life-interrupted-getting-away/', 'snippet': 'One of the hardest parts about developing leukemia at age 22 was how restrictive it was: My treatments left me highly susceptible to infection, airplanes were strictly off limits and even a trip to my neighborhood bodega required a protective face...', 'lead_paragraph': 'Like a lot of other cancer patients lying in hospital beds or in chemotherapy suites, I have spent a fair amount of time fantasizing about jetting off to a tropical island. A certain part of me knew that the fantasy was really about escaping my disease, but even so, I made a pastime of watching planes in the sky and dreaming of white, sandy beaches.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/16/health/well-suleika/well-suleika-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 373, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/16/health/well-suleika/well-suleika-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 373}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/16/health/well-suleika/well-suleika-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 637, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/16/health/well-suleika/well-suleika-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1274, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/16/health/well-suleika/well-suleika-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/16/health/well-suleika/well-suleika-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/16/health/well-suleika/well-suleika-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Life, Interrupted: Getting Away', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cancer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Leukemia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-16T17:47:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Suleika Jaouad', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Suleika', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jaouad', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4aad3d37-da1c-5883-9d8c-938d8a3991a4', 'word_count': 814, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4aad3d37-da1c-5883-9d8c-938d8a3991a4'}, {'abstract': 'The 415 cars starting in this year’s Mille Miglia Storica are a record number for the historic Italian road race.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/16/2013-mille-miglia-features-record-entry-numbers/', 'snippet': 'The 415 cars starting in this year’s Mille Miglia Storica are a record number for the historic Italian road race.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BRESCIA, Italy – The 2013 Mille Miglia Storica tribute rally began Thursday evening here in a driving rainstorm, but the inclement weather did little to dampen the enthusiasm of a record entry of 415 starters. The list included a star-studded collection of film actors, musicians, major and minor celebrities, business executives, fashionistas, professional racing drivers and classic-car enthusiasts from around the world.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '2013 Mille Miglia Features Record Entry Numbers', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Antique and Classic Cars', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Coulthard, David', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Day-Lewis, Daniel', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ferragamo,