, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0fa262fa-6c32-5726-9d5d-a5555cf78a6f', 'word_count': 225, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0fa262fa-6c32-5726-9d5d-a5555cf78a6f'}, {'abstract': 'The musical comedy “A Gentleman’s Guide to Love & Murder” is coming to the Walter Kerr Theater in the fall.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/16/a-gentlemans-guide-to-love-murder-coming-to-broadway/', 'snippet': 'The musical comedy “A Gentleman’s Guide to Love & Murder” is coming to the Walter Kerr Theater in the fall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The musical comedy “A Gentleman’s Guide to Love & Murder,” which has received critical acclaim in Hartford and San Diego for the dexterous performance of the Tony Award winner Jefferson Mays in multiple roles, will transfer to Broadway this fall, the producers confirmed on Thursday. The musical is to begin preview performances at the Walter Kerr Theater on Oct. 22 and open on Nov. 17, with Mr. Mays (“I Am My Own Wife”) again playing eight different heirs to the D’Ysquith family fortune – all of whom become targets for a disinherited distant relative. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘A Gentleman’s Guide to Love & Murder’ Coming to Broadway', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Freedman, Robert L', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lutvak, Steven', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mays, Jefferson', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Parnes, Joey', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tresnjak, Darko', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hartford Stage Co', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', '