cards,” directed by Pauline Chan, a heart-tugging Chinese orphan develops a relationship with her far-off sponsor.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/17/movies/33-postcards-directed-by-pauline-chan.html', 'snippet': 'In “33 Postcards,” directed by Pauline Chan, a heart-tugging Chinese orphan develops a relationship with her far-off sponsor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Guy Pearce is an award-winning actor with dozens of film and television roles on his résumé, but in “33 Postcards” he is eclipsed by an unknown young actress named Zhu Lin, whose charming performance gives this sweet if not very credible film its heart.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/17/arts/17RDP_THIRTYTHREE_SPAN/17RDP_THIRTYTHREE_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 372, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/17/arts/17RDP_THIRTYTHREE_SPAN/17RDP_THIRTYTHREE_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 372}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/17/arts/17RDP_THIRTYTHREE_SPAN/17RDP_THIRTYTHREE_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 636, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/17/arts/17RDP_THIRTYTHREE_SPAN/17RDP_THIRTYTHREE_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1271, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/17/arts/17RDP_THIRTYTHREE_SPAN/FILMROUNDUP5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/17/arts/17RDP_THIRTYTHREE_SPAN/FILMROUN