_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0a88edc1-6213-5519-b05b-80d1d8944787', 'word_count': 519, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0a88edc1-6213-5519-b05b-80d1d8944787'}, {'abstract': 'Dellin Betances, once a top 50 prospect, has struggled at Class AAA, but after a couple of encouraging outings the Yankees called him up to shore up their overtaxed bullpen.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/16/out-of-necessity-yanks-call-up-betances/', 'snippet': 'Dellin Betances, once a top 50 prospect, has struggled at Class AAA, but after a couple of encouraging outings the Yankees called him up to shore up their overtaxed bullpen.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Before the 2012 season, Dellin Betances was a top 50 prospect in baseball and one of the Yankees’ most promising young players. But after a season in which he posted a 6.44 earned run average, Betances dropped off top prospect lists and was thought to be far away from making the majors.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Out of Necessity, Yanks Call Up Betances', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Betances, Dellin', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-17T00:06:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jorge Arangure Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jorge', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Arangure', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0be29dd3-94f3-5a54-8d4b-91ce144cd297', 'word_count': 232, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0be29dd3-94f3-5a54-8d4b-91ce144cd297'}, {'abstract': 'The documentary “Re-emerging: The Jews of Nigeria” focuses on a minority that claims to be descended from ancient Israelites.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/17/movies/re-emerging-the-jews-of-nigeria-a-documentary.html', 'snippet': 'The documentary “Re-emerging: The Jews of Nigeria” focuses on a minority that claims to be descended from ancient Israelites.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Are the Ibo people of Nigeria a lost tribe of Israel? A longstanding tradition among the Ibo says they are, and points to similarities in Ibo and Jewish cultures: a prescribed day of rest, circumcision (male, that is), the prohibition of pork. And now some Ibo have embraced Judaism, considering it the religion of their ancestors.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/17/arts/17RDP_RE-EMERGING_SPAN/FILMROUNDUP8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 476, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/17/arts/17RDP_RE-EMERGING_SPAN/FILMROUNDUP8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 476}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/17/arts/17RDP_RE-EMERGING_SPAN/FILMROUNDUP8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 601, 'width': 757, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/17/arts/17RDP_RE-EMERGING_SPAN/FILMROUNDUP8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 601, 'width': 757, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/17/arts/17RDP_RE-EMERGING_SPAN/FILMROUNDUP8-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/17/arts/17RDP_RE-EMER