ml', 'snippet': 'The last moments in the life of Tayshana Murphy, an 18-year-old who was shot in her Upper Manhattan public housing project, were recounted in State Supreme Court.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the final moments of her young life, she danced in the playground next to her apartment building with her big sister and friends, joyfully oblivious to the bloody turf fights roiling from block to block all around her. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Trial Opens in the Killing of a Young Basketball Star', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Trial Opens in the Killing Of a Young Basketball Star', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brockington, Tyshawn', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Murphy, Tayshana', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cartagena, Robert', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Morningside Heights (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Collins, Terique', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-17T02:40:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Russ Buettner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Russ', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Buettner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d64459ed-a979-5d4a-93b5-d5dfdf8fb875', 'word_count': 640, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d64459ed-a979-5d4a-93b5-d5dfdf8fb875'}, {'abstract': 'A lawyer sought an injunction to prevent a CBS series about the office of the Brooklyn district attorney, Charles J. Hynes, from including anything about his client, a landlord charged after a fatal fire.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/17/nyregion/more-complaints-about-planned-tv-show-on-brooklyn-prosecutor.html', 'snippet': 'A lawyer sought an injunction to prevent a CBS series about the office of the Brooklyn district attorney, Charles J. Hynes, from including anything about his client, a landlord charged after a fatal fire.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A decision by the Brooklyn district attorney, Charles J. Hynes, to let his office be the subject of a six-part CBS News series has prompted another volley of criticism — this time from a lawyer complaining that the show, “Brooklyn D.A.,” would prejudice prospective jurors when his client goes on trial.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Lawyer Criticizes Brooklyn Prosecutor Over TV Show', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Defense Lawyer Criticizes Prosecutor Over TV Show', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Berger, Joseph', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'District Attorneys', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hynes, Charles J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Reality Television', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shargel, Gerald L', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CBS Corporation', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Landlords', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fires and Firefighters', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gerazounis, Argyrios', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chun, Danny K', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons',