bstract': 'A soul singer named Candice Glover was crowned winner of ‘American Idol,’ concluding a season in which judges’ squabbles overshadowed contestants, and the show lost ground to its rivals.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/18/arts/music/candice-glover-prevails-but-american-idol-is-losing-spark.html', 'snippet': 'A soul singer named Candice Glover was crowned winner of ‘American Idol,’ concluding a season in which judges’ squabbles overshadowed contestants, and the show lost ground to its rivals.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If this was the year that “American Idol,” the deeply influential but troubled singing competition, hoped to prove its worth as a minter of future music stars, it came up short. If this was the year it hoped to bring stasis to its lately evolving judges’ panel, it also missed the mark. And if this was the year it hoped to demonstrate continued dominance over the other vocal contest shows that have arrived in the wake of its juggernaut success, then consider that strike three.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/17/arts/music/18idol_web1/17idol_web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/17/arts/music/18idol_web1/17idol_web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/17/arts/music/18idol_web1/17idol_web1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/17/arts/music/18idol_web1/17idol_web1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'