], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/432bd3ed-02ca-55fc-b8ad-ad1480d833b9', 'word_count': 1457, 'uri': 'nyt://article/432bd3ed-02ca-55fc-b8ad-ad1480d833b9'}, {'abstract': 'Russia sends more missiles to Syria; a dreary news conference for a beleaguered President Obama; the “Beef-gate” scandal swirls in Indonesia; and David Beckham retires from soccer.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/17/iht-quick-read-may-17/', 'snippet': 'Russia sends more missiles to Syria; a dreary news conference for a beleaguered President Obama; the “Beef-gate” scandal swirls in Indonesia; and David Beckham retires from soccer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEWS Russia has sent advanced antiship cruise missiles to Syria, a move that illustrates the depth of its support for the Syrian government led by President Bashar al-Assad, American officials said Thursday. Michael R. Gordon and Eric Schmitt report from Washington.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/17/us/17obamacnd5_337/17obamacnd5_337-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 372, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/17/us/17obamacnd5_337/17obamacnd5_337-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 372}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/17/us/17obamacnd5_337/17obamacnd5_337-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 635, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/17/us/17obamacnd5_337/17obamacnd5_337-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1270, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/0