, a Manager’s Finest Hour and a Half', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ferguson, Alex', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-17T08:00:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Graham Ruthven', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Graham', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ruthven', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/974ccc36-66f1-5184-8789-309b93a717a2', 'word_count': 573, 'uri': 'nyt://article/974ccc36-66f1-5184-8789-309b93a717a2'}, {'abstract': 'Where does the colon in these sentences belong?', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/17/test-yourself-editing-practice-may-17-2013/', 'snippet': 'Where does the colon in these sentences belong?', 'lead_paragraph': 'The question was written by Katherine Schulten. It comes from the article “The Art of Repetition.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Test Yourself | Editing Practice, May 17, 2013', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-05-17T08:24:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Learning Network', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Learning Network'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e35c306e-6436-5a2f-bacc-d156a04bdc90', 'word_count': 36, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e35c306e-6436-5a2f-bacc-d156a04bdc90'}, {'abstract': 'What are some of the scandals and failures that are weighing down on Mr. Obama’s second term, according to the article?', 'web_url': 'https://learning.b