2981', 'word_count': 715, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a8e6e24f-52ec-5484-85c5-7565677d2981'}, {'abstract': 'A day in the life of armed America.', 'web_url': 'https://nocera.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/17/the-gun-report-may-17-2013/', 'snippet': 'A day in the life of armed America.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Yesterday, Maryland’s governor, Martin O’Malley, signed a bill that made the state’s gun laws among the strictest in the nation. Under the new legislation, anyone buying a handgun will have to submit fingerprints to obtain a license. The bill also bans 45 types of assault weapons; gun magazines will be limited to 10 bullets; gun ownership by people who have been involuntarily committed to a mental health facility will be banned; and police will be able to suspend the licenses of gun dealers who fail to comply with record-keeping obligations.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Gun Report: May 17, 2013', 'kicker': 'Joe Nocera', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ARIZONA', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Atlanta (Ga)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Colorado', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Florida', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Georgia', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Illinois', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Indiana', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Jersey City (NJ)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kentucky', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Louisiana', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Maryland', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Oakland (Calif)', 'rank':