ome someone who could love and be loved, for the long haul.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the romantic comedy “Silver Linings Playbook,” Pat emerges from a mental institution and finds new love with a dark-haired loose cannon named Tiffany. Pat is bipolar, a condition that reveals itself mainly in manic episodes of aggressive optimism. He runs for miles a day in a trash bag vest to make himself “sweat more,” fixates on his ex-wife and keeps score of his life’s silver linings. ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/fashion/19MODERNLOVE/19MODERNLOVE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 725, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/19/fashion/19MODERNLOVE/19MODERNLOVE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 725}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/fashion/19MODERNLOVE/19MODERNLOVE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 848, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/fashion/19MODERNLOVE/19MODERNLOVE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1695, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/fashion/19MODERNLOVE/19MODERNLOVE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/19/fashion/19MODERNLOVE/19MODERNLOVE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/fashion/19MODERNLOVE/19MODERNLOVE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Making a Hard Choice for a Soft Landing', 'kicker': 'Modern Love', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Making a Hard Choice for a Soft Landing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Love (Emotion)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mental Health and Disorders', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bipolar Disorder', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dating and Courtship', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Silver Linings Playbook (Movie)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Modern Love (Times Column)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-17T16:00:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tana Wojczuk', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tana', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wojczuk', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3db84231-514e-5aec-9f18-904a45f61a21', 'word_count': 1514, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3db84231-514e-5aec-9f18-904a45f61a21'}, {'abstract': 'A growing number of developers cater to the needs of families looking to settle in West Chelsea, home to the popular High Line park.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/19/realestate/developers-follow-families-downtown.html', 'snippet': 'A growing number of developers cater to the needs of families looking to settle in West Chelsea, home to the popular High Line park.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the whitewashed art galleries of West Chelsea, parents pushing baby carriages are now as commonly seen as quirky art students, while the recently opened Avenues: the World School has brought streams of well-heeled school children flo