 hundreds of millions of dollars, may be headed over a blockbuster cliff.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the big Hollywood film studios, this summer could turn out to be “Apocalypse the Day after Tomorrow: Clash of the Blockbusters.” Or maybe “Armageddon 2 — Revenge of the Critics.”', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/18/business/18stewart-web1/18stewart-web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 290, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/18/business/18stewart-web1/18stewart-web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 290}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/18/business/18stewart-web1/18stewart-web1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 495, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/18/business/18stewart-web1/18stewart-web1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 833, 'width': 1724, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/18/business/18stewart-web1/18stewart-web1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/18/business/18stewart-web1/18stewart-web1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/18/business/18stewart-web1/18stewart-web1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Flop Looms as Studios Lean on B