y-three-ways.html', 'snippet': 'Staying in a treehouse, a caboose and a yurt, and discovering the real reason to take a rustic vacation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A man dangling 65 feet up in a poplar tree is a man with a new perspective. Not just because of the view, although it was impressive, since this particular poplar was atop one of the Blue Ridge Mountains in Virginia. The dangling man suddenly could see a lot of things differently.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/travel/19BACKCOUNTRY_SPAN-sf/19BACKCOUNTRY1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 342, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/19/travel/19BACKCOUNTRY_SPAN-sf/19BACKCOUNTRY1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 342}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/travel/19BACKCOUNTRY_SPAN-sf/19BACKCOUNTRY1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 584, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/travel/19BACKCOUNTRY_SPAN-sf/19BACKCOUNTRY1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1168, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/travel/19BACKCOUNTRY_SPAN-sf/19BACKCOUNTRY_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/19/travel/19BACKCOUNTRY_SPAN-sf/19BACKCOUNTRY_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/travel/19BA