ngled out for awards were “Pippin” and “Who’s Afraid of Virginia Woolf?”', 'lead_paragraph': '“Kinky Boots” was named best musical and “Vanya and Sonia and Masha and Spike” was awarded best play at the Drama League’s annual awards ceremony on Friday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Drama League Prizes Awarded to ‘Kinky Boots’ and ‘Vanya and Sonia’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lane, Nathan', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Peters, Bernadette', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Drama League', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-17T20:15:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Scott Heller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Scott', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Heller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/895abf32-1c7e-5ac2-9bb2-f849c46040ae', 'word_count': 160, 'uri': 'nyt://article/895abf32-1c7e-5ac2-9bb2-f849c46040ae'}, {'abstract': 'A New York City Ballet program features choreography by Peter Martins, set to music by American composers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/18/arts/dance/city-ballets-program-of-peter-martins-works-at-koch-theater.html', 'snippet': 'A New York City Ballet program features choreography by Peter Martins, set to music by American composers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 1988, when Peter Martins choreographed “Sophisticated Lady” for New York City Ballet, the piece’s raison d’être was its casting: Suzanne Farrell matched with her old partner, Mr. Martins. And last year, when Mr. Martins pulled the dance out of the closet for City Ballet’s fashion-themed fall gala (with Maria Kowroski and Charles Askegard in the main roles), the justification was new fashion by Valentino. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/18/arts/18SOPHISTICATED/18SOPHISTICATED-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 274, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/18/arts/18SOPHISTICATED/18SOPHISTICATED-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 274}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/18/arts/18SOPHISTICATED/18SOPHISTICATED-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 467, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/18/arts/18SOPHISTICATED/18SOPHISTICATED-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 935, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/18/arts/18SOPHISTICATED/18SOPHISTICATED-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/18/arts/18SOPHISTICATED/18SOPHISTICATED-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/18/arts/18SOPHISTICATED/18SOPHISTICATED-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Can a Great American Composer Get the Respect He Deserves at the Ballet?', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Can a Great American Composer Get the Respect He Deserves at the Ballet?', 'n