land', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New Role for ‘Mad’ Man', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dowling, Joe', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Firth, Colin', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kartheiser, Vincent', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Guthrie Theater', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Minneapolis (Minn)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-17T21:31:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Schuessler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schuessler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/14531cd0-2a56-51d3-a606-6c4751814211', 'word_count': 139, 'uri': 'nyt://article/14531cd0-2a56-51d3-a606-6c4751814211'}, {'abstract': 'After an article on Americans who choose to move to other countries in later years and continue working, readers tell of their own experience.', 'web_url': 'https://bucks.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/17/going-abroad-to-keep-working-not-retire/', 'snippet': 'After an article on Americans who choose to move to other countries in later years and continue working, readers tell of their own experience.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ten years ago, Breck Morrison and his wife, Marci Russo, moved from their home in Los Osos, Calif., to a tiny beach town on the east coast of Australia. They secured long-term retirement visas, allowing them to continue working while also enjoying a new life in Queensland. Ms. Russo is working as a teaching assistant. And after realizing that living in a small town required them to “make our own fun,” the couple began volunteering at community events and helped start a book club and a dragon boat club.', 'sou