], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/452b57a9-e294-5391-859f-a50a0cc1a187', 'word_count': 652, 'uri': 'nyt://article/452b57a9-e294-5391-859f-a50a0cc1a187'}, {'abstract': 'Chung Sol Bat is a restaurant a short distance from the Boston Market in Edison, but it has very different offerings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/19/nyregion/review-of-chung-sol-bat-restaurant-in-edison.html', 'snippet': 'Chung Sol Bat is a restaurant a short distance from the Boston Market in Edison, but it has very different offerings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Boston Market on Route 1 North in Edison serves fast, casual food, with choices that include chicken and lots of vegetables. But turn in before you reach that chain outpost and head for the strip mall behind it, and you will discover Chung Sol Bat.', 'print_section': 'NJ', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/nyregion/19DINE-NJ2/19DINE-NJ2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/19/nyregion/19DINE-NJ2/19DINE-NJ2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/nyregion/19DINE-NJ2/19DINE-NJ2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/nyregion/19DINE-NJ2/19DINE-NJ2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/nyregion/19DINE-NJ2/19DINE-NJ2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType'