13/05/19/nyregion/coffee-and-ballet-for-patsy-tarr-philanthropist.html', 'snippet': 'Patsy Tarr and her husband, Jeff, have two espresso machines and drink four lattes each to start the day.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ballet often figures into a Sunday for Patsy Tarr, 65, the philanthropist and publisher who runs the 2wice Arts Foundation, which specializes in digital and print projects uniting dance and design. Her latest endeavor, an interactive iPad app in which Tom Gold, a former New York City Ballet soloist, dances with an image of himself to a score by Charles Yang, will be available in mid-June. She lives on the Upper West Side with her husband, Jeff, 68, a former Wall Street risk arbitrageur who runs the JCT Foundation, and their Shih Tzu, Coco. Their children, Jeff Tarr Jr. and Jennie Tarr Coyne, and five grandchildren all live nearby.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/nyregion/19ROUTINE1/19ROUTINE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 402, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/19/nyregion/19ROUTINE1/19ROUTINE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 402}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/nyregion/19ROUTINE1/19ROUTINE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 686, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/nyregion/19ROUTINE1/19ROUTINE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1373, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/nyregion/19ROUTINE1/19ROUTINE1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 7