5/19/nyregion/eastern-parkway-a-triumph-of-olmsted-and-vaux.html', 'snippet': 'Eastern Parkway, which extends a little over two miles in Brooklyn, was mapped out in 1868 by Frederick Law Olmsted and Calvert Vaux.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Looking down Eastern Parkway from Grand Army Plaza’s Memorial Arch, past the Brooklyn Public Library, past the Botanic Garden and McKim, Mead and White’s Brooklyn Museum, you might be reminded of Paris and the broad avenues that radiate from the Arc de Triomphe. Mapped out in 1868 by Frederick Law Olmsted and Calvert Vaux, Eastern Parkway extends a little over two miles, from Prospect Park to Ralph Avenue. ', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/nyregion/19LOCAL1_SPAN/19LOCAL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 469, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/19/nyregion/19LOCAL1_SPAN/19LOCAL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 469}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/nyregion/19LOCAL1_SPAN/19LOCAL1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 801, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/nyregion/19LOCAL1_SPAN/19LOCAL1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1601, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/nyregion/19LOCAL1_SPAN/19LOCAL1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/19/nyregion/19LOCAL1_SPAN/19LOCAL1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'ran