to the governor went unreported and a chef who calls himself a whistle-blower.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/19/us/politics/virginia-governor-and-attorney-general-linked-in-scandal.html', 'snippet': 'The drama includes an accusation that a $15,000 gift from a donor to the governor went unreported and a chef who calls himself a whistle-blower.', 'lead_paragraph': 'RICHMOND, Va. — A celebrated chef. A political donor with a private jet to lend and a product to pitch. The state’s top two elected officials.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/us/VIRGINIA-2/VIRGINIA-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 389, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/19/us/VIRGINIA-2/VIRGINIA-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 389}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/us/VIRGINIA-2/VIRGINIA-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 665, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/us/VIRGINIA-2/VIRGINIA-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1329, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/us/VIRGINIA-2/VIRGINIA-2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/19/us/VIRGINIA-2/VIRGINIA-2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/us/VIRGINIA-2/VIRGINIA-2-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'he