rk contrast of the ink and the milk is a lovely mental picture. Finally, the idea that, as a child, Ms. Munro was more enchanted by the idea of trying the ink in milk experiment but was hesitant to WASTE THE MILK is particularly moving. I’m truly not sure which part of the quote I liked best.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Variety: A Lovely Acrostic', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Acrostic Puzzles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-18T16:00:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Deb Amlen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Deb', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Amlen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bf7406b7-1593-549c-b4f5-4bbfd6f3ca31', 'word_count': 388, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bf7406b7-1593-549c-b4f5-4bbfd6f3ca31'}, {'abstract': 'The other half of the inequality story, the skills gap, should also command our attention.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/18/the-1-percent-are-only-half-the-problem/', 'snippet': 'The other half of the inequality story, the skills gap, should also command our attention.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Most recent discussion about economic inequality in the United States has focused on the top 1 percent of the nation’s income distribution, a group whose incomes average $1 million (with a bottom threshold of about $367,000). “We are the 99 percent,” declared the Occupy protesters, unexpectedly popularizing research findings by two economists, Thomas Piketty and Emmanuel Saez, that had previously drawn attention mainly from academics. But the gap between the 1 percent and the 99 percent is only half the story.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': 