efbd76d6', 'word_count': 1051, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fe5c437a-7be6-53a8-845c-7f90efbd76d6'}, {'abstract': 'Beyond providing fuel for the workday, our daily coffee rituals can say much about our personal finances and attitudes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/19/jobs/our-coffee-rituals-say-much-about-us.html', 'snippet': 'Beyond providing fuel for the workday, our daily coffee rituals can say much about our personal finances and attitudes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE caffeine rituals of my co-workers are many and varied. In the morning, there are at least eight places where you can buy coffee on 40th Street in Manhattan between Seventh and Eighth Avenues, including the cart where the lady says “Hi, beautiful!” and puts your $1 cup in a brown paper bag with a little white napkin.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/business/19-WORK/19-WORK-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 567, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/19/business/19-WORK/19-WORK-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 567}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/business/19-WORK/19-WORK-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 967, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/business/19-WORK/19-WORK-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1934, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/business/19-WORK/19-WORK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/19/business/19-WORK/19-WORK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/business/19-WORK/19-WORK-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Coffee Rites, and the Stories They Tell', 'kicker': 'Workstation', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Coffee Rites, And the Stories They Tell', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coffee', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Korkki, Phyllis', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Caffeine', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Productivity', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Workplace Environment', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-18T18:31:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'SundayBusiness', 'section_name': 'Job Market', 'byline': {'original': 'By Phyllis Korkki', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Phyllis', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Korkki', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5dccff46-3bc3-5a71-b672-35606164f732', 'word_count': 783, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5dccff46-3bc3-5a71-b672-35606164f732'}, {'abstract': 'The San Antonio Spurs seem aware that the Memphis Grizzlies are also a team willing to grind things out in the all-function, no-form style that the Spurs have patented.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/19/sports/basketball/in-nba-playoffs-the-spurs-are-read-to-grind-it-out.html', 'snippet': 'The San Antonio Spurs seem aware that the Memphis Grizzlies are also a team willing to grind things out in the all-function, no-form style that the Spurs have patented.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a league dominated by superstars, the San Antonio Spurs built the most mundane of dynasties. There was never any question that Tim Duncan belonged on the short list of the greatest power forwards in N.B.A. history, or that Tony Parker and Manu Ginobili were fantastic players, but the team was seemingly easy to forget in a world of Kobe Bryants and LeBron Jameses.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Next Up for the Spurs: A Look in a Mirror ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Next Up for the Spurs: A Look in a Mirror', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'San Antonio Spurs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Memphis Grizzlies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Duncan, Tim', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Parker, Tony', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ginobili, Manu', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Curry, Stephen', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-18T18:37:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Hoffman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hoffman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a1601a0b-52f1-5176-ac83-8ba6d8fe6b54', 'word_count': 500, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a1601a0b-52f1-5176-ac83-8ba6d8fe6b54'}, {'abstract': 'The point guard, who was hurt in Game 4 against the Knicks, must complete a series of exertion exercises before being cleared to play.', 'web_url': 'https://offthedribble.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/18/pacers-hill-is-working-his-way-back-from-concussion/', 'snippet': 'The point guard, who was hurt in Game 4 against the Knicks, must complete a series of exertion exercises before being cleared to play.', 'lead_paragraph': 'INDIANAPOLIS — Pacers point guard George Hill participated in the team’s shoot-around Saturday as part of the exertion testing he must pass to be cleared to resume play after sustaining a concussion in Game 4 of Indiana’s playoff series against the Knicks.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pacers’ Hill Is Working His Way Back From Concussion', 'kicker': 'Off the Dribble', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Concussions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Augustin, D J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hill, George', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Indiana Pacers', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Knicks', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Indiana', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-18T18:42:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Zach Schonbrun', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Zach', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schonbrun', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e14ab022-b9d6-576a-b984-4d74d29cc08d', 'word_count': 519, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e14ab022-b9d6-576a-b984-4d74d29cc08d'}, {'abstract': 'Yankees General Manager Brian Cashman continues to tweak his roster at the margins, adding infielder Reid Brignac from the Colorado Rockies for cash.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/19/sports/baseball/cashman-and-injury-riddled-yanks-keep-dealing.html', 'snippet': 'Yankees General Manager Brian Cashman continues to tweak his roster at the margins, adding infielder Reid Brignac from the Colorado Rockies for cash.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Yankees General Manager Brian Cashman continues to tweak his roster at the margins, making yet another move aimed at upgrading the talent on a team riddled with injuries. Late Friday, he acquired infielder Reid Brignac from the Colorado Rockies for cash and designated Alberto Gonzalez for assignment to make room on the roster.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/sports/PINS/PINS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 408, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/19/sports/PINS/PINS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 408}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/sports/PINS/PINS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 696, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/sports/PINS/PINS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1392, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/sports/PINS/PINS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/19/sports/PINS/PINS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013