yCar racing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/19/sports/with-simona-de-silvestro.html', 'snippet': 'With Danica Patrick driving in Nascar full time, Simona De Silvestro is the top woman of IndyCar racing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With Danica Patrick driving in Nascar full time, Simona De Silvestro is the top woman of IndyCar racing. De Silvestro, a 24-year-old from Switzerland, was trying to qualify this weekend for her fourth Indianapolis 500, which takes place next Sunday. She was rookie of the year in her first Indy 500 in 2010, with a 14th-place finish. Four races into the 2013 season, she is ninth in the IndyCar Series standings after three top-10 finishes. This is her first season with KV Racing Technology.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/sports/19seconds/19seconds-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 872, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/19/sports/19seconds/19seconds-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 872}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/sports/19seconds/19seconds-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 705, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/sports/19seconds/19seconds-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1410, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/sports/19seconds/19seconds-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/19/sports/19seconds/19seconds-thumbStandard.j