ec3-9400-2b168ee2ce52'}, {'abstract': 'Donald Lutz, the second graduate of Major League Baseball’s International European Academy, is now playing for the Cincinnati Reds.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/19/sports/baseball/reds-donald-lutz-makes-majors-from-germany.html', 'snippet': 'Donald Lutz, the second graduate of Major League Baseball’s International European Academy, is now playing for the Cincinnati Reds.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Several years later, Donald Lutz recalls the scene with a mix of amusement and embarrassment. He was a camper at Major League Baseball’s International European Academy in Italy, and the other teenagers lined up to get the autograph of an instructor. Lutz followed their lead, but he did not know why he should care about having Rod Carew’s name on a baseball.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/sports/dog-bases-1/dog-bases-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 423, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/19/sports/dog-bases-1/dog-bases-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 423}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/sports/dog-bases-1/dog-bases-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 721, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/sports/dog-bases-1/dog-bases-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1443, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/19/sports/dog-bases-1/dog-bases-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'th