d', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hader, Bill', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Broadcasting Co', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-19T12:56:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b1b04457-713b-5848-a6f6-617a43dfdbea', 'word_count': 314, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b1b04457-713b-5848-a6f6-617a43dfdbea'}, {'abstract': 'In the beginning we kept our son’s battle with heroin addiction to ourselves. When we finally spoke up, we found we were not alone.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/19/ending-the-secrecy-of-a-childs-addiction/', 'snippet': 'In the beginning we kept our son’s battle with heroin addiction to ourselves. When we finally spoke up, we found we were not alone.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Almost two years ago my wife and I became aware that our 22-year-old son, William, was using heroin. At the time he was already seeing a psychotherapist. Over the next two years we added an addiction psychiatrist, out-patient treatment, treatment with Suboxone, in-patient detox, in-patient treatment, out-patient treatment, out-patient detox, treatment with Vivitrol, more out-patient treatment, another in-patient treatment, more out-patient treatment, a revolving door of well over a dozen trips to and from the emergency rooms of at least four different hospitals, an attempt to work with another addiction psychiatrist, Alcoholics Anonymous, Narcotics Anonymous, and a home life fraught with tension, despair, sometimes hopeful during intermittent periods of sobriety, and always filled with the apprehension of misfortune.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ending the Secrecy of a Child’s Addiction', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drug Abuse and Traffic', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Heroin', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mental Health and Disorders', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Alcoholics Anonymous', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-19T14:19:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Williams', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Williams', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f188bf89-bb6c-5b96-b7d8-58a43b892c42', 'word_count': 674, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f188bf89-bb6c-5b96-b7d8-58a43b892c42'}, {'abstract': 'With a growing population of Americans over the age of 65, but a lack of trained home health care workers, more and more people could opt to hire robots to do the job.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/19/disruptions-helper-robots-are-steered-tentatively-to-elder-care/', 'snippet': 'With a growing population of Americans over the age of 65, but a lack of trained home health care workers, more and more people could opt to hire robots to do the job.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the opening scene of the movie “Robot & Frank,” which takes place in the near future, Frank, an elderly man who lives alone, is arguing with his son about going to a medical center for Alzheimer’s treatment when the son interrupts him. “I brought you something,” he says to Frank. Then the son pulls a large, white humanoid robot from the trunk of his car.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/20/technology/20disrupt-pic2/20disrupt-pic2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 347, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/20/technology/20disrupt-pic2/20disrupt-pic2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 347}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/20/technology/20disrupt-pic2/20disrupt-pic2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 592, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/20/technology/20disrupt-pic2/20disrupt-pic2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1184, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/20/technology/20disrupt-pic2/20disrupt-pic2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/20/technology/20disrupt-pic2/20disrupt-pic2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/20/technology/20disrupt-pic2/20disrupt-pic2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Disruptions: Helper Robots Are Steered, Tentatively, to Care for the Aging', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Helper Robots Are Steered, Tentatively, to Care for Aging', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elder Care', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elderly', 