ee7d99b', 'word_count': 990, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e75243ff-438a-5315-9d51-3b1eeee7d99b'}, {'abstract': 'Yahoo’s move aims to make up for years of missing out on the growth of social networks and mobile devices.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/20/technology/yahoo-to-buy-tumblr-for-1-1-billion.html', 'snippet': 'Yahoo’s move aims to make up for years of missing out on the growth of social networks and mobile devices.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The board of Yahoo, the faded Web pioneer, agreed on Sunday to buy the popular blogging service Tumblr for about $1.1 billion in cash, the companies announced Monday, a signal of how the company plans to reposition itself as the technology industry makes a headlong rush into social media.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Yahoo to Buy Tumblr for $1.1 Billion', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Seeking Flair, Yahoo Agrees To Buy Tumblr', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Yahoo! Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Tumblr', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de la Merced, Michael J', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Networking (Internet)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mayer, Marissa', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-19T18:20:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced, Nick Bilton and Nicole Perlroth', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bilton', 'qualifier': No