nt': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/06921784-e8e1-578d-9421-fe15ccdbf7d9'}, {'abstract': 'A workshop focused on the art of the suicide note and epitaph is part of a monthlong series of performances, installations and lectures called the School of Death.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/19/a-class-focused-on-goodbyes/', 'snippet': 'A workshop focused on the art of the suicide note and epitaph is part of a monthlong series of performances, installations and lectures called the School of Death.', 'lead_paragraph': '“The suicide note — and I’m being deadly earnest — is moving, strange, harrowing and peculiar literature,” said Simon Critchley, an author and philosophy professor at the New School. “People’s interest in them is almost pornographic.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/20/nyregion/20cityroom-alt/20cityroom-alt-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/20/nyregion/20cityroom-alt/20cityroom-alt-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/20/nyregion/20cityroom-alt/20cityroom-alt-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/20/nyregion/20cityroom-alt/20cityroom-alt-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/20/nyregion/20cityroom-alt/20cityroom-alt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name':