-585a-9db7-99dfef2253aa'}, {'abstract': 'After a television viewer alerted Masters officials to an illegal drop by Tiger Woods, the PGA Tour may have to cope with an influx of amateur rules experts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/20/sports/golf/a-power-shift-in-golf-calling-the-shots-from-the-couch.html', 'snippet': 'After a television viewer alerted Masters officials to an illegal drop by Tiger Woods, the PGA Tour may have to cope with an influx of amateur rules experts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jamie Epstein, a New Jersey lawyer, was watching the final round of the Players Championship on his laptop when the leader, Tiger Woods, drove the ball into the water on the 14th hole. Epstein was incredulous when Woods made his subsequent drop roughly 250 yards from the pin. From where Epstein sat, at a Whole Foods cafeteria, it appeared that Woods’s ball had crossed the hazard at the front of the lake, a couple of hundred yards closer to the tee.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/20/sports/golf/20par-pic/20par-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 387, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/20/sports/golf/20par-pic/20par-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 387}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/20/sports/golf/20par-pic/20par-pic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 660, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/20/sports/golf/20par-pic/20par-pic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1321, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'ty