but it hasn’t affected the Idea of Bachchan, the author argues.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In “Murabba,” the director Anurag Kashyap’s contribution to the new movie “Bombay Talkies,” our hero, one Vijay from Allahabad, who has been waiting for days outside the tall gates of Amitabh Bachchan’s mythologized house in Mumbai, finally hears his name being called by the guards. Standing in a small crowd of men waiting for a glimpse of the star, Vijay raises his hand to distinguish himself, only to realize that so does everyone around him, for each of them is also Vijay from Allahabad.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/17/world/asia/17-Amitabh-KBC-IndiaInk/17-Amitabh-KBC-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 407, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/17/world/asia/17-Amitabh-KBC-IndiaInk/17-Amitabh-KBC-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 407}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/17/world/asia/17-Amitabh-KBC-IndiaInk/17-Amitabh-KBC-IndiaInk-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 695, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/17/world/asia/17-Amitabh-KBC-IndiaInk/17-Amitabh-KBC-IndiaInk-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1390, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/17/world/asia/17-Amitabh-KBC-IndiaInk/17-Amitabh-KBC-IndiaInk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/17/world/asia/17-Amitabh-KBC-IndiaInk/17-Amitabh-KBC-IndiaInk-thumbStandard.jpg