 (Bertie Carvel as Miss Trunchbull), lyrics, book, and set design.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/20/matilda-wins-big-at-drama-desk-awards/', 'snippet': '‘Matilda’ won awards for outstanding musical, featured actor (Bertie Carvel as Miss Trunchbull), lyrics, book, and set design.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Broadway musical “Matilda” received five Drama Desk Awards on Sunday night, the most of any nominated show, winning for outstanding musical, featured actor (Bertie Carvel as Miss Trunchbull), lyrics, book and set design. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/20/arts/20artsbeat-matilda/20artsbeat-matilda-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 774, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/20/arts/20artsbeat-matilda/20artsbeat-matilda-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 774}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/20/arts/20artsbeat-matilda/20artsbeat-matilda-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 795, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/20/arts/20artsbeat-matilda/20artsbeat-matilda-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1589, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/20/arts/20artsbeat-matilda/20artsbeat-matilda-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/20/arts/20artsbeat-matilda/20artsbeat-matilda-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 't