although he was peppered with questions about his last start in which he failed to get out of the first.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BALTIMORE — In the immediate aftermath of his most recent outing for the Yankees, Phil Hughes anticipated that he would have a tough time sleeping for a couple of nights. Sure enough, after he gave up seven runs in two-thirds of an inning against the Seattle Mariners last Wednesday, Hughes tossed and turned.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hughes Does Best to Look Ahead After Disastrous Start', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Yankees’ Hughes Does His Best to Look Ahead After a Disastrous Start ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Betances, Dellin', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hughes, Phil', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Teixeira, Mark', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Youkilis, Kevin', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Baltimore Orioles', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-20T23:40:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Scott Cacciola', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Scott', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cacciola', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ef352d27-be22-508c-8810-987d4e9d47c6', 'word_count': 725, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ef352d27-be22-508c-8810-987d4e9d47c6'}, {'abstract': 'Hamzi Ahmad Barakat, a Lebanese citizen, was accused in a plot to defraud Lebanese immigrants in Brazil, though American officials have suspected him of trafficking in arms, drugs and counterfeit bills.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/21/world/americas/man-linked-by-us-to-hezbollah-is-arrested-in-brazil.html', 'snippet': 'Hamzi Ahmad Barakat, a Lebanese citizen, was accused in a plot to defraud Lebanese immigrants in Brazil, though American officials have suspected him of trafficking in arms, drugs and counterfeit bills.', 'lead_paragraph': 'RIO DE JANEIRO — The Brazilian police have arrested a businessman listed by the United States as a member of Hezbollah, the powerful Lebanese militant group, under suspicion of operating a fraudulent scheme in the clothing industry — a far cry from the arms, drugs, explosives and counterfeit bills that American officials have suspected him of trafficking in during the past.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Businessman Linked by U.S. to Hezbollah Is Arrested in Brazil in a Fraud Scheme', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Businessman Linked by U.S. to Hezbollah Is Arrested in Brazil in a Fraud Scheme', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brazil', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Frauds and Swindling', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hezbollah', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Lebanon', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Embezzlement', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Arms Trade', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drug Abuse and Traffic', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Counterfeit Money and Financial Instruments', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-20T23:42:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sim