-about-robbery-plan.html', 'snippet': 'In the trial of two men charged with the murder of Officer Peter J. Figoski, an accomplice testified about how the group decided to rob a drug dealer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ariel Tejada, an occasional stickup man, described a night that began like many others had for him: He and a few friends were sitting in an apartment smoking marijuana when someone casually suggested that they rob a Brooklyn drug dealer. Hours later, everything had gone wrong, and a police officer, Peter J. Figoski, was shot dead. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/21/nyregion/SANTOS/SANTOS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 375, 'width': 270, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/21/nyregion/SANTOS/SANTOS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 375, 'width': 270, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/21/nyregion/SANTOS/SANTOS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/21/nyregion/SANTOS/SANTOS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/21/nyregion/SANTOS/SANTOS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Hearing of Robbery Plan That Led to Killing', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Hearing of Robbery Plan That Led to Killing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders an