.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/21/in-store-orlebar-brown-adds-swimwear-for-women/', 'snippet': 'The beloved British brand introduces a new 16-piece collection in time for summer that draws inspiration from its popular men’s suits.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With the official start of summer just a month away, the daunting task of finding swimwear basics looms. Later this month, the British brand Orlebar Brown, best known for its tailored men’s trunks in preppy colors and funky photographic prints that look as good on land as at sea, introduces its debut collection for women. The founder, Adam Brown, created a 16-piece capsule collection of simple bikinis, one-pieces, sporty rash guards and shorts modeled after the signature men’s trunks.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Store | Orlebar Brown Adds Swimwear for Women', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bathing Suits', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Adam', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Net-A-Porter', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-21T13:00:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Malina Joseph Gilchrist', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Malina', 'middlename': 'Joseph', 'lastname': 'Gilchrist', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/abd7b356-ef18-52c3-967c-0109d7453a3d', 'word_count': 89, 'uri': 'nyt://article/abd7b356-ef18-52c3-967c-0109d7453a3d'}, {'abstract': 'The change, which came after months of spirited debate, will prohibit golfers from anchoring the club against the body while making a stroke.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/22/sports/golf/anchored-putting-strokes-to-be-banned-in-2016.html', 'snippet': 'The change, which came after months of spirited debate, will prohibit golfers from anchoring the club against the body while making a stroke.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FAR HILLS, N.J. — Golf’s rules-making bodies, the United States Golf Association and the Royal & Ancient, on Tuesday prohibited golfers from anchoring a putter against their bodies while making a stroke, a rule change the organizations first proposed in November. The worldwide ban against anchored putting strokes, applicable to professionals and amateurs alike, will not go into effect until Jan. 1, 2016.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/22/sports/y-jpGOLF-2/y-jpGOLF-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 898, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/22/sports/y-jpGOLF-2/y-jpGOLF-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 898}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/22/sports/y-jpGOLF-2/y-jpGOLF-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 685, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/22/sports/y-jpGOLF-2/y-jpGOLF-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1369, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/22/sports/y-jpGOLF-2/y-jpGOLF-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/22/sports/y-jpGOLF-2/y-jpGOLF-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'