50-ed1710cd721a'}, {'abstract': 'The devastation in Oklahoma again thrust the president into the role of national comforter, while on Capitol Hill calls for compassion and for spending discipline were heard.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/22/us/politics/obama-sends-fema-chief-to-oklahoma.html', 'snippet': 'The devastation in Oklahoma again thrust the president into the role of national comforter, while on Capitol Hill calls for compassion and for spending discipline were heard.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Obama vowed Tuesday to marshal the resources of the federal government to help the victims of Oklahoma’s killer tornado as lawmakers on Capitol Hill began debating the fiscal consequences of the storm in an era of austerity.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama Pledges Storm Aid; Some in Congress Talk of Finding Cuts to Offset It', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Obama Pledges Storm Aid; Some in Congress Talk of Finding Cuts to Offset It', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Disasters and Emergencies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Baker, Peter', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Emergency Management Agency', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Peters, Jeremy W', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Oklahoma', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tornadoes', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Aid (US)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-21T14:50:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Baker and Jeremy W. Peters', 'person': [{'firstname