eed, no longer a victim.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/21/booming/for-an-auschwitz-survivor-his-sons-graduation-spelled-freedom.html', 'snippet': 'A concentration camp survivor revels in his new country and  of being able to educate his sons: at their graduations, he is freed, no longer a victim.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Tuesday, when our daughter-in-law gets her degree from New York University, the ceremony will be held at Avery Fisher Hall in Lincoln Center, a place that holds some very powerful memories for me.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/21/booming/21mystory-booming-graduation/21mystory-booming-graduation-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 523, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/21/booming/21mystory-booming-graduation/21mystory-booming-graduation-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 523}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/21/booming/21mystory-booming-graduation/21mystory-booming-graduation-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 590, 'width': 677, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/21/booming/21mystory-booming-graduation/21mystory-booming-graduation-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 590, 'width': 677, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/21/booming/21mystory-booming-graduation/21mystory-booming-graduation-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/21/booming/21mystory-booming-graduation/21mystory-booming-graduation-thumbStandard.jpg', 'th