new Flickr still feels like it’s missing something.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/21/the-new-flickr-is-pretty-but-is-it-social/', 'snippet': 'Flickr unveiled its new Web site design, showing off high-resolution rectangular photos and a free terabyte of space for users. But the new Flickr still feels like it’s missing something.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Monday, just a few hours after Yahoo officially announced it had\xa0purchased\xa0Tumblr for $1.1 billion, the company\xa0unveiled a new\xa0version of Flickr, a photo-sharing Web site.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/21/technology/bits-Flickr/bits-Flickr-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 284, 'width': 592, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/21/technology/bits-Flickr/bits-Flickr-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 284, 'width': 592, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/21/technology/bits-Flickr/bits-Flickr-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/21/technology/bits-Flickr/bits-Flickr-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/21/technology/bits-Flickr/bits-Flickr-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The New Flickr Is Pretty, but Is It Social?', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'ra