ct': 'Steve Wilhite, who invented the enduring GIF file format in 1987, will receive a lifetime achievement Webby Award.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/21/an-honor-for-the-creator-of-the-gif/', 'snippet': 'Steve Wilhite, who invented the enduring GIF file format in 1987, will receive a lifetime achievement Webby Award.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Among the thousands of file formats that exist in modern computing, the GIF, or Graphics Interchange Format, has attained celebrity status in a sea of lesser-known BMPs, RIPs, FIGs and MIFFs. It was honored as a “word of the year” in 2012, and Tuesday night, its inventor, Steve Wilhite, will be accepting a lifetime achievement award at The Webby Awards.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/21/technology/21wilhite/21wilhite-jumbo.gif', 'height': 239, 'width': 249, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/21/technology/21wilhite/21wilhite-superJumbo.gif', 'height': 239, 'width': 249, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/21/technology/21wilhite/21wilhite-thumbStandard.gif', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/21/technology/21wilhite/21wilhite-thumbStandard.gif', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/21/technology/21wilhite/21wilhite-thumbLarge.gif', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'An Honor for the Creator of the GIF', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker'