rrings, violet taffeta flowers and tulip-embroidered lace. A standout in the bouquet of skirts, dresses and gowns on view in the designer’s showroom this afternoon was the indigo floral bubble peplum cocktail dress. The look was topped off with classic sapphire crystal drop earrings, matte red lips and a low ponytail tied with a black-netted bow. The secret to this modern garden look is the butterfly brooch nestled on the lower back of the dress.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Just One Look | Resort Gets the Floral Treatment at Oscar de la Renta', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-21T22:48:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Malina Joseph Gilchrist', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Malina', 'middlename': 'Joseph', 'lastname': 'Gilchrist', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4bed1dd9-ce65-5c83-a9c2-530ae3212b4b', 'word_count': 91, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4bed1dd9-ce65-5c83-a9c2-530ae3212b4b'}, {'abstract': 'Warren E. Buffett is a skilled deal maker, but who will negotiate such favorable deals for Berkshire Hathaway after he is gone?', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/05/21/buffett-with-his-magic-touch-may-be-irreplaceable/', 'snippet': 'Warren E. Buffett is a skilled deal maker, but who will negotiate such favorable deals for Berkshire Hathaway after he is gone?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Acquisitions usually come with a nice premium for the seller. But when Warren E. Buffett is the buyer, there is typically something of a discount.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main'