submissions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/22/sunday-review/forgotten-heroes.html', 'snippet': 'In response to an essay by Margalit Fox, we asked readers to submit stories of people who had an impact on society but had been lost to history. Here is a selection of the submissions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On May 12, Margalit Fox, an obituary writer for The New York Times, wrote that “the stories obit writers love best are those of history’s backstage players, the unsung men and women who, though no one knows their names, have managed to put a wrinkle in the social fabric.” She wrote about Alice E. Kober, a woman who deciphered an ancient script but never received wide recognition. We asked readers to submit stories of people who had an impact on society but had been lost to history. Here is a selection of the submissions. These entries are the recollections of the readers, and, in some instances, highlight a side of the person that isn’t well known. They have been edited for clarity and length.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/21/opinion/sr-obits-louise-fraser/sr-obits-louise-fraser-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 417, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/21/opinion/sr-obits-louise-fraser/sr-obits-louise-fraser-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 417}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/21/opinion/sr-obits-louise-fraser/sr-obits-louise-fraser-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 711, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/21/opinion/sr-obits-louise-fraser/sr-obits-louise-fraser-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 809, 'width': 1165, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 