and labor ministers signed agreements with their counterparts in Portugal and Spain this week, hoping to get young people into jobs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/23/business/global/germany-works-to-curb-eu-youth-unemployment.html', 'snippet': 'The German finance and labor ministers signed agreements with their counterparts in Portugal and Spain this week, hoping to get young people into jobs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BERLIN — German leaders, heeding economists’ warnings that the younger generation may become disillusioned with the European project, are counting on a series of bilateral agreements to help curb stubbornly high youth unemployment in the European Union.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/23/business/EUJobs/EUJobs-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 544, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/23/business/EUJobs/EUJobs-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 544}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/23/business/EUJobs/EUJobs-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 929, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/23/business/EUJobs/EUJobs-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1857, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Germany Works to Ease High Youth Unemployment', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Germany Works to Ease High Youth Unemployment', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Eddy, Melissa', 'rank': 2,