od Memorial at Aqueduct in early April. They may be forgiven a somewhat provincial affection for a horse named for the bridge over the narrows linking Staten Island and Brooklyn, but the main span of that landmark structure across the gateway to the Hudson River and New York’s harbor hadn’t been completed in 1963 when another horse — one named for a small upstate New York town — led the field under the wire in the 89th Kentucky Derby.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1963 Kentucky Derby: Chateaugay’s Big Day', 'kicker': 'The Rail', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Horse Racing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Kentucky Derby', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Triple Crown (Horse Racing)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Baeza, Braulio', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Conway, James P', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-22T19:09:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Leslie Knauf', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Leslie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Knauf', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/83579dbe-fbef-53e8-a208-22af47557914', 'word_count': 1710, 'uri': 'nyt://article/83579dbe-fbef-53e8-a208-22af47557914'}, {'abstract': 'Mourners gathered at a church in Sleepy Hollow, N.Y., for the funeral of Andrea Rebello, who was accidentally shot by a police officer who also killed the man holding a gun to her head.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/22/funeral-for-hofstra-student-held-hostage/', 'snippet': 'Mourners gathered at a church in Sleepy Hollow, N.Y., for the funeral of Andrea Rebello, who was accidentally shot by a police officer who also killed the man holding a gun to her head.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mourners gathered at St. Teresa of Avila church in Sleepy Hollow, N.Y., on Wednesday for the funeral of Andrea Rebello, the 21-year-old Hofstra University student who was accidentally killed by a police officer last Friday during a confrontation with a burglar who was holding a gun to her head.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/23/nyregion/22CITYROOM-floaterHofstra/22CITYROOM-floaterHofstra-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 405, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/23/nyregion/22CITYROOM-floaterHofstra/22CITYROOM-floaterHofstra-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 405}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/23/nyregion/22CITYROOM-floaterHofstra/22CITYROOM-floaterHofstra-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 692, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/23/nyregion/22CITYROOM-floaterHofstra/22CITYROOM-floaterHofstra-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1383, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/23/nyregion/22CITYROOM-floaterHofstra/22CITYROOM-floaterHofstra-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/23/nyregion/22CITYROOM-floaterHofstra/22CITYROOM-floaterHofstra-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/23/nyregion/22CITYROOM