The Chamber Music Society of Lincoln Center concluded its season Tuesday night at Alice Tully Hall with a convivial Mozart program.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/23/arts/music/chamber-music-society-of-lincoln-center-plays-mozart-at-alice-tully.html', 'snippet': 'The Chamber Music Society of Lincoln Center concluded its season Tuesday night at Alice Tully Hall with a convivial Mozart program.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Despite what prime-time television has conditioned us to expect, not every season-ending program has to conclude with oversize special effects and unanticipated twists. When the Chamber Music Society of Lincoln Center completed its season on Tuesday evening at Alice Tully Hall, it did so with what amounted to a warm collective hug, in the form of Mozart’s reassuring constancy.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/23/arts/mozart/mozart-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/23/arts/mozart/mozart-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/23/arts/mozart/mozart-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/23/arts/mozart/mozart-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/23/arts/mozart/mozart-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/23/arts/mozart/mozart-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/23/arts/mozart/mozart-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mozart as a Burnished Bookend, Heartening to Young and Old', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mozart as a Burnished Bookend, Heartening to Young and Old', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chamber Music Society of Lincoln Center', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-22T20:36:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steve Smith', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steve', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Smith', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/cb826267-0786-5eee-92ae-c59616a0b42d', 'word_count': 367, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cb826267-0786-5eee-92ae-c59616a0b42d'}, {'abstract': 'The three-time Indy winners stopped in the city to talk about Sunday’s race.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/22/franchitti-and-castroneves-pause-in-new-york-before-indianapolis-500/', 'snippet': 'The three-time Indy winners stopped in the city to talk about Sunday’s race.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Monday, IndyCar sent the drivers for this Sunday’s Indianapolis 500 on a press tour to cities around North America. New York can rest easy in its title as the media capital of the world: it got the only pair of three-time Indy winners in the lineup, Dario Franchitti of Scotland and He