et in the Deep South.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/23/books/mary-ward-brown-95-award-winning-short-story-writer-dies.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Brown resumed a literary career 25 years after putting it aside to run the family farm, producing award-winning short stories set in the Deep South.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mary Ward Brown, a small-town farmer’s daughter who resumed a literary career 25 years after putting it aside to run the family farm and raise a son — producing award-winning short stories set in the Deep South and a poignant memoir of life in rural Alabama — died on May 14 in Marion, Ala., a few miles from the farmhouse in which she grew up. She was 95. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/23/arts/BROWN-obit/BROWN-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 833, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/23/arts/BROWN-obit/BROWN-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 833}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/23/arts/BROWN-obit/BROWN-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 738, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/23/arts/BROWN-obit/BROWN-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1475, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/23/arts/BROWN-obit/BROWN-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/23/arts/BROWN-obit/BROWN-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 7