d': 'nyt://article/ef7cc03b-aa3f-5dbc-ad20-f82770a51b9a', 'word_count': 830, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ef7cc03b-aa3f-5dbc-ad20-f82770a51b9a'}, {'abstract': 'Since becoming secretary of state, John Kerry has worked to jump-start the stalled peace process, embracing a seemingly intractable issue.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/23/world/middleeast/kerry-may-make-bid-to-restart-mideast-peace-talks.html', 'snippet': 'Since becoming secretary of state, John Kerry has worked to jump-start the stalled peace process, embracing a seemingly intractable issue.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JERUSALEM — While Palestinian officials say they expect Secretary of State John Kerry to present a proposal for restarting Israeli-Palestinian peace talks by early June, they add that there appear to be few tangible signs of progress.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Support for Kerry’s Mideast Peace Efforts on Eve of Visit', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Support for Kerry’s Mideast Peace Efforts on Eve of Visit', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kerry, John', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'West Bank', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Netanyahu, Benjamin', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Erekat, Saeb', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ABBAS, MAHMOUD', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Israeli Settlements', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-23T02:38:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', '