7, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a466a4a1-bb01-5510-98c7-f8511b9f4c55'}, {'abstract': 'Hiroki Kuroda, who has been a stalwart presence this season, gave up five runs and eight hits in two-plus innings, his earned-run average increasing to 2.67 from 1.99.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/23/sports/baseball/yankees-kuroda-is-hit-hard-early-in-defeat.html', 'snippet': 'Hiroki Kuroda, who has been a stalwart presence this season, gave up five runs and eight hits in two-plus innings, his earned-run average increasing to 2.67 from 1.99.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BALTIMORE — Hiroki Kuroda had already given up two home runs when he proved incapable of avoiding a heat-seeking line drive off the bat of Manny Machado in the second inning Wednesday. The ball ricocheted off Kuroda’s right leg and bounced toward third base for a single. Joe Girardi, the Yankees’ manager, made a beeline to the pitcher’s mound from the dugout, a team trainer in tow.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/23/sports/baseball/23yankees-2/23yankees-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 778, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/23/sports/baseball/23yankees-2/23yankees-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 778}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/23/sports/baseball/23yankees-2/23yankees-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 790, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/23/sports/baseball/23yankees-2/23yankees-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1580, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'cre