Project, which collects and preserves the personal stories of American war veterans, may also be of particular interest.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tip of the Week: Touring the Library of Congress Digital Collections', 'kicker': 'Gadgetwise', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Libraries and Librarians', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Veterans', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Library of Congress', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Works Progress Administration', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-23T09:24:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By J.d. Biersdorfer', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bea192a2-4637-5434-b6eb-6b1bab0094b3', 'word_count': 111, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bea192a2-4637-5434-b6eb-6b1bab0094b3'}, {'abstract': 'Serena Williams was so dispirited by her loss to a wild card in the first round of the French Open last year that she ripped up her career-long playbook and joined forces with a coach outside her family.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/24/sports/tennis/24iht-srfrtennis24.html', 'snippet': 'Serena Williams was so dispirited by her loss to a wild card in the first round of the French Open last year that she ripped up her career-long playbook and joined forces with a coach outside her family.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — Close to a year later, it remains a challenge to look at Court Philippe Chatrier quite the same way.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedi