deRegt would be succeeded by Michael Heaney and Robert Rooney, two executives who have worked closely with Mr. Kelleher. Morgan Stanley said Mr. deRegt was leaving to become a partner at a new company, the Canarsie Capital Group.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Spotlight on Fixed Income at Morgan Stanley', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-05-23T11:55:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Alden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6468a825-9bb2-5a6c-ad15-b9770929a3ba', 'word_count': 1763, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6468a825-9bb2-5a6c-ad15-b9770929a3ba'}, {'abstract': 'Massimiliano Gioni’s ambitious Venice Biennale art extravaganza opens this week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/26/arts/design/massimiliano-gioni-of-venice-biennale.html', 'snippet': 'Massimiliano Gioni’s ambitious Venice Biennale art extravaganza opens this week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Massimiliano Gioni, the artistic director of this year’s Venice Biennale, was marveling at the rich history of this 118-year-old international contemporary art exhibition.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/arts/26gioni-web/26gioni-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/24/arts/26gioni-web/26gioni-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': Non