s, birthing a project called Love Front Porch. While she admits her beloved town is rife with gun violence, she writes on her Web site, “I’ve seen acts of love and bravery here that would leave you slack-jawed and damp-eyed with awe.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Gun Report: May 23, 2013', 'kicker': 'Joe Nocera', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Birmingham (Ala)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Dallas (Tex)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Jacksonville (Fla)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Lexington (Ky)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Los Angeles (Calif)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Naples (Fla)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Orange County (Calif)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Philadelphia (Pa)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pittsburgh (Pa)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'San Francisco (Calif)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Springfield (Mass)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Wilmington (Del)', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-23T13:53:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Mascia', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mascia', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fa08483e-65e2-581e-a49e-89b63d976926', 'word_count': 1224, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fa08483e-65e2-581e-a49e-89b63d976926'}, {'abstract': 'Frequent heartburn increases the risk for throat cancer, a