t': 279, 'uri': 'nyt://article/66dee8e1-2ac3-5533-bf97-cf56fedbf3b2'}, {'abstract': 'In a Senate subcommittee hearing on Apple’s avoidance of paying taxes, John McCain and others tried to point out how unfair the current system was to domestic corporations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/24/business/making-companies-pay-taxes-the-mccain-way.html', 'snippet': 'In a Senate subcommittee hearing on Apple’s avoidance of paying taxes, John McCain and others tried to point out how unfair the current system was to domestic corporations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The shameful thing about Apple Inc.’s ability to structure its business to avoid United States taxes was not that it did it. In fact, as Apple executives tried to point out at the Senate hearing at which their tax strategies were detailed, they could have chosen to pay much less in American taxes than they did.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Corrosive Effect of Apple’s Tax Avoidance', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Corrosive Effect Of Apple’s Tax Avoidance', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Apple Inc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corporate Taxes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tax Shelters', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cook, Timothy D', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCain, John', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Levin, Carl M', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tax Evasion', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tax Credits, Deductions and Exemptions', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-23T19:23:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Busine