'uri': 'nyt://article/9892f183-64d7-53f7-9f57-f384a4c23235'}, {'abstract': 'A group of drama students is organizing a Google Free Day on Friday, highlighting what they say is the minimal share of its revenue that the search giant pays in taxes, as well as the increasing dependence on its service.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/23/tax-protest-in-britain-focuses-on-google/', 'snippet': 'A group of drama students is organizing a Google Free Day on Friday, highlighting what they say is the minimal share of its revenue that the search giant pays in taxes, as well as the increasing dependence on its service.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In Britain, the debate over tax-reduction strategies employed by American technology giants is taking a populist turn.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/23/technology/23bits-google-free-day/23bits-google-free-day-jumbo.png', 'height': 460, 'width': 348, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/23/technology/23bits-google-free-day/23bits-google-free-day-superJumbo.png', 'height': 460, 'width': 348, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/23/technology/23bits-google-free-day/23bits-google-free-day-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/23/technology/23bits-google-free-day/23bits-google-free-day-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/23/technology/23bits-google-free-day/23bits-google-free-day-thumbLarge.png', 'height':