'}, {'abstract': 'The American soccer star Megan Rapinoe watched from the bench as Wolfsburg beat Lyon in the Champions League women’s final.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/24/sports/soccer/rapinoes-lyon-club-upset-in-womens-final.html', 'snippet': 'The American soccer star Megan Rapinoe watched from the bench as Wolfsburg beat Lyon in the Champions League women’s final.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — One of the main attractions that drew Megan Rapinoe to Lyon earlier this year was the club’s complete and utter dominance. Lyon had won two straight European championships, shredded all comers in the French league by N.F.L.-like scores and was often referred to as the female game’s equivalent to Barcelona. In many ways, that comparison was an understatement.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/sports/soccer/24rapinoe1-img/24rapinoe1-img-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 304, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/24/sports/soccer/24rapinoe1-img/24rapinoe1-img-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 304}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/sports/soccer/24rapinoe1-img/24rapinoe1-img-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 518, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/sports/soccer/24rapinoe1-img/24rapinoe1-img-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1036, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/sports/soccer/24rapinoe1-img/24rapinoe1-img-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStand