/2013/05/24/us/politics/irs-official-who-refused-to-testify-is-put-on-leave.html', 'snippet': 'Lois Lerner, the head of the tax division on exempt organizations, was put on administrative leave a day after she invoked the Fifth Amendment before a House committee.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Lois Lerner, the head of the Internal Revenue Service’s division on tax-exempt organizations, was put on administrative leave Thursday, a day after she invoked the Fifth Amendment and declined to testify before a House committee investigating her division’s targeting of conservative groups.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/23/us/23irs1/23irs1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 637, 'width': 480, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/23/us/23irs1/23irs1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 637, 'width': 480, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/23/us/23irs1/23irs1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/23/us/23irs1/23irs1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/23/us/23irs1/23irs1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'I.R.S. Suspends Official at Center of Storm', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'I.R.S. Suspends Official at Center of Storm', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Internal Revenue Service Political Profiling', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Internal Revenue Service', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lerner, Lois', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-23T21:52:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jonathan Weisman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonathan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weisman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fc26112f-6522-596d-9c03-800f18d16ee2', 'word_count': 475, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fc26112f-6522-596d-9c03-800f18d16ee2'}, {'abstract': 'Emel Mathlouthi made her New York debut at the French Institute Alliance Française’s World Nomads Tunisia festival, enthralling even with only half of her band.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/24/arts/music/emel-mathlouthi-at-the-french-institutes-tunisia-festival.html', 'snippet': 'Emel Mathlouthi made her New York debut at the French Institute Alliance Française’s World Nomads Tunisia festival, enthralling even with only half of her band.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Tunisian singer Emel Mathlouthi, a gentle firebrand whose song “Kelmti Horra” (“My Word Is Free”) became an anthem of the Arab Spring, made an enthralling New York debut at the French Institute Alliance Française on Wednesday night. In Arabic she sang, “We are free men who are not afraid/We are the secrets that never die/And we are the voice of those who resist.” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/arts/24EMEL_SPAN/EMEL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'i