'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/26/nyregion/at-connollys-in-the-theater-district-les-bon-temps-rouler.html', 'snippet': 'Connolly’s, an Irish pub, is the city’s only major event space presenting Cajun and Zydeco acts on a regular basis.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s Saturday night in Times Square, and on the top floor of a sprawling Irish pub called Connolly’s, a driving Zydeco band is in full cry: accordion, fiddle, bass, washboard, drums and a saxophone. Several dozen couples try to master a peculiar dance step rarely seen outside of southwest Louisiana. A handful of regulars has it down; it’s a sort of buoyant three-step shuffle. Others are catching on quickly, while a rhythmically challenged few totter around, content to avoid pileups.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/nyregion/26JOINT1_SPAN/26JOINT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/26/nyregion/26JOINT1_SPAN/26JOINT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/nyregion/26JOINT1_SPAN/26JOINT1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/nyregion/26JOINT1_SPAN/26JOINT1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/nyregion/26JOINT1_SPAN/26JOINT1_SPAN-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013