and crippling fears.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Anyone who has ever confronted a dissertation deadline with blank pages and a paralyzed mind will identify with “Nancy, Please,” a darkly comic psychodrama about academic pressure and irrational paranoia.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/arts/24RDP_NANCY_SPAN/24RDP_NANCY_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 252, 'width': 448, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/arts/24RDP_NANCY_SPAN/24RDP_NANCY_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 252, 'width': 448, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/arts/24RDP_NANCY_SPAN/24RDP_NANCY_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/24/arts/24RDP_NANCY_SPAN/24RDP_NANCY_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/arts/24RDP_NANCY_SPAN/24RDP_NANCY_SPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Dissertation Tests a Grad Student’s Sanity', 'kicker': 'Movie Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Nancy, Please', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Semans, Andrew', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-23T23:39:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original':