ial Democratic Party of Germany has a storied past, but a cloudy future, with polls showing it trailing behind the center-right Christian Democratic Union.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LEIPZIG, Germany — It is a sign of the challenges facing the Social Democratic Party in Germany that when it celebrated its 150th anniversary on Thursday, the two guests of honor were a struggling foreign socialist leader, President François Hollande of France, and the socialists’ main domestic opponent, Chancellor Angela Merkel.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Accolades for German Party on Anniversary, but Votes? Perhaps Not', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Accolades for German Party on Anniversary, but Votes? Perhaps Not', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Social Democratic Party (Germany)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Eddy, Melissa', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Polls and Public Opinion', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Merkel, Angela', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hollande, Francois', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-24T00:32:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melissa Eddy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melissa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Eddy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f0723948-bfae-5d2d-9f6d-7fd3e91cf51b', 'word_count': 761, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f0723948-bfae-5d2d-9f6d-7fd3e91cf51b'}, {'abstract': 'Content marketing is expected to be a big growth area for the ad industry and Robert J. Murray, global president of iProspect, a leading digital agency, is signing up.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/24/business/media/robert-murray-of-iprospect-joins-skyword-as-president.html', 'snippet': 'Content marketing is expected to be a big growth area for the ad industry and Robert J. Murray, global president of iProspect, a leading digital agency, is signing up.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE expression “People vote with their feet” was not coined on, or about, Madison Avenue. Still, in the advertising business, the jobs that top executives change agencies to take can signal potential areas of growth for the industry — or, at least, areas they believe will provide them, and clients, lucrative opportunities.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/business/Adco1/Adco1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 627, 'width': 452, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/business/Adco1/Adco1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 627, 'width': 452, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/business/Adco1/Adco1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/24/business/Adco1/Adco1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/business/Adco1/Adco1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, '