1-596e-bd39-d3edf35a9c51'}, {'abstract': 'Oceanic and atmospheric conditions are expected to create stronger and more hurricanes in 2013, setting the stage for an “above normal and extremely active” season, the National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration said.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/23/noaa-predicts-extremely-active-hurricane-season-2/', 'snippet': 'Oceanic and atmospheric conditions are expected to create stronger and more hurricanes in 2013, setting the stage for an “above normal and extremely active” season, the National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration issued its 2013 Atlantic hurricane outlook on Thursday, with a warning that the United States could be hit by up to six major hurricanes this year. The seasonal average is three.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'NOAA Predicts Extremely Active Hurricane Season', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricanes and Tropical Storms', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-24T01:27:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Preston', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Preston', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9bbc8723-a25d-5fde-ad76-26a5787d5601', 'word_count': 551, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9bbc8723-a25d-5fde-ad76-26a5787d5601'}, {'abstract': 'The hedge fund manager William Ackman had criticized Robert A. McDonald, the chief, for the company’s poor stock performance.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/24/business/abruptly-pg-chief-ends-career-of-33-years.html', 'snippet': 'The hedge fund manager William Ackman had criticized Robert A. McDonald, the chief, for the company’s poor stock performance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a surprise move, Procter & Gamble, the world’s biggest consumer products company, said on Thursday that its chief executive had resigned and was being replaced by his predecessor, Alan G. Lafley.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/business/subProcter/subProcter-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 453, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/24/business/subProcter/subProcter-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 453}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/business/subProcter/subProcter-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 773, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/business/subProcter/subProcter-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1545, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Abruptly, P.&G. Chief Ends Career of 33 Years', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Abruptly, P.&G. Chief Ends Career Of 33 Years', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de la Merced, Michael J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Procter & Gamble Company', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McDonald, Robert A', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lafley