 '2013-05-24T01:41:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jane Perlez', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jane', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Perlez', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2a3765f4-ea22-547f-b832-3642247c4a87', 'word_count': 1090, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2a3765f4-ea22-547f-b832-3642247c4a87'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the day for Friday, May 24, 2013.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/24/pageoneplus/quotation-of-the-day-for-friday-may-24-2013.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the day for Friday, May 24, 2013.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Our systematic effort to dismantle terrorist organizations must continue. But this war, like all wars, must end. That’s what history advises. It’s what our democracy demands.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day for Friday, May 24, 2013', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-05-24T01:42:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/f1fa46d0-100b-5bd6-9dd7-96c1a2dca68c', 'word_count': 28, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f1fa46d0-100b-5bd6-9dd7-96c1a2dca68c'}, {'abstract': 'Citigroup’s ideas were reflected in more than 70 lines of one 85-line bill.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/05/23/banks-lobbyists-help-in-drafting-financial-bills/', 'snippet': 'Citigroup’s ideas were reflected in more than 70 lines of one 85-line bill.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Bank lobbyists are not leaving it to lawmakers to draft