relson on the 1970s action series “S.W.A.T.,” died on Saturday in Thousand Oaks, Calif. He was 87. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/arts/FORREST-obit/FORREST-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 440, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/24/arts/FORREST-obit/FORREST-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 440}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/arts/FORREST-obit/FORREST-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 751, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/arts/FORREST-obit/FORREST-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1502, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/arts/FORREST-obit/FORREST-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/24/arts/FORREST-obit/FORREST-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/arts/FORREST-obit/FORREST-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Steve Forrest, Performer on Film and TV’s ‘S.W.A.T.,’ Dies at 87', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Steve Forrest, 87, Performer On Film and TV’s ‘S.W.A.T.’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Forrest, Steve (1925-2013)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fox, Margalit', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'S.W.A.T. (TV Program)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Andrews, Dana', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-24T03:10:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Margalit Fox', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Margalit', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fox', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/5bb14756-8d6c-59e2-b2c7-965131bba931', 'word_count': 444, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5bb14756-8d6c-59e2-b2c7-965131bba931'}, {'abstract': 'When the Mets and the Yankees meet for a four-game, home-and-home interleague series next week, each has a player that speaks to how the season has gone as a whole.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/24/sports/baseball/mets-jeremy-hefner-and-yankees-vernon-wells-are-symbols-of-their-teams-seasons.html', 'snippet': 'When the Mets and the Yankees meet for a four-game, home-and-home interleague series next week, each has a player that speaks to how the season has gone as a whole.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Although the Mets have won the World Series twice, a total that eight active teams cannot match, their fans have taken a battering over the years and are generally resigned to the notion that their team will usually not be any good and that the ball will rarely bounce the Mets’ way. This season, they may have a point. Memorial Day has yet to arrive and already the Mets sit 10 games out of first in the National League East, even though Matt Harvey has emerged as one of the best pitchers in baseball. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/sports/baseball/24score1-img/24score1-img-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/24/sports/baseball/24score1-img/24score1-img-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/sports/baseball/24score1-img/24score1-img-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/sports/baseball/24score1-img/24score1-img-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/sports/baseball/24score1-img/24score1-img-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/24/sports/baseball/24score1-img/24score1-img-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mets’ Hefner and Yankees’ Wells Are Symbols of Their Teams’ Seasons', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Symbols of Their Teams’ Seasons', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wells, Vernon', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hafner,