: 'Ms. Banerjee, who has been projected as the “symbol of honesty” in West Bengal, is fighting hard to restore voters’ confidence.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KOLKATA, West Bengal — All over West Bengal, signs bearing the face of Mamata Banerjee, the state’s chief minister, are accompanied by the phrase shotota-r pratik — “a symbol of honesty.” Her unkempt hair is tied up in a loose bun while she wears a simple white cotton sari and inexpensive rubber sandals, signaling that the Trinamool Congress Party leader is a champion of the common people.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/world/asia/24-Mamata-Banerjee-IndiaInk/24-Mamata-Banerjee-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 449, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/24/world/asia/24-Mamata-Banerjee-IndiaInk/24-Mamata-Banerjee-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 449}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/world/asia/24-Mamata-Banerjee-IndiaInk/24-Mamata-Banerjee-IndiaInk-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 766, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/world/asia/24-Mamata-Banerjee-IndiaInk/24-Mamata-Banerjee-IndiaInk-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1532, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/24/world/asia/24-Mamata-Banerjee-IndiaInk/24-Mamata-Banerjee-IndiaInk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/24/world/asia/24-Mamata-Banerjee-IndiaInk/24-Mamata-Banerjee-IndiaInk-thum