subpoenas to testify before a grand jury. | In a push to soften financial regulations, bank lobby...', 'lead_paragraph': 'P.&G. CHIEF IS OUT \xa0|\xa0 Procter & Gamble, a company that is one of the biggest holdings of the hedge fund manager William A. Ackman, said on Thursday that its chief executive, Robert A. McDonald, had resigned. Mr. McDonald is being succeeded by his predecessor, Alan G. Lafley, The New York Times’s Michael J. de la Merced reports.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'P.&G. Chief Is Out', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-05-24T11:18:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Alden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/676ad5f5-56c9-5490-a1df-f9b847a63ab2', 'word_count': 1609, 'uri': 'nyt://article/676ad5f5-56c9-5490-a1df-f9b847a63ab2'}, {'abstract': 'Here is what we’ll be offering over the next three weeks, including contest winners, Common Core posts, and our annual roundups of all the lesson plans and Student Opinion questions we’ve published this year', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/24/celebrating-memorial-day-and-looking-ahead/', 'snippet': 'Here is what we’ll be offering over the next three weeks, including contest winners, Common Core posts, and our annual roundups of all the lesson plans and Student Opinion questions we’ve published this year', 'lead_paragraph': 'In honor of Memorial Day, we’ll be off on Monday, May 27, and back with our regular daily content on May 28. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'i