s', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/arts/26NUTTALL1_SPAN/26NUTTALL1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/26/arts/26NUTTALL1_SPAN/26NUTTALL1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/arts/26NUTTALL1_SPAN/26NUTTALL1_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/arts/26NUTTALL1_SPAN/26NUTTALL1_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/arts/26NUTTALL1_SPAN/26NUTTALL1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/26/arts/26NUTTALL1_SPAN/26NUTTALL1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/arts/26NUTTALL1_SPAN/26NUTTALL1_SPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Jon Stewart of Chamber Music', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Jon Stewart of Chamber Music', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chamber Music Society of Lincoln Center', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wadsworth, Charles', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nuttall, Geoff', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-24T14:21:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Johanna Keller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Johanna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Keller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fe81884d-4b4d-5f83-a588-bbe0058c6e7b', 'word_count': 1505, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fe81884d-4b4d-5f83-a588-bbe0058c6e7b'}, {'abstract': 'The ballet dancer Ivan Vasiliev, who joined American Ballet Theater as a principal in September last year, has many opportunities opening up for him.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/26/arts/dance/ivan-vasiliev-on-roster-of-stars-at-american-ballet-theater.html', 'snippet': 'The ballet dancer Ivan Vasiliev, who joined American Ballet Theater as a principal in September last year, has many opportunities opening up for him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ivan Vasiliev stood at the back of a large rehearsal room at American Ballet Theater’s headquarters downtown on Broadway, restlessly waiting his turn as the choreographer Alexei Ratmansky worked with a group of dancers. He bounced on the balls of his feet, swung his arms back and forth and made a face at his girlfriend, the ballerina Natalia Osipova, who sat calmly on the floor to one side. Then, with little visible preparation, he suddenly spun into a pirouette, turning so many times that a group of corps de ballet members, sitting close by, laughed and whistled. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/arts/26VASILIEV_SPAN/