ly-rejuvenated.html', 'snippet': 'That the 2012-13 Knicks were a flawed team to begin with was an unpopular opinion, especially after a 14-4 start, but the truth won out.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You probably do not remember much about Dec. 6, at least when it comes to the Knicks. I do. That’s the day the Knicks thrashed the Miami Heat for the second time in the season, winning on the road after beating them in the season opener. The record of the first-place Knicks on Dec. 6 was 14-4. They had won at San Antonio, too.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/25/sports/25dribble1/25dribble1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 468, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/25/sports/25dribble1/25dribble1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 468}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/25/sports/25dribble1/25dribble1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 799, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/25/sports/25dribble1/25dribble1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1599, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/25/sports/25dribble1/25dribble1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/25/sports/25dribble1/25dribble1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/25/sports/25dribble1/25dribble1-thumbL