an draw scorn.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/26/fashion/weddings/tech-titans-choose-small-or-secretive-ceremonies-field-notes.html', 'snippet': 'The exceptions, like Sean Parker, who may spend about $9 million on his event, can draw scorn.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s not easy being a billionaire nerd. Just ask Sean Parker. When details recently leaked about the Napster/Facebook/Spotify mogul’s lavish plans to marry the singer Alexandra Lenas next weekend at a resort in Big Sur, Calif., many mistakenly jumped to the conclusion that Mr. Parker, 33, would host a medieval-themed event. A big, fat geek wedding, if you will. ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/fashion/weddings/26FIELDNOTES1_SPAN/26FIELDNOTES1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 373, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/26/fashion/weddings/26FIELDNOTES1_SPAN/26FIELDNOTES1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 373}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/fashion/weddings/26FIELDNOTES1_SPAN/26FIELDNOTES1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 636, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/fashion/weddings/26FIELDNOTES1_SPAN/26FIELDNOTES1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1272, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/fashion/weddings/26FIELDNOTES1_SPAN/26FIELDNOTES1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/26/fashion/weddings