nd refused.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I rarely get unsolicited details from my quiet seventh-grade son about his school day, so he captured my attention one Friday afternoon when he told me that, in fact, something noteworthy had happened, “but I didn’t do it.” ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'When a Stranger Doesn’t Mean Danger', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Childhood', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-24T19:34:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lisa Flam', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lisa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Flam', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3141242c-cc4b-5a13-8041-978bf58d876c', 'word_count': 1010, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3141242c-cc4b-5a13-8041-978bf58d876c'}, {'abstract': 'An Upper East Side one-bedroom with a fireplace, an East Village condo with expansive views, and a Fort Greene apartment in the Williamsburg Savings Bank Building.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2013/05/26/realestate/20130526-OTMNYC.html', 'snippet': 'An Upper East Side one-bedroom with a fireplace, an East Village condo with expansive views, and a Fort Greene apartment in the Williamsburg Savings Bank Building.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An Upper East Side one-bedroom with a fireplace, an East Village condo with expansive views, and a Fort Greene apartment in the Williamsburg Savings Bank Building.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/realestate/20130526-OTMNYC-slide-BSLO/20130526-OTMNYC-slide-BSL