test in a string of departures.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The exodus from the London-based literary journal Granta continued this week with the departure of Philip Gwyn Jones, the publisher of the magazine’s books imprint, who became the latest staff member to leave since John Freeman, the magazine’s editor, announced his resignation in April. The art director, deputy editor and associate editor have also left the magazine, which recently announced the closing of its New York office.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'More Staff Members Leave Granta', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'More Staff Members  Leave Granta', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Magazines', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Granta', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-24T20:39:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Schuessler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schuessler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a4161c5c-ed72-5cc1-82cb-00af0984ae29', 'word_count': 363, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a4161c5c-ed72-5cc1-82cb-00af0984ae29'}, {'abstract': 'The name to know if you want a good table at Nick & Toni’s, the hottest restaurant in the Hamptons, is Bonnie.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/26/fashion/nick-tonis-a-restaurant-in-the-hamptons-where-bonnie-is-the-word.html', 'snippet': 'The name to know if you want a good table at Nick & Toni’s, the hottest restaurant in the Hamptons, is Bonnie.', 'lead_paragraph': 'East Hampton, N.Y. — The most coveted summer property in the Hamptons is not the 12-bedroom $45 million Linden estate in Southampton or the legendary 6,000-square-foot East Hampton house known as Grey Gardens that Ben Bradlee and Sally Quinn are offering for rent in June and July for a mere $125,000.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/fashion/26BONNIE_SPAN/26BONNIE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 387, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/26/fashion/26BONNIE_SPAN/26BONNIE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 387}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/fashion/26BONNIE_SPAN/26BONNIE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 661, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/fashion/26BONNIE_SPAN/26BONNIE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1323, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/fashion/26BONNIE_SPAN/26BONNIE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/26/fashion/26BONNIE_SPAN/26BONNIE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/fashion/26BONNIE_SPAN/26BONNIE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Nick? Toni? Neither', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Nick? Toni? Neither', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keyw