25df-a374-576b-b644-1158ab91949c'}, {'abstract': 'The closing of a plant in Paducah, Ky., could pose a problem for the American nuclear weapons arsenal over time but is not likely to affect civilian nuclear electric plants.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/25/business/usec-to-shut-uranium-enrichment-plant-in-kentucky.html', 'snippet': 'The closing of a plant in Paducah, Ky., could pose a problem for the American nuclear weapons arsenal over time but is not likely to affect civilian nuclear electric plants.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The only American-owned plant for enriching uranium, a cold war relic near Paducah, Ky., will be shut down next month, its operator said on Friday. The closing could pose a problem for the American nuclear weapons arsenal over time but is not likely to affect civilian nuclear electric plants. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Kentucky Operator to Cease Enrichment of Uranium', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Operator To Cease Enrichment Of Uranium', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'USEC (United States Enrichment Corp)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Uranium', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Weapons', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kentucky', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Energy', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shutdowns (Institutional)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-25T02:45:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matthew L. Wald', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matthew', 'middlename': 'L.', 'lastname': 'Wald', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 