 to tie the Eastern Conference finals at one game each.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/25/sports/basketball/lebron-james-stumbles-and-pacers-top-heat-in-game-2.html', 'snippet': 'LeBron James scored 36 points, but his two late turnovers helped Indiana beat Miami to tie the Eastern Conference finals at one game each.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Give LeBron James an inch or two, a second or two, a half-step or a slight gap, and he will turn you into a historical footnote, a foil for his Hall of Fame highlight reel. This much, the Indiana Pacers had already learned, painfully, deeply, in the opener of the Eastern Conference finals.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/25/sports/sub-heat/sub-heat-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 412, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/25/sports/sub-heat/sub-heat-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 412}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/25/sports/sub-heat/sub-heat-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 704, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/25/sports/sub-heat/sub-heat-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1407, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/25/sports/sub-heat/sub-heat-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/25/sports/sub-heat/sub-heat-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/25/sports/sub-heat/sub-heat-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'James’s Miscues Help Pacers Stop Heat to Tie Series', 'kicker': 'Game 2: Pacers 97, Heat 93', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'James Again Seals A Win; This Time It&#8217;s for the Pacers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Beck, Howard', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Indiana Pacers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Miami Heat', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'James, LeBron', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-25T04:45:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Howard Beck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Howard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Beck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/413e1900-e9af-5e40-a63f-39e7f8e84f6a', 'word_count': 1026, 'uri': 'nyt://article/413e1900-e9af-5e40-a63f-39e7f8e84f6a'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Tolbert, a high school dropout, went on to play a central role in an early effort to improve the way that blacks were portrayed on film.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/25/us/james-l-tolbert-lawyer-to-black-hollywood-dies-at-86.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Tolbert, a high school dropout, went on to play a central role in an early effort to improve the way that blacks were portrayed on film.', 'lead_paragraph': 'James L. Tolbert was in love. Marie Ross was too. But she had little interest in marrying a man who pieced together his income by hosting parties and concerts in empty buildings. One of his gimmicks: selling food and drink out of an old hearse.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/28/us/TOLBERT-obit/TOLBERT-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 867, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/28/us/TOLBERT-obit/TOLBERT-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 867}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/28/us/TOLBERT-obit/TOLBERT-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 709, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/28/us/TOLBERT-obit/TOLBERT-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1377, 'width': 953, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/28/us/TOLBERT-obit/TOLBERT-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/28/us/TOLBERT-obit/TOLBERT-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/28/us/TOLBERT-obit/TOLBERT-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'James L. Tolbert, 86, an Early Lawyer to Black Hollywood, Dies', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'James L. Tolbert, 86, an Early Lawyer to Black Hollywood', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tolbert, James L (1926-2013)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yardley, William', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Legal Profession', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-25T04:45:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Yardley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yardley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/0d0ddf99-f324-5603-868c-a636f6498b94', 'word_count': 721, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0d0ddf99-f324-5603-868c-a636f6498b94'}, {'abstract': 'A sampling of worthy seasonal pursuits, across all five boroughs, that will make the months from Memorial Day to Labor Day bearable.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/26/nyregion/summer-events-in-new-york-city.html', 'snippet': 'A sampling of worthy seasonal pursuits, across all five boroughs, that will make the months from Memorial Day to Labor Day bearable.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York City cannot bear to be anything but the best. Even its notorious summer heat and humidity have to compete on the world stage, giving the tropics an annual run for their money. But while the less intrepid (and more affluent) flee to beach towns and other breezier climes, the city offers a wealth of summer diversions to those who stay put and embrace the swelter. The following is a sampling of worthy seasonal pursuits, across all five boroughs, that will make the months from Memorial Day to Labor Day much more bearable.', 'prin