 against the Braves was stopped in a cold rain; it will resume Saturday night.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/25/sports/baseball/mets-braves-game-suspended-for-rain.html', 'snippet': 'Ike Davis struck out four times before the Mets’ game against the Braves was stopped in a cold rain; it will resume Saturday night.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The number of strikeouts collected by Ike Davis during the Mets’ 45th game, which began Friday night, will not be officially determined until Saturday. The series opener between the Mets and the Braves at Citi Field was suspended before the start of the ninth inning with the score tied at 5-5, and the game will resume at 6:10 p.m.\xa0 ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/25/sports/2-sub-mets/2-sub-mets-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 831, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/25/sports/2-sub-mets/2-sub-mets-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 831}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/25/sports/2-sub-mets/2-sub-mets-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 740, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/25/sports/2-sub-mets/2-sub-mets-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1480, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/25/sports/2-sub-mets/2-sub-mets-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/25/sports/2-sub-mets/2-sub-mets-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thu