52e6b08a0', 'word_count': 1163, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5ca993a7-99e2-5a47-a213-fb952e6b08a0'}, {'abstract': 'A deadly accident highlighted concerns about the use of compressed natural gas kits in vehicles in Pakistan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/26/world/asia/pakistan-van-accident-kills-children-and-teacher.html', 'snippet': 'A deadly accident highlighted concerns about the use of compressed natural gas kits in vehicles in Pakistan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ISLAMABAD, Pakistan — Fifteen schoolchildren and a teacher were killed Saturday when their school van caught fire in eastern Punjab Province, rescue and government officials said. Seven other children were injured, two of them critically.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/world/pakistan-bus-floater/pakistan-bus-floater-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 428, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/26/world/pakistan-bus-floater/pakistan-bus-floater-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 428}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/world/pakistan-bus-floater/pakistan-bus-floater-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 731, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/world/pakistan-bus-floater/pakistan-bus-floater-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1462, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/world/pakistan-bus-floater/pakistan-bus-floater-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/