nytimes.com/2013/05/25/century-old-racing-columns-still-quicken-the-pulse/', 'snippet': 'Part gossip, part handicapping, part pure racing fandom, W. C. Vreeland’s columns made horses into celebrities and readers into racing insiders.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You can read old editions of The Brooklyn Daily Eagle online if you are interested in issues that appeared from 1841 to 1902, but thanks to Old Fulton NY Postcards, a quirky site featuring scanned-in articles from many New York papers, I have read many of W. C. Vreeland’s racing pieces, which appear in later issues. Vreeland’s writing rang with the nerve, excitement and depth of racing. Part gossip, part handicapping, part pure racing fandom, Vreeland’s columns made horses into celebrities and readers into racing insiders.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Century-Old Racing Columns Still Quicken the Pulse', 'kicker': 'The Rail', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Horse Racing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Brooklyn Daily Eagle', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-25T10:07:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eliza McGraw', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eliza', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McGraw', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/20e7f460-2a78-578c-9ae5-79ca15a58a9d', 'word_count': 452, 'uri': 'nyt://article/20e7f460-2a78-578c-9ae5-79ca15a58a9d'}, {'abstract': 'A round-up of news from across India.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/25/newswallah-bharat-edition-88/', 'snippet': 'A round-up of news from across India.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jammu and Kashmir: A woman from Pakistan was caught by the Border Security Forces in the 