the Wall', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hunting and Trapping', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Klinkenborg, Verlyn', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Families and Family Life', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxidermy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-25T14:33:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Verlyn Klinkenborg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Verlyn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Klinkenborg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/8acb1ac8-804f-5895-ac97-cc4cb6fe4869', 'word_count': 389, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8acb1ac8-804f-5895-ac97-cc4cb6fe4869'}, {'abstract': 'Other companies are free to produce all-pink bats for Mother’s Day but only Hillerich & Bradsby, the makers of Louisville Slugger, can display its logo on the bats.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/26/sports/baseball/postscript-in-pink-rule-kept-bats-in-rack.html', 'snippet': 'Other companies are free to produce all-pink bats for Mother’s Day but only Hillerich & Bradsby, the makers of Louisville Slugger, can display its logo on the bats.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A little over two weeks ago, a bat was dropped off in the visitors’ clubhouse at Target Field in Minneapolis. It was intended for Baltimore Orioles outfielder Nick Markakis, and it was stained his standard black — except for Markakis’s signature and the bat’s name and model number, all of which were in pink. Nearby, in the Minnesota Twins’ clubhouse, third baseman Trevor Plouffe had just received a similarly marked bat.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/sports/dog-pink-bats/dog-pink-bats-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/26/sports/dog-pink-bats/dog-pink-bats-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 337}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/sports/dog-pink-bats/dog-pink-bats-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 359, 'width': 639, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/sports/dog-pink-bats/dog-pink-bats-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 359, 'width': 639, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/sports/dog-pink-bats/dog-pink-bats-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/26/sports/dog-pink-bats/dog-pink-bats-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/sports/dog-pink-bats/dog-pink-bats-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Postscript in Pink: Rule Kept Bats in Rack', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Postscript in Pink: Rule Kept Bats in Rack ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sporting Goods', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': "Mother's Day", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name