ok a big career turn in 1991, when he started running a shipment logistics franchise. Now he runs the whole company.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/26/jobs/dan-lockwood-of-unishippers-from-franchisee-to-ceo.html', 'snippet': 'A former dolphin trainer and restaurant group official took a big career turn in 1991, when he started running a shipment logistics franchise. Now he runs the whole company.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MY parents moved from San Luis Obispo to the Mojave Desert, about four hours to the east, after my dad, a physicist, got a job at what is now the Naval Air Weapons Station, China Lake. My younger brother Chris and I grew up catching lizards and snakes and riding motorcycles. We were also on the local swim team.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/business/26BOSS/26BOSS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 778, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/26/business/26BOSS/26BOSS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 778}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/business/26BOSS/26BOSS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 790, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/business/26BOSS/26BOSS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1960, 'width': 1512, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/business/26BOSS/26BOSS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/26/business/26BOSS/26BOSS-thumbStandard.jpg', 't