}, {'abstract': 'By bringing Patrick Roy back, the Avalanche hope to reconnect with their fans as well as revive their competitive fortunes. But Roy has never coached in the league.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/26/sports/hockey/patrick-roy-will-face-challenges-as-colorados-coach.html', 'snippet': 'By bringing Patrick Roy back, the Avalanche hope to reconnect with their fans as well as revive their competitive fortunes. But Roy has never coached in the league.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Shortly after Memorial Day, the Colorado Avalanche will introduce Patrick Roy as their coach, a hiring the team announced Thursday. He will also be vice president for hockey operations, sharing roster decisions with Joe Sakic, his former Avalanche teammate, who was named an executive vice president earlier this month.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jump to Pros Is Quite a Leap', 'kicker': 'Slap Shot', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jump To Pros Is Quite A Leap', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Roy, Patrick', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sakic, Joe', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Colorado Avalanche', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-25T15:51:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Z. Klein and Stu Hackel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': 'Z.', 'lastname': 'Klein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Stu', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hackel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2b7f5a06-004d-5acc-b0a4-fc059ab9eb03', 'word_count': 699, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2b7f5a06-004d-5acc-b0a4-fc059ab9eb03'}, {'abstract': 'As his team faces elimination, the man known affectionately as Jumbo is less the aim of blame and more the focus of both his teammates’ trust and his opponents’ efforts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/26/sports/hockey/joe-thornton-doesnt-let-sharks-lose-their-bite.html', 'snippet': 'As his team faces elimination, the man known affectionately as Jumbo is less the aim of blame and more the focus of both his teammates’ trust and his opponents’ efforts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — The jovial San Jose Sharks captain, Joe Thornton, has managed to laugh off plenty of criticism in his career, once joking that he would much sooner spend his time perusing Playboy than reading anything in the hockey press.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/sports/dog-sharks/dog-sharks-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 383, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/26/sports/dog-sharks/dog-sharks-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 383}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/sports/dog-sharks/dog-sharks-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 653, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/sports/dog-sharks/dog-sharks-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1307, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/sports/dog-sharks/dog-sharks-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75,