he trainer Shug McGaughey is still gauging whether Orb, his first Kentucky Derby champion who finished a disappointing fourth in the Preakness, should compete in the Belmont Stakes on June 8.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Shug McGaughey has been guided by the condition of his horse throughout his Hall of Fame career. He is not about to change now as he debates whether Orb, his first Kentucky Derby champion who finished a disappointing fourth in the Preakness, should compete in the Belmont Stakes on June 8.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'With Orb, It’s Still Wait and See', 'kicker': 'The Rail', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Belmont Stakes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Horse Racing', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McGaughey, Shug', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-25T15:55:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tom Pedulla', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tom', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pedulla', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f62bdfb8-6a34-54eb-aaeb-c41fa605fc21', 'word_count': 234, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f62bdfb8-6a34-54eb-aaeb-c41fa605fc21'}, {'abstract': 'Annika Sorenstam did not make the cut when she played on the men’s golf tour at the 2003 Colonial, but appreciation of her appearance has grown in the 10 years since.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/26/sports/golf/ten-years-later-a-growing-appreciation-for-sorenstams-breakthrough.html', 'snippet': 'Annika Sorenstam did not make the cut when she played on the men’s golf tour at the 2003 Colonial, but appreciation of her appearance has grown in the 10 years since.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Annika Sorenstam’s participation in the PGA Tour event at Colonial Country Club 10 years ago did not change people’s thinking overnight the way Billie Jean King’s exhibition tennis match against Bobby Riggs in another part of Texas had 30 years before.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ten Years Later, a Growing Appreciation for Sorenstam’s Breakthrough', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ten Years Later, a Growing Appreciation for Sorenstam’s Breakthrough', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sorenstam, Annika', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ladies Professional Golf Assn', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'PGA Tour Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-25T15:56:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karen Crouse', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Crouse', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b0761b05-b3b1-5ff4-87a3-1a6aedbbb76e', 'word_count': 1002, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b0761b05-b3b1-5ff4-87a3-1a6aedbbb76e'}, {'abstract': 'More than 500 major league baseball players served in the military during World War II. Two died: Elmer Gedeon and Harry O’Neill.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/26/sports/baseball/remembering-the-major-leaguers-who-died-in-world-war-ii.html', 'snippet': 'More than 500 major league baseball players served in the military during World War II. Two died: Elmer Gedeon and Harry O’Neill.', 'lead_paragraph': 'More than 500 major league baseball