tes, I have developed a variety of tricks to avoid submitting myself to them.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Showdown at the Airport Body Scanner', 'kicker': 'Anxiety', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Showdown at the Airport Body Scanner', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Airport Security', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Radiation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Scanning Devices', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Transportation Security Administration', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-25T17:00:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nathaniel Rich', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nathaniel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rich', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/357ca444-bc49-56f9-be9e-752138bc3c4a', 'word_count': 1195, 'uri': 'nyt://article/357ca444-bc49-56f9-be9e-752138bc3c4a'}, {'abstract': 'Arjen Robben scored the go-ahead goal in the final minutes of Saturday’s Champions League final to lift Bayern Munich over Dortmund at Wembley Stadium in London.', 'web_url': 'https://goal.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/25/live-analysis-champions-league-final-bayern-munich-vs-dortmund/', 'snippet': 'Arjen Robben scored the go-ahead goal in the final minutes of Saturday’s Champions League final to lift Bayern Munich over Dortmund at Wembley Stadium in London.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Goal blog provided live analysis and commentary of Saturday’s Champions League final — Bayern Munich’s thrilling 2-1 win over Dortmund at Wembley Stadium in London. Read on to follow the game as it happened.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'ma