uthorities said. Among the dead were five police officers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Maoist Attack Kills at Least 16 in India', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Maoist Attack Kills at Least 16 in India', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Delhi (India)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Indian National Congress', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gupta, Mukesh', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-25T22:02:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gardiner Harris and Hari Kumar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gardiner', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Harris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Hari', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kumar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5dab4860-9108-56a9-906b-bdb1893478f5', 'word_count': 288, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5dab4860-9108-56a9-906b-bdb1893478f5'}, {'abstract': 'Arjen Robben’s goal in the 89th minute gave Bayern Munich a 2-1 victory in the first all-German final in Champions League history.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/26/sports/soccer/bayern-munich-edges-borussia-dortmund-in-champions-league-final.html', 'snippet': 'Arjen Robben’s goal in the 89th minute gave Bayern Munich a 2-1 victory in the first all-German final in Champions League history.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Some saw this as the opening to an age of German soccer dominance, and maybe it will be. Maybe years from now Saturday’s Champions League final between Bayern Munich and Borussia Dortmund