et Year of High School Slips Away', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Commencement Speeches', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Teenagers and Adolescence', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-26T12:37:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Susan Sachs Lipman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Susan', 'middlename': 'Sachs', 'lastname': 'Lipman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bf5522a4-4a0c-59da-b143-f08c5ef021e3', 'word_count': 904, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bf5522a4-4a0c-59da-b143-f08c5ef021e3'}, {'abstract': 'Sara Errani of Italy was back at the French Open after competing in the finals of the event last year.', 'web_url': 'https://straightsets.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/26/errani-outplays-rus-in-early-match/', 'snippet': 'Sara Errani of Italy was back at the French Open after competing in the finals of the event last year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — The last time Sara Errani of Italy played a match at the French Open, the stands were filled with more than 15,000 spectators. It was the women’s final last year, when she lost to Maria Sharapova of Russia.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Errani Outplays Rus in Early Match', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'French Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Errani, Sara', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rus, Arantxa', 'rank': 3, '