e': 'Barnes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9bbe4af5-1d43-599b-a09d-49f27a9205f6', 'word_count': 603, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9bbe4af5-1d43-599b-a09d-49f27a9205f6'}, {'abstract': 'The styles and diversity of the Odissi genre of Indian classical dance were on full display by the visiting Orissa Dance Academy on Friday at Ailey Studios.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/27/arts/dance/orissa-dance-academy-at-ailey-studios.html', 'snippet': 'The styles and diversity of the Odissi genre of Indian classical dance were on full display by the visiting Orissa Dance Academy on Friday at Ailey Studios.', 'lead_paragraph': 'How marvelous, amid the furor of the ballet spring season at Lincoln Center, to spend an evening watching top-level Indian dance — and to recall that its Odissi genre is not only far older than ballet but just as beautiful, classical and compelling. Pure dance and “speaking” mime alternate and overlap; every part of the body is involved, not the least fingers and eyes; the tilt of the shoulder line from one diagonal to another becomes a richly harmonic effect, like a change from one full chord to another; long-held poses sing out with powerfully sculptural effect amid rapid rhythms. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/27/arts/orissa/orissa-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 746, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/27/arts/orissa/orissa-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 746}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/27/arts/orissa/orissa-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 824, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', '