en innings as the Yankees fell to the Rays and lost an opportunity for a three-game sweep.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/27/sports/baseball/sabathias-struggles-continue-as-yankees-stumble-against-rays.html', 'snippet': 'C. C. Sabathia allowed seven runs, including a pair of two-run homers, in seven innings as the Yankees fell to the Rays and lost an opportunity for a three-game sweep.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ST. PETERSBURG, Fla. — About 15 minutes after C. C. Sabathia and the Yankees were pounded by the Tampa Bay Rays, the pitching coach Larry Rothschild sat next to Sabathia in front of his locker, and they had a brief conversation in hushed tones.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/27/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 384, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/27/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 384}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/27/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 655, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/27/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1310, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/27/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/27/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge'