': 'nyt://slideshow/a29552dd-2972-5676-b96a-44619296d262'}, {'abstract': 'On June 21 bridge players are being challenged to compete for at least part of approximately 16 hours from dawn to dusk to raise $100 an hour or more for the Alzheimer’s Association.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/27/crosswords/bridge/bridge-the-longest-day-and-young-chelsea-bridge-club.html', 'snippet': 'On June 21 bridge players are being challenged to compete for at least part of approximately 16 hours from dawn to dusk to raise $100 an hour or more for the Alzheimer’s Association.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bridge marathons are few and far between. Four students played in London for 170 hours in 1969. Three years later four students in Edinburgh broke that record by 10 hours. The Young Chelsea Bridge Club in London has organized several marathons that last exactly 24 hours, but teams of three may enter.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/27/crosswords/bridge/27card/27card-jumbo.gif', 'height': 500, 'width': 262, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/27/crosswords/bridge/27card/27card-superJumbo.gif', 'height': 500, 'width': 262, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/27/crosswords/bridge/27card/27card-thumbStandard.gif', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/27/crosswords/bridge/27card/27card-thumbStandard.gif', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/27/crosswords/b