eason, along with a tidy reward estimated to be about $180 million.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — It is being called the richest single match in the history of soccer.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Watford to Face Crystal Palace in English Promotion Final', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Crystal Palace (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'English Premier League', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Watford (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-26T22:31:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jack Bell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/879b983c-e2c9-5c8f-aed9-b1b04febe6e7', 'word_count': 523, 'uri': 'nyt://article/879b983c-e2c9-5c8f-aed9-b1b04febe6e7'}, {'abstract': 'The march occurred as a recent poll showed many French were losing patience with protests against the “marriage for all” law that passed on May 18.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/27/world/europe/thousands-march-in-france-against-gay-marriage.html', 'snippet': 'The march occurred as a recent poll showed many French were losing patience with protests against the “marriage for all” law that passed on May 18.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — Thousands of French marched on Sunday, France’s Mother’s Day, to protest the recent legalization of gay marriage. Despite initial worries, the demonstration was largely peaceful, with the police estimating that about 150,000 people took part.', 'pri