british-soldiers-killer-had-ties-to-al-qaeda-government-says.html', 'snippet': 'Authorities said they knew that Michael Adebolajo, a suspect in the murder of an off-duty soldier last week, had been arrested in Kenya on suspicion of planning to join an extremist group.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Britain’s security agencies appeared headed for a period of deeply uncomfortable scrutiny after the government said Sunday that it had been aware for more than two years that one of the two men suspected of hacking an off-duty British soldier to death on a London street had ties to Al Qaeda.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'British Officials Knew Suspect in Soldier’s Death Had Ties to Al Qaeda', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Officials Knew Suspect in Soldier’s Death Had Ties to Al Qaeda', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Burns, John F', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Adebolajo, Michael', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AL QAEDA', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kenya', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nigeria', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Shabab', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Somalia', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rigby, Lee', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Security Service (MI5)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-27T01:35:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_