astname': 'Krugman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/50205980-3b44-5ef2-aba2-d620e3b9ea54', 'word_count': 457, 'uri': 'nyt://article/50205980-3b44-5ef2-aba2-d620e3b9ea54'}, {'abstract': 'A Marine found that honoring a friend killed in Afghanistan also meant honoring his own grief.', 'web_url': 'https://atwar.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/27/the-affectionate-burden-left-by-a-fallen-friend/', 'snippet': 'A Marine found that honoring a friend killed in Afghanistan also meant honoring his own grief.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On May 18, 2010, I awoke to the all-too-familiar sound of an improvised explosive device detonating. But this one was different from others we had encountered in Marja, Afghanistan, that spring. This explosion shook our entire patrol, and the barking of orders that followed proved the reality of what had happened. I knew that my platoon had been hit. As I donned my gear, I began to pray for whoever might have been wounded, and that we could evacuate them as quickly as possible.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/world/26atwarBell-2/26atwarBell-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 495, 'width': 450, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/world/26atwarBell-2/26atwarBell-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 495, 'width': 450, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/world/26atwarBell-2/26atwarBell-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/26/world/26atwarBell-2/26atwarBell-