 Debbie Martin had the same gene whose presence prompted Ms. Jolie to undergo a double mastectomy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Less than two weeks after Angelina Jolie described her decision to have a double mastectomy to avoid breast cancer in an Op-Ed article in The New York Times, her aunt, Debbie Martin, has died of the disease in Escondido, Calif., The Associated Press reported. She was 61 and died on Sunday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Angelina Jolie’s Aunt Dies of Breast Cancer', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Breast Cancer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Genetics and Heredity', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mastectomy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jolie, Angelina', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-27T16:18:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam W. Kepler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Kepler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4ef33a8f-b89d-50c2-b437-088433c39acc', 'word_count': 182, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4ef33a8f-b89d-50c2-b437-088433c39acc'}, {'abstract': 'The Marshals Service is offering for $4.495 million a grand Long Island home that belonged to Peter Madoff, Bernard’s brother.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/28/nyregion/selling-a-madoff-home.html', 'snippet': 'The Marshals Service is offering for $4.495 million a grand Long Island home that belonged to Peter Madoff, Bernard’s brother.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The lush white mansion for sale at 34 Pheasant Run in Old Westbury on Long Island makes a grand first impression. It has a long, winding driveway; a tennis