 'Erik', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Piepenburg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/6285bb45-5cfb-58f9-833a-a2654f4aeb34', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/6285bb45-5cfb-58f9-833a-a2654f4aeb34'}, {'abstract': 'Research shows that most women neither enjoy nor admire the body-denigrating bonding ritual known as “fat talk.” But that doesn’t stop them from engaging in it.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/27/fat-talk-compels-but-carries-a-cost/', 'snippet': 'Research shows that most women neither enjoy nor admire the body-denigrating bonding ritual known as “fat talk.” But that doesn’t stop them from engaging in it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Over winter break, Carolyn Bates, a college senior, and a friend each picked out five pairs of jeans at a Gap store in Indianapolis and eagerly tried them on. But the growing silence in their separate fitting rooms was telling. At last, one friend called out, “Dang it, these fit everywhere but my thighs! I wish my legs weren’t so huge.” The response: “My pair is way too long. I need to be taller or skinnier!”', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/28/health/28talk/28talk-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 530, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/28/health/28talk/28talk-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 530}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/28/health/28talk/28talk-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 905, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/28/health/28ta