ons of the Subway Series. But Tuesday night’s matchup between Hiroki Kuroda and Matt Harvey was a major source of buzz before the start of the series Monday night at Citi Field. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Harvey Eager to Face Yankees, His Childhood Team', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Harvey, Matt', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kuroda, Hiroki', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Murphy, Daniel', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tejada, Ruben', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-27T23:26:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Keh', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Keh', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dd81390f-e141-521f-b0b7-49a6c8902c31', 'word_count': 768, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dd81390f-e141-521f-b0b7-49a6c8902c31'}, {'abstract': 'Two men made a political statement by going through the ritual in Rome, though gay couples have no legal standing in Italy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2013/05/28/world/europe/28italy.html', 'snippet': 'Two men made a political statement by going through the ritual in Rome, though gay couples have no legal standing in Italy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two men made a political statement by going through the ritual in Rome, though gay couples have no legal standing in Italy.', 'source': 'The New