le/851c1488-f8ed-51ac-96b9-30e56f86719c'}, {'abstract': 'The final script has not been written on the 2013 Dodgers or their freeway rivals, the Angels. Either could still recover and mount a playoff run.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/28/sports/baseball/angels-and-dodgers-meet-with-losing-records.html', 'snippet': 'The final script has not been written on the 2013 Dodgers or their freeway rivals, the Angels. Either could still recover and mount a playoff run.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — The baseball teams that met here on Monday, both with losing records and far from first place, are not alone among Southern California underachievers. The premier team in town, the Lakers, exited the N.B.A. playoffs without a victory despite a roster of stars.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/28/sports/baseball/28kepner-4/28kepner-4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/28/sports/baseball/28kepner-4/28kepner-4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/28/sports/baseball/28kepner-4/28kepner-4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 619, 'width': 1005, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/28/sports/baseball/28kepner-4/28kepner-4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 619, 'width': 1005, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/28/sports/baseball/28kepner-4/28kepner-4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thum