d377a1e4-bc46-5c21-a8f8-467f9ef2dcef'}, {'abstract': 'Lawyers for George Zimmerman, who is charged with second-degree murder, have been barred from mentioning Mr. Martin’s marijuana use, among other things, in opening arguments.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/29/us/judge-in-trayvon-martin-case-puts-limits-on-defense.html', 'snippet': 'Lawyers for George Zimmerman, who is charged with second-degree murder, have been barred from mentioning Mr. Martin’s marijuana use, among other things, in opening arguments.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MIAMI — Lawyers for George Zimmerman, who is charged with second-degree murder in the killing of Trayvon Martin, will be barred from mentioning Mr. Martin’s marijuana use, history of fights or high school suspension during opening statements in Mr. Zimmerman’s trial, which begins June 10.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/29/us/ZIMMERMAN/ZIMMERMAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 767, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/29/us/ZIMMERMAN/ZIMMERMAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 767}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/29/us/ZIMMERMAN/ZIMMERMAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 802, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/29/us/ZIMMERMAN/ZIMMERMAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1603, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/29/us/ZIMMERMAN/ZIMMERMAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard',