b9-55d1-b753-63c526e4bb10'}, {'abstract': 'The second season of “Prisoners of War,” the Israeli drama that inspired “Homeland,” is having its American premiere online at Hulu. Compare and contrast.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/29/arts/television/season-2-of-prisoners-of-war-on-hulu.html', 'snippet': 'The second season of “Prisoners of War,” the Israeli drama that inspired “Homeland,” is having its American premiere online at Hulu. Compare and contrast.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Showtime’s “Homeland” and the Israeli television series on which it’s based, “Prisoners of War,” are like an experiment in genetics: Sharing DNA but raised by different parents in different environments, they’re entirely distinct while maintaining a strong family resemblance. Also, they’re both very good.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Ties That Bind Two TV Siblings', 'kicker': 'Watch List', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Ties That Bind Two TV Siblings', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hulu.com', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Homeland (TV Program)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-28T20:52:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mike Hale', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mike', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hale', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/45d9e4c0-17c5-5108-a2ea-5df387e0c8d6', 'word_count': 446, 'uri': 'nyt://article/45d9e4c0-17c5-5108-a2ea-5df387e0c8d6'}, {'abstract': 'The site of the French Open knows quaint doesn’t count for much at a modern Grand Slam anymore, but Par