swing-remains-atop-the-order/', 'snippet': 'Mets shortstop Ruben Tejada, hitting just .213 going into Tuesday’s game against the Yankees, was penciled in at the leadoff spot again.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ruben Tejada’s swing remains a project, one that will play out in plain sight as he continues to man the Mets’ leadoff spot.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tejada, Still Working on His Swing, Remains Atop the Order', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Collins, Terry L', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tejada, Ruben', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-28T22:57:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Keh', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Keh', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/16274cbe-106c-5346-a320-4bfe0e3e6926', 'word_count': 546, 'uri': 'nyt://article/16274cbe-106c-5346-a320-4bfe0e3e6926'}, {'abstract': 'The country’s main railway operator wants to use tiny remote-controlled helicopters to catch graffitists, but clandestine surveillance is a strongly emotional issue in Germany.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/29/world/europe/in-germany-unease-at-plan-to-use-drones-to-fight-graffiti.html', 'snippet': 'The country’s main railway operator wants to use tiny remote-controlled helicopters to catch graffitists, but clandestine surveillance is a strongly emotional issue in Germany.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BERLIN — Germans have no trouble agreeing that the graffiti cov