': 'Rothenberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/159b0559-ca7d-5e43-b36d-138467b671d2', 'word_count': 740, 'uri': 'nyt://article/159b0559-ca7d-5e43-b36d-138467b671d2'}, {'abstract': 'Sgt. Kevin Brennan returned to the Bushwick Houses to prepare for the trial of the man charged with trying to kill him, but his mission changed when his old partner spotted two suspects in a recent home-invasion case.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/28/officer-shot-in-head-in-2012-makes-an-arrest-near-the-same-spot/', 'snippet': 'Sgt. Kevin Brennan returned to the Bushwick Houses to prepare for the trial of the man charged with trying to kill him, but his mission changed when his old partner spotted two suspects in a recent home-invasion case.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For Police Sgt. Kevin Brennan, his visit to the Bushwick Houses on Tuesday was supposed to be uneventful. He was there to familiarize himself with where he had been on the night of Jan. 31, 2012, when he was shot in the head. The trial of the man charged with trying to murder him is approaching, and Sergeant Brennan needed to prepare. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/28/nyregion/28cityroom-brennan/28cityroom-brennan-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/28/nyregion/28cityroom-brennan/28cityroom-brennan-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/28/nyregion/28cityroom-brennan/28cityroom-brennan-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': N