 soccer team when it faces Belgium in Cleveland on Wednesday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/29/sports/soccer/beasley-set-to-hit-century-mark-for-us-national-team.html', 'snippet': 'DaMarcus Beasley is expected to become the 13th player to appear 100 times for the United States soccer team when it faces Belgium in Cleveland on Wednesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After struggling for a roster spot in the first 18 months of Jurgen Klinsmann’s tenure as head coach, DaMarcus Beasley was called up to fill in for injured players in March for two World Cup qualifiers. He had been away from the national team for more than a year.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/29/sports/soccer/29beasley1/29beasley1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/29/sports/soccer/29beasley1/29beasley1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/29/sports/soccer/29beasley1/29beasley1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/29/sports/soccer/29beasley1/29beasley1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/29/sports/soccer/29beasley1/29beasley1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/29/sports/soccer/29beasley1/29beasley1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thu