', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/af88e652-2f59-540d-acdd-a3e44c5d8eff', 'word_count': 803, 'uri': 'nyt://article/af88e652-2f59-540d-acdd-a3e44c5d8eff'}, {'abstract': 'The Harvey Theater at the Brooklyn Academy Music will be home to the Steinberg Screen and 42 speakers.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/29/grab-some-popcorn-big-screen-with-big-sound-coming-to-bam/', 'snippet': 'The Harvey Theater at the Brooklyn Academy Music will be home to the Steinberg Screen and 42 speakers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The movie palace is making a return to Brooklyn this summer. The Harvey Theater at the Brooklyn Academy of Music will be home to the Steinberg Screen, a 35-foot-by-19-foot digital projection screen, with 42 accompanying surround-sound speakers. That will make the theater, a centerpiece of live productions and concerts, the largest cinema in Brooklyn able to show both 3-D and conventional films, according to BAM officials, who are to announce the new installation on Thursday.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Grab Some Popcorn: Big Screen With Big Sound Coming to BAM', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Screen Grows at BAM', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': '3-D Devices and Effects', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hopkins, Karen Brooks', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Brooklyn Academy of Music', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-29T17:38:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melena Ryzik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ryzik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/12373fd3-170c-5c63-afde-d4c2d92a2efc', 'word_count': 265, 'uri': 'nyt://article/12373fd3-170c-5c63-afde-d4c2d92a2efc'}, {'abstract': 'Brooks and Collins talk about why this isn’t their favorite season, politically speaking. Or really in any other way.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/29/why-summer-isnt-that-much-fun/', 'snippet': 'Brooks and Collins talk about why this isn’t their favorite season, politically speaking. Or really in any other way.', 'lead_paragraph': 'David:\xa0 Now that Memorial Day has come and gone, I feel that summer has truly started. I love this time of year and not only because I look amazing in poplin and any outfit involving spaghetti straps.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Why Summer Isn’t That Much Fun', 'kicker': 'The Conversation', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beaches', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'First Amendment (US Constitution)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Freedom of the Press', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Seasons and Months', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fish, Stanley', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Justice Department', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-29T17:40:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Brooks and Gail Collins', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brooks', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Gail', 'middlena