r and produce better results.', 'web_url': 'https://straightsets.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/29/unheralded-american-tries-to-change-that/', 'snippet': 'Varvara Lepchenko, 27, an Uzbek-American ranked 25th on the women’s tennis tour, said that in the end the best way to raise her public profile would be to play better and produce better results.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A year ago at the French Open, Varvara Lepchenko was the last American standing, beating Sloane Stephens by a day. With her fourth-round showing, she realistically booked a spot on the United States Olympic team.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Unheralded American Tries to Change That', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'French Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lepchenko, Varvara', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-29T19:17:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ravi Ubha', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ravi', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ubha', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/214670bf-d58b-5b25-8ec3-9b6c90dbb580', 'word_count': 1178, 'uri': 'nyt://article/214670bf-d58b-5b25-8ec3-9b6c90dbb580'}, {'abstract': 'Assemblywoman Inez D. Barron of Brooklyn is the first Democratic woman to call for Sheldon Silver’s resignation over his handling of Vito Lopez’s sexual harassment case.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/29/a-second-democrat-calls-for-silver-to-resign/', 'snippet': 'Assemblywoman Inez D. Barron of Brooklyn is the first Democratic woman to call for Sheldon Silver’s resignation over h