om/2013/05/29/daft-punk-is-no-1-on-album-chart/', 'snippet': 'The French dance duo had the second biggest opening week so far this year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A long-awaited album by a beloved act, drenched in the sound of vintage disco-funk, gets a lot of advance promotion and opens at No. 1 with a bang. No, not Justin Timberlake’s latest, “The 20/20 Experience.” This week that accolade belongs to Daft Punk, the robot-hatted French dance duo, whose comeback album, “Random Access Memories” (Daft Life/Columbia), has a big start on the Billboard chart.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/29/arts/29artsbeat-daft/29artsbeat-daft-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 528, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/29/arts/29artsbeat-daft/29artsbeat-daft-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 528}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/29/arts/29artsbeat-daft/29artsbeat-daft-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 902, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/29/arts/29artsbeat-daft/29artsbeat-daft-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1761, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/29/arts/29artsbeat-daft/29artsbeat-daft-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/29/arts/29artsbeat-daft/29artsbeat-daft-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 