every I.C.U. patient reduced bloodstream infections by up to 44 percent. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'More Aggressive Action Urged to Curb Hospital Infections', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | Health', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'More Aggressive Action Urged To Curb Hospital Infections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Methicillin-Resistant Staphylococcus Aureus', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Research', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Infections', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hospitals', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New England Journal of Medicine', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cleansers, Detergents and Soaps', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-30T00:04:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': "By Anahad O'Connor", 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anahad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': "O'Connor", 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/16796693-2b92-562d-b360-390a96d187c5', 'word_count': 88, 'uri': 'nyt://article/16796693-2b92-562d-b360-390a96d187c5'}, {'abstract': 'Alberto Nisman, who is investigating the 1994 bombing of a Jewish center, said Iran had set up intelligence stations in Latin America to carry out terrorist attacks directly or through Hezbollah.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/30/world/americas/prosecutor-in-argentina-says-iran-plotted-with-hezbollah-in-latin-america.html', 'snippet': 'Alberto Nisman, who is investigating the 1994 bombing of a Jewish center, said Iran had set up intelligence stations in Latin America to carry out terrorist attacks directly or through Hezbollah.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BUENOS AIRES — The special prosecutor investigating the 1994 bombing of a Jewish community center here that killed 85 people released a report on Wednesday claiming that Iran had set up intelligence stations in different parts of Latin America with the aim of carrying out terrorist attacks directly or through Hezbollah, the powerful Lebanese militant group. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Prosecutor in Argentina Sees Iranian Plot in Latin America', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Prosecutor In Argentina Sees Iran Plot', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romero, Simon', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hezbollah', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Latin America', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ARGENTINA', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Special Prosecutors (Independent Counsel)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nisman, Alberto', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-30T00:05:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By Simon Romero', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Simon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Romero', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/867c0f26-3217-5dbd-bd71-f7db69360174', 'word_count': 322, 'uri': 'nyt://article/867c0f26-3217-5dbd-bd71-f7db69360174'}, {'abstract': 'A Disneyland employee was arrested after a small explosion in the park’s Toon Town area, the police said Wednesday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/30/us/california-arrest-in-disneyland-blast.html', 'snippet': 'A Disneyland employee was arrested after a small explosion in the park’s Toon Town area, the police said Wednesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A Disneyland employee was arrested after a small explosion in the park’s Mickey’s Toontown area, the police said Wednesday. The employee, Christian Barnes, 22, was arrested Tuesday on suspicion of possessing a destructive device; he was being held on $1 million bail. Police believe a dry ice bomb was used Tuesday in a trash can. No one was injured.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'California: Arrest in Disneyland Blast', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | West', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'California: Arrest In Disneyland Blast', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Disneyland', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bombs and Explosives', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AMUSEMENT AND THEME PARKS', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Barnes, Christian', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-30T00:05:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ian Lovett', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lovett', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/fbb439df-0481-54ca-887b-2fd60f42893e', 'word_count': 59, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fbb439df-0481-54ca-887b-2fd60f42893e'}, {'abstract': 'After years of criticism, American mobile carriers now offer o