_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7bd2c6ac-c09d-5163-93c4-479e6c575b8d', 'word_count': 783, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7bd2c6ac-c09d-5163-93c4-479e6c575b8d'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Muehl’s art was sometimes considered a threat to public morality; at other times it was simply considered a threat to public safety.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/30/arts/design/otto-muehl-actionist-artist-dies-at-87.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Muehl’s art was sometimes considered a threat to public morality; at other times it was simply considered a threat to public safety.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Otto Muehl, an artist whose work combined sex, violence, gastronomy and bodily effluence with unbridled abandon, died on Sunday at his commune near Faro in southern Portugal. He was 87 and had lived in Portugal since 1997, when he was released from an Austrian prison after being convicted of having sex with minors. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/30/arts/MUEHL-1-obit/MUEHL-1-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 805, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/30/arts/MUEHL-1-obit/MUEHL-1-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 805}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/30/arts/MUEHL-1-obit/MUEHL-1-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 764, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/30/arts/MUEHL-1-obit/MUEHL-1-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1527, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/30/arts/MUEHL-1-obit/MUEHL-1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/30/arts/MUEHL-1-obit/MUEHL-1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/30/arts/MUEHL-1-obit/MUEHL-1-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Otto Muehl, Actionist Artist And Provocateur, Dies at 87', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Otto Muehl, Actionist Artist And Provocateur, Dies at 87', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Muehl, Otto', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fox, Margalit', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-30T01:03:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Margalit Fox', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Margalit', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fox', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/2d4367df-1806-5547-b2f6-74933d89c43a', 'word_count': 827, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2d4367df-1806-5547-b2f6-74933d89c43a'}, {'abstract': 'With questions mounting about Athletic Director Julie Hermann’s past, two members of the Rutgers search committee criticized a hiring process that they said felt secretive and rushed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/30/sports/rutgers-committee-members-say-flawed-process-led-to-julie-hermanns-hiring.html', 'snippet': 'With questions mounting about Athletic Director Julie Hermann’s past, two members of the Rutgers search committee criticized a hiring process that they said felt secretive and rushed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Tuesday afternoon, as politicians and major Rutgers donors were publicly criticizing the university for hiring Julie Hermann, an athletic director with a checkered history, the leaders of the search committee sent an e-mail to the group’s members assuring them that the process that led to Hermann’s hiring had been fair and transparent.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/30/sports/yRUTGERS/yRUTGERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 427, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/30/sports/yRUTGERS/yRUTGERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 427}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/30/sports/yRUTGERS/yRUTGERS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 728, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/30/sports/yRUTGERS/yRUTGERS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1457, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/30/sports/yRUTGERS/yRUTGERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/30/sports/yRUTGERS/yRUTGERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/30/sports/yRUTGERS/yRUTGERS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Members of Rutgers Panel See Flawed Hiring Process', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Members of Rutgers Panel See Flawed Hiring Process', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hermann, Julie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Rutgers, The State University of New Jersey', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'College Athletics', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-30T01:05:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steve Eder', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steve', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Eder', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0436296f-9656-5d82-8d8f-84fa627dd4a0', 'word_count': 714, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0436296f-9656-5d82-8d8f-84fa627dd4a0'}, {'abstract': 'It is more helpful to think about faith as the questions people choose to focus on, rather than the propositions observers think they must hold.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/30/opinion/luhrmann-belief-is-the-least-part-of-faith.html', 'snippet': 'It is more helpful to think about faith as the questions people choose to focus on, rather than the propositions observers think they must hold.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Some Sundays ago, I was part of a sermon in my university’s church. It was the kind of ecumenical church in which I’d grown up. The minister and I sat on the proscenium above the congregation and below the stained-glass windows, and spoke about the ways that evangelical Christians understood God — a subject on which I had written a book. Afterward, there was a lunch open to the community. The questions people asked as we ate our avocado-and-cheese sandwiches circled around the puzzle of belief. Why do people believe in God? What is our evidence that there is an invisible agent who has a real impact on our lives? How can those people be so confident?', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/05/opinion/tanya-lurmann/tanya-lurmann-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/04/05/opinion/tanya-lurmann/tanya-lurmann-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/05/opinion/tanya-lurmann/tanya-lurmann-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/05/opinion/tanya-lurmann/tanya-lurmann-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/05/opinion/tanya-lurmann/tanya-lurmann-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/04/05/opinion/tanya-lurmann/tanya-lurmann-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/04/05/opinion/tanya-lurmann/tanya-lurmann-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Belief Is the Least Part of Faith', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Guest Colum