13/05/30/pageoneplus/quotation-of-the-day-for-thursday-may-30-2013.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the day for Thursday, May 30, 2013.', 'lead_paragraph': '“It’s a three-dimensional problem that you have to attack. And it just takes time.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day for Thursday, May 30, 2013', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-05-30T03:42:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/d09770a5-53f3-50d4-96a8-b8a19ca1e6bf', 'word_count': 35, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d09770a5-53f3-50d4-96a8-b8a19ca1e6bf'}, {'abstract': 'Defenseman Brent Seabrook scored 3 minutes 35 seconds into overtime to give the Blackhawks an improbable series victory against the Red Wings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/30/sports/hockey/nhl-playoffs-with-overtime-goal-chicago-caps-series-comeback.html', 'snippet': 'Defenseman Brent Seabrook scored 3 minutes 35 seconds into overtime to give the Blackhawks an improbable series victory against the Red Wings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO — Blackhawks defenseman Brent Seabrook picked up the puck in the neutral zone and carried it across the Detroit blue line. He measured his shot for a moment and fired.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/30/sports/NHL/NHL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 850, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/30/sports/NHL/NHL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 850}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo