a-to-Shining-Sea Memorial Trophy Dash was born.', 'print_section': 'AU', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'One Lap of America: The More Civilized Descendant of Cannonball Run', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Civilized Descendant Of the Cannonball Run', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobile Racing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yates, Brock', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Honda Motor Co Ltd', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-30T10:00:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Preston', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Preston', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d08d184a-c8ad-5a96-8c25-ea401c8e2157', 'word_count': 1751, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d08d184a-c8ad-5a96-8c25-ea401c8e2157'}, {'abstract': 'Experts say there are hundreds of Internet payment systems that do not require users to identify themselves, making it difficult to seize on money laundering operations, Nicole Perlroth reports in The New York Times.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/30/daily-report-systems-for-moving-anonymous-cash-abound-online/', 'snippet': 'Experts say there are hundreds of Internet payment systems that do not require users to identify themselves, making it difficult to seize on money laundering operations, Nicole Perlroth reports in The New York Times.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Experts say there are hundreds of Internet payment systems that do not require users to identify themselves, making it difficult to seize on money laundering operations, Nicole 