article/4578a861-5ce9-5267-ae43-e0a37c481318'}, {'abstract': 'The Spurs have marched into the N.B.A. finals by removing their opponents’ biggest weapons at the right time, with just the right tools.', 'web_url': 'https://offthedribble.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/30/spurs-quietly-become-a-two-way-threat/', 'snippet': 'The Spurs have marched into the N.B.A. finals by removing their opponents’ biggest weapons at the right time, with just the right tools.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Throughout the San Antonio Spurs’ impressive postseason march, the N.B.A. cognoscenti have homed in on one laudatory refrain more than any other: The Spurs take away what you do best.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Spurs Quietly Become a Two-Way Threat', 'kicker': 'Off the Dribble', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'San Antonio Spurs', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-30T17:27:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jim Cavan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cavan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/27b9cd14-3881-5268-94c8-c592d49242a2', 'word_count': 657, 'uri': 'nyt://article/27b9cd14-3881-5268-94c8-c592d49242a2'}, {'abstract': 'From restaurants to writers, Mississippi’s capital city offers a textured mix of old and new.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/06/02/travel/36-hours-in-jackson-miss.html', 'snippet': 'From restaurants to writers, Mississippi’s capital city offers a textured mix of old and new.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When movie crews descended on Jackson in 2010 to film “The Help,” based on Kathryn Stockett’s novel about the city’s maids in the 1960s, they transformed the streets of its trendiest neighborhood into a retro backdrop. Given locals’ loyalty to mom-and-pop stores like Brent’s Drugs, where you can still sit at the counter and order a chocolate malt, it didn’t take much to pull off cinematic time travel. This year, Jackson will recall one of its most difficult moments — June 12, 1963, when the civil rights activist Medgar Evers was shot in his driveway by a white supremacist. Events this June, including a civil rights city tour, film festival and gala, will celebrate Mr. Evers’s life.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/06/02/travel/02HOURS_SPAN-sf/0602HOURS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/06/02/travel/02HOURS_SPAN-sf/0602HOURS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/06/02/travel/02HOURS_SPAN-sf/0602HOURS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/06/02/travel/02HOURS_SPAN-sf/0602HOURS1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/06/02/travel/02HOURS_SPAN-sf/02HOURS_SPAN-sf-thumbStandard-v5.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/06/02/travel/02HOURS_SPAN-sf/02HOURS_SPAN-sf-thumbStandard-v5.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, '