son’s hit during the 1991 playoffs that left Cam Neely with a career-shortening leg injury and Matt Cooke’s blindside hit during the 2009-10 season that gave Marc Savard a career-shortening concussion. Boston forward Milan Lucic noted this week that the Savard hit was “still in the back of your mind, but it’s not the focal point.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Eastern Conference Finals Preview', 'kicker': 'Slap Shot', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stanley Cup', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Boston Bruins', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pittsburgh Penguins', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-30T19:45:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Z. Klein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': 'Z.', 'lastname': 'Klein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/629632da-4445-55cf-85e9-dd04dcb17d6a', 'word_count': 406, 'uri': 'nyt://article/629632da-4445-55cf-85e9-dd04dcb17d6a'}, {'abstract': 'The Chicago Blackhawks have regained their offensive potency and the Los Angeles Kings have returned to their domineering defensive ways.', 'web_url': 'https://slapshot.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/30/western-conference-finals-preview/', 'snippet': 'The Chicago Blackhawks have regained their offensive potency and the Los Angeles Kings have returned to their domineering defensive ways.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The N.H.L. Western Conference finals feature the 2012 champion Los Angeles Kings and the Chicago Blackhawks, who won the 2013 Presidents’ Trophy. This matchup features the last two teams from the West to win the Stanley Cup, though each team had its mettle tested by semifinal showdowns that reached seven games.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Western Conference Finals Preview', 'kicker': 'Slap Shot', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Crawford, Corey', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Quick, Jonathan', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sutter, Darryl', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Toews, Jonathan', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chicago Blackhawks', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Los Angeles Kings', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-30T19:45:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Knoll', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Knoll', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c14ffbb1-c8dd-5dba-b4e4-fff7e9503b82', 'word_count': 540, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c14ffbb1-c8dd-5dba-b4e4-fff7e9503b82'}, {'abstract': 'Seven Democrats who want to be mayor were asked for their stances on a city requirement of a parental consent form for a specific Orthodox Jewish circumcision practice.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/30/diverse-mix-of-candidates-weigh-in-on-an-obscure-jewish-ritual/', 'snippet': 'Seven Democrats who want to be mayor were asked for their stances on a city requirement of a parental consent form for a specific Orthodox Jewish circumcision practice.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is a measure of the multicultural finesse it takes to run for mayor in New York City that seven Democratic candidates — including some of Chinese, Latino, Irish and Italian backgrounds — have staked out positions on an Orthodox Jewish circumcision ritual that is obscure even to most Jews.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Diverse Mix of Candidates Weigh In on an Obscure Jewish Ritual', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Candidates’ Opinions Vary Over a Circumcision Ritual', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Circumcision', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Mayors', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jews and Judaism', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ALBANESE, SAL F', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Blasio, Bill', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Liu, John C', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Quinn, Christine C', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Salgado, Erick J', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Thompson, William C Jr', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weiner, Anthony D', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-30T19:48:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joseph Berger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joseph', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Berger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d15823c1-5c64-5ccc-8b9c-f1353a742522', 'word_count': 514, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d15823c1-5c64-5ccc-8b9c-f1353a742522'}, {'abstract': 'A scene from "American Mary," directed by Jen and Sylvia Soska.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/movies/