i': 'nyt://article/1ebfcb88-5604-5f8b-9e43-34a12bc5cf8e'}, {'abstract': 'An ode to bacon, several vegetarian options and the latest from Nigella Lawson are among the summer’s notable cookbooks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/06/02/books/review/bacon-nation-and-more.html', 'snippet': 'An ode to bacon, several vegetarian options and the latest from Nigella Lawson are among the summer’s notable cookbooks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A great rift has developed in the world of food. On one side, the unapologetic consumers of meat, red-faced and sweaty from their exertions over the barbecue grill and the smoking hog pit. On the other, the gentle leaf eaters, pale but confident — actuarially, ecologically and ethically. Judging by this season’s cookbooks, Team Green seems to be winning in a rout. But the carnivores are not going quietly.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/books/review/0602-bks-cooking/0602-bks-cooking-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/26/books/review/0602-bks-cooking/0602-bks-cooking-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/books/review/0602-bks-cooking/0602-bks-cooking-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/books/review/0602-bks-cooking/0602-bks-cooking-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/26/books/review/06