/f61ff79b-882e-5a7c-9387-dde2ca38cbc5'}, {'abstract': 'A deal with Netflix that helped save the AMC series “The Killing,” which returns on Sunday, may paradoxically hurt it by leading viewers to the French show “Spiral.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/31/arts/television/return-of-the-killing-may-help-a-french-show-spiral.html', 'snippet': 'A deal with Netflix that helped save the AMC series “The Killing,” which returns on Sunday, may paradoxically hurt it by leading viewers to the French show “Spiral.”', 'lead_paragraph': '“The Killing,” a spooky crime thriller set in a rain-soaked Seattle that was canceled after its second season, then revived, returns to AMC this Sunday for a third season with a new case, a mostly new cast and a conundrum. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/arts/31KILLING2/JPKILLING2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/31/arts/31KILLING2/JPKILLING2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/arts/31KILLING2/JPKILLING2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/arts/31KILLING2/JPKILLING2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/arts/31KILLING2/31KILLING2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/31/arts