36-56fa-816d-aaaaef4cb31b'}, {'abstract': '“Student,” by the Kazakh filmmaker Darezhan Omirbayev, takes its inspiration from Dostoyevsky’s “Crime and Punishment.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/31/movies/student-directed-by-darezhan-omirbayev.html', 'snippet': '“Student,” by the Kazakh filmmaker Darezhan Omirbayev, takes its inspiration from Dostoyevsky’s “Crime and Punishment.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Can a crime set you free? For the sullen young man at the center of “Student,” directed by the Kazakh filmmaker Darezhan Omirbayev, an experimental act of violence seems to yield moral clarity. Set in modern-day Kazakhstan, where the quiet is broken only by brutishness, this classically shot and edited film is a spare yet entrancing tale drawn with precise strokes.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/arts/31RDP-STUDENT_SPAN/STUDENT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/31/arts/31RDP-STUDENT_SPAN/STUDENT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/arts/31RDP-STUDENT_SPAN/STUDENT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 451, 'width': 677, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/arts/31RDP-STUDENT_SPAN/STUDENT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 451, 'width': 677, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/arts/31RDP-STUDENT_SPAN/31RDP-STUDENT_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandar