 of her husband’s foundation or start her own, Hillary Rodham Clinton has hired a former State Department aide to join her at what is now being called the Bill, Hillary and Chelsea Clinton Foundation. Until recently it was called the William J. Clinton Foundation.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Clinton Hires Ex-State Dept. Aide and Joins Husband’s Foundation', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Clinton Hires Ex-State Dept. Aide And Joins Husband’s Foundation', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Clinton Foundation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pally, Maura', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-31T00:42:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jim Rutenberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rutenberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f5a8b216-8bfc-583c-a7f4-064efaa524dc', 'word_count': 366, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f5a8b216-8bfc-583c-a7f4-064efaa524dc'}, {'abstract': 'The company has finally moved to further restrict hate speech directed at women, but its slow response may be indicative of a deeper problem in technology companies.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/31/opinion/misogynist-speech-on-facebook.html', 'snippet': 'The company has finally moved to further restrict hate speech directed at women, but its slow response may be indicative of a deeper problem in technology companies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Facebook belatedly moved to further restrict hate speech that glorified violence against women after an organized social media campaign caused some companies like Nissan, the automaker, to withhold advertising from the site. The companies said they acted after they became aware that their ads might have appeared next to the offensive content. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hate Speech on Facebook', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Hate Speech on Facebook', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Facebook Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Networking (Internet)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Everyday Sexism Project', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-31T00:46:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/041a6ce6-16c3-5d54-a77c-bf7e4a0fadba', 'word_count': 378, 'uri': 'nyt://article/041a6ce6-16c3-5d54-a77c-bf7e4a0fadba'}, {'abstract': 'Anger over the Rana Plaza collapse has intensified the pressure on a small lab struggling to make DNA matches with the remains of about 300 unidentified victims.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/31/world/asia/bangladeshi-lab-struggles-to-identify-rana-plazas-dead.html', 'snippet': 'Anger over the Rana Plaza collapse has intensified the pressure on a small lab struggling to make DNA matches with the remains of about 300 unidentified victims.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DHAKA, Bangladesh — Inside a small government laboratory here, there are about 300 test tubes, each labeled with masking tape and containing an extracted tooth or a shard of bone. Day and night, dozens of these tubes rest on metal trays that vibrate with a motorized monotony. The shaking decalcifies the bone in a process that requires two weeks before material can be gleaned for a DNA profile.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/world/asia/DNA/DNA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 373, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/31/world/asia/DNA/DNA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 373}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/world/asia/DNA/DNA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 636, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/world/asia/DNA/DNA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1272, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/world/asia/DNA/DNA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/31/world/asia/DNA/DNA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/world/asia/DNA/DNA-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Grim Task of Identifying Factories’ Dead Overwhelms Bangladeshi Lab', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Grim Task Overwhelms Bangladeshi DNA Lab', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywor