h her husband, the playwright Dario Fo, and it was difficult to tease out who had written what.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/31/theater/franca-rame-italian-actress-and-playwright-dies-at-83.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Rame often collaborated with her husband, the playwright Dario Fo, and it was difficult to tease out who had written what.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Franca Rame, an Italian actress and playwright whose work — including mordant, highly charged critiques of the Italian government, the Roman Catholic Church and the status of women — was often done in collaboration with her husband, the Nobel Prize-winning playwright Dario Fo, died on Wednesday at her home in Milan. She was 83.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/arts/RAME-obit/RAME-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/31/arts/RAME-obit/RAME-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 480}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/arts/RAME-obit/RAME-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 820, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/arts/RAME-obit/RAME-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1500, 'width': 1874, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/arts/RAME-obit/RAME-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/31/arts/RAME-obit/RAME-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailhei