7d'}, {'abstract': 'Friday fun with Josh Knapp.', 'web_url': 'https://wordplay.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/30/what-was-once-yours/', 'snippet': 'Friday fun with Josh Knapp.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FRIDAY’S PUZZLE — I believe Josh Knapp is feeling a little insecure today, so let’s see what we can do to cheer him up. With statements in the northwest like “AM I WRONG?” and “I’M HURT,” it sounds like he can use all the solace we can provide.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What Was Once Yours', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crossword Puzzles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-31T02:00:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Deb Amlen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Deb', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Amlen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/67f22fc3-5b1d-5a78-aca8-725f4bf1f172', 'word_count': 161, 'uri': 'nyt://article/67f22fc3-5b1d-5a78-aca8-725f4bf1f172'}, {'abstract': 'Corrections appearing in print for May 31, 2013.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/31/pageoneplus/corrections-may-31-2013.html', 'snippet': 'Corrections appearing in print for May 31, 2013.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FRONT PAGE', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: May 31, 2013', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-05-31T02:00:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/77624095-33fc-5c6a-bd26-6927e3c43843', 'word_count': 717, 'uri': 'nyt://article/77624095-33fc-5c6a-bd26-6927e3c43843'}, {'abstract': 'Christopher Lloyd stars in “The Caucasian Chalk Circle,” a fablelike play by Bertolt Brecht about a woman who impulsively adopts a baby abandoned by its mother.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/31/theater/reviews/the-caucasian-chalk-circle-at-classic-stage-company.html', 'snippet': 'Christopher Lloyd stars in “The Caucasian Chalk Circle,” a fablelike play by Bertolt Brecht about a woman who impulsively adopts a baby abandoned by its mother.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Terrible is the temptation to do good!” That observation lands with a satisfying sting in the new production of “The Caucasian Chalk Circle,” by Bertolt Brecht, that opened on Thursday at the Classic Stage Company. With his walking-dead demeanor and a slightly savage glint in his eye, Christopher Lloyd, portraying the narrator in the first part of the play, imbues that wry morsel of philosophy with a vivid jolt of irony. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Little Groucho Marx, a Little King Solomon', 'kicker': 'Theater Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Little Groucho Marx, a Little King Solomon', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brecht, Bertolt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sheik, Duncan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Classic Stage Company', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lloyd, Christopher (1938- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Testa, Mary', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Davis, Elizabeth A', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-31T02:00:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Theater', 'subsection_name': 'Theater Reviews', 'byline': {'original': 'By Charles Isherwood', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Charles', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Isherwood', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/0b5224a7-dc29-5472-b0d9-8dad28436421', 'word_count': 1094, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0b5224a7-dc29-5472-b0d9-8dad28436421'}, {'abstract': 'Gov. Rick Perry, who called lawmakers back to ratify redistricting maps drawn by federal judges, has the power to add to the agenda as the 30-day session proceeds.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/31/us/texas-special-legislative-session-puts-perry-in-drivers-seat.html', 'snippet': 'Gov. Rick Perry, who called lawmakers back to ratify redistricting maps drawn by federal judges, has the power to add to the agenda as the 30-day session proceeds.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ross Ramsey, the executive editor of The Texas Tribune, writes a regular column for the Tribune.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Special Session Puts Governor in Driver’s Seat', 'kicker': 'The Texas Tribune', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Special Session Puts Governor In Driver’s Seat', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Texas', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Perry, Rick', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Budgets and Budgeting', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Redistricting and Reapportionment', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-31T02:05:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ross Ramsey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ross', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ramsey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/10762cd4-89d4-52d7-8e67-c25b381905b1', 'word_count': 721, 'uri': 'nyt://article/10762cd4-89d4-52d7-8e67-c25b381905b1'}, {'abstract': 'A new state law banning gas as a means of euthanasia at animal shelters may be costly at first because of staff, certification and construction needs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/31/us/new-texas-animal-euthanasia-law-is-welcome-but-expensive.html', 'snippet': 'A new state law banning gas as a means of euthanasia at animal shelters may be costly at first because of staff, certification and construction needs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Some Texas animal shelters have until January to comply with a new law that bans the use of compressed carbon monoxide to euthanize dogs and cats. Although the shelter operators say they welcome the change, they also say that adapting to the new requirements will be neither easy nor cheap.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/us/TT-Dog/TT-Dog-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 390, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/31/us/TT-Dog/TT-Dog-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 390}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/us/TT-Dog/TT-Dog-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 666, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/us/TT-Dog/TT-Dog-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1332, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank'