ganization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/622999a8-6187-57ed-be83-feb5df9f37ee', 'word_count': 417, 'uri': 'nyt://article/622999a8-6187-57ed-be83-feb5df9f37ee'}, {'abstract': 'Joshua Yospyn, a Washington-based photographer, has a knack for capturing the gleefully odd juxtapositions of America’s weird cultural and political landscape.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/31/haunted-by-americas-quirky-coincidences/', 'snippet': 'Joshua Yospyn, a Washington-based photographer, has a knack for capturing the gleefully odd juxtapositions of America’s weird cultural and political landscape.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Inauguration day in President Abraham Lincoln’s time was on March 4. That’s also the photographer Joshua Yospyn’s birthday — and if you’re given to seeing meaning in coincidences, as he is, it’s a pretty big deal.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tickled by America’s Quirky Coincidences', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-31T09:00:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matt McCann', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McCann', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b975b26b-3c95-543c-bb18-0ffec1a6652c', 'word_count': 742, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b975b26b-3c95-543c-bb18-0ffec1a6652c'}, {'abstract': 'Analysts and politicians weigh in on the 5 percent growth of the Indian economy in the 2012-2013 fiscal.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/31/what-they-said-indias-growth-slumps-to-a-decade-low/', 'snippet': 'Analysts and politicians weigh in on the 5 percent growth of the Indian economy in the 2012-2013 fiscal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Indian economy grew 5 percent in the 2012-2013 fiscal year, the smallest rise in a decade, according to government data released Friday. The figure, which was in line with a February estimate of the Central Statistics Office, or C.S.O., dampened hopes of a swift revival of a once-booming economy.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/world/asia/31-economy-IndiaInk/31-economy-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 428, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/31/world/asia/31-economy-IndiaInk/31-economy-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 428}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/world/asia/31-economy-IndiaInk/31-economy-IndiaInk-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 730, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/world/asia/31-economy-IndiaInk/31-economy-IndiaInk-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1460, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/world/asia/31-economy-IndiaInk/31-economy-IndiaInk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/31/world/asia/31-economy-IndiaInk/31-economy-IndiaInk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/world/asia/31-economy-IndiaInk/31-economy-IndiaInk-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'su