', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Energy Regulatory Commission', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'JPMorgan Chase & Company', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Office of the Comptroller of the Currency', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-31T13:26:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard E. Farley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': 'E.', 'lastname': 'Farley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6a4216d9-e0d1-596c-93bd-4c226e9a9e58', 'word_count': 879, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6a4216d9-e0d1-596c-93bd-4c226e9a9e58'}, {'abstract': 'Members of the oil exporting cartel decided to keep the target for production at 30 million barrels a day, a move the markets had expected.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/06/01/business/global/opec-leaves-production-targets-unchanged.html', 'snippet': 'Members of the oil exporting cartel decided to keep the target for production at 30 million barrels a day, a move the markets had expected.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — With the price of oil relatively strong, OPEC decided on Friday to maintain its current target for oil production at 30 million barrels a day, a move the markets had expected.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'OPEC Maintains Its Target for Daily Oil Production', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'OPEC Maintains Its Target For Daily Oil Production', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Organization of the Petroleum Exporting Countries', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reed, Stanley', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name'