r has spent more than a few warm summer nights in a seat under the stars at the Delacorte Theater, taking in what may well be the quintessential free summer event in New York City: the Public Theater’s venerable Shakespeare in the Park program. This year’s productions look as promising as ever: “The Comedy of Errors” runs from Tuesday through June 30, and a musical version of “Love’s Labour’s Lost,” adapted by the team that brought us “Bloody Bloody Andrew Jackson,” runs from July 23 through Aug. 18.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '30', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Shakespeare in the Park', 'kicker': 'Weekend Miser', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Shakespeare in the Park', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-31T15:02:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By A. C. Lee', 'person': [{'firstname': 'A.', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'Lee', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/356ef4e8-ceee-53ed-9615-6637bbafedcf', 'word_count': 390, 'uri': 'nyt://article/356ef4e8-ceee-53ed-9615-6637bbafedcf'}, {'abstract': 'Karamba Diaby, a Social Democrat who became a German citizen in 2001, could become the first black member of Parliament.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/06/01/world/europe/german-from-senegal-vies-for-bundestag-and-a-first.html', 'snippet': 'Karamba Diaby, a Social Democrat who became a German citizen in 2001, could become the first black member of Parliament.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HALLE, Germany — When Karamba Diaby arrived in Germany as a student from Senegal he knew only two things in German: Bundesliga and BMW — the professional soccer league and the automobile manufacturer. The only hitch was that it was October 1985 and Mr. Diaby had landed in East Germany, where comrades frowned on both West German capitalist institutions.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/06/01/world/01germany_span/01germany_span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/06/01/world/01germany_span/01germany_span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/06/01/world/01germany_span/01germany_span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/06/01/world/01germany_span/01germany_span-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/06/01/world/01germany_span/01germany_span-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/06/01/world/01germany_span/01germany_span-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/06/01/world/01germany_span/01germany_span-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'German From Senegal Vies to Break Bundestag Barrier', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A German From Senegal Vies To Break a Bundestag Barrier', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Diaby, Karamba', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Senegal', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Social Democratic Party (Germany)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Legislatures and Parliaments', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-31T15:02:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chris Cottrell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chris', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cottrell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/afd3855f-de39-5872-9b76-7553b6ed4689', 'word_count': 1368, 'uri': 'nyt://article/afd3855f-de39-5872-9b76-7553b6ed4689'}, {'abstract': 'Reducing corporate taxes can be offset by raising the tax rates on dividends, and the tax system can be made more progressive in the process.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/31/kissing-away-the-corporate-tax/', 'snippet': 'Reducing corporate taxes can be offset by raising the tax rates on dividends, and the tax system can be made more progressive in the process.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My column on Wednesday startled some readers. Was I proposing to do away with corporate taxes simply because globalization is making it easier for multinational companies to avoid them? Should we really just roll over and accept defeat?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Kissing Away the Corporate Tax', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headl