Rhea Leman’s “Gorilla” builds a play around corporate team-building exercises.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/06/01/theater/reviews/gorilla-at-the-lion-theater.html', 'snippet': 'Rhea Leman’s “Gorilla” builds a play around corporate team-building exercises.', 'lead_paragraph': 'No one much likes team-building retreats: certainly not the team, often not even the leader. But somehow Rhea Leman, the author of the second play this season built around just such an event, still hopes that we silent observers beyond the fourth wall might feel differently.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/06/02/theater/reviews/02gorilla/02gorilla-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 379, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/06/02/theater/reviews/02gorilla/02gorilla-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 379}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/06/02/theater/reviews/02gorilla/02gorilla-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 647, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/06/02/theater/reviews/02gorilla/02gorilla-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1294, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/06/02/theater/reviews/02gorilla/02gorilla-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/06/02/theater/reviews/02gorilla/02gorilla-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credi