f5'}, {'abstract': 'Researchers propose a solution to the scarcity of home aides: hire those who have already done it for family members.', 'web_url': 'https://newoldage.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/31/the-family-caregiver-turns-pro/', 'snippet': 'Researchers propose a solution to the scarcity of home aides: hire those who have already done it for family members.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Everyone who thinks about the so-called work force problem for the elderly can see big trouble coming. Who’s going to provide care for the growing number of old people who, even with enormous efforts from family members, will most likely need more help? Or who don’t have families? And who prefer, overwhelmingly, to stay in their homes?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Family Caregiver Turns Pro', 'kicker': 'The New Old Age', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elder Care', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elderly', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-31T18:39:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paula Span', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paula', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Span', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/baee80f5-a537-5787-b025-7a109364f4f0', 'word_count': 766, 'uri': 'nyt://article/baee80f5-a537-5787-b025-7a109364f4f0'}, {'abstract': 'Tommy Haas, 35, defeated 20-year-old Jack Sock, 7-6 (3), 6-2, 7-5, in the second round of the French Open.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/06/01/sports/tennis/rising-in-years-haas-also-rises-back-up-rankings.html', 'snippet': 'Tommy Haas, 35, defeated 20-year-old Jack Sock, 7-6 (3), 6-2, 7-5, in the second round of the French Open.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — Scouting opponents remains something of an inexact, and not wholly embraced, science in tennis. But even if the young American Jack Sock were the sort to approach a match without so much as a YouTube search or a game plan, his second-round match at the French Open would not have required much advance analysis. Sock was playing Tommy Haas, and if there is a universal truth in sports, it is this: run the old guy around until his legs grow as heavy as a sodden tennis ball.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/06/01/sports/tennis-1/tennis-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 419, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/06/01/sports/tennis-1/tennis-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 419}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/06/01/sports/tennis-1/tennis-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 715, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/06/01/sports/tennis-1/tennis-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1431, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/06/01/sports/tennis-1/tennis-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/06/01/sports/tennis-1/tennis-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/06/01/sports/tennis-1/tennis-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Haas, Showing Experience More Than Age, Is the Oldest Man Left Standing', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Haas, Showing Experience More Than Age, Is the Oldest Man Left Standing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'French Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Haas, Tommy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sock, Jack', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-31T18:43:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By Judy Battista', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Judy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Battista', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/73c5b491-599d-5ad8-a1f8-b9f1d4baa5aa', 'word_count': 1017, 'uri': 'nyt://article/73c5b491-599d-5ad8-a1f8-b9f1d4baa5aa'}, {'abstract': 'Race, religion, sexual orientation, children, weight: danger ahead.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/06/02/fashion/avoiding-jokers-remorse.html', 'snippet': 'Race, religion, sexual orientation, children, weight: danger ahead.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You know when you’ve gone too far. You can see it on your interlocutor’s face. Her eyes widen, her lips purse — it looks as if she has chilling documentary evidence of the gathering cicada swarm.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/06/02/fashion/02CIRCANOW/02CIRCANOW-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 220, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/06/02/fashion/02CIRCANOW/02CIRCANOW-