rill-to-begin-residency-at-harlem-school-of-the-arts/', 'snippet': 'Mr. O’Farrill and his band, the Afro-Latin Jazz Orchestra, will have access to rehearsal space and an administrative office at the school’s new Herb Alpert Center.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Afro-Latin Jazz Alliance has announced that its founder, the pianist and composer Arturo O’Farrill, is now an artist in residence at the Harlem School of the Arts. He joins the choreographer Twyla Tharp, who inaugurated the residency program last fall.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/arts/31artsbeat-arturo/31artsbeat-arturo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/05/31/arts/31artsbeat-arturo/31artsbeat-arturo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/arts/31artsbeat-arturo/31artsbeat-arturo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/arts/31artsbeat-arturo/31artsbeat-arturo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/05/31/arts/31artsbeat-arturo/31artsbeat-arturo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/05/31/arts/31artsbeat-arturo/31artsbeat-arturo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 