': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Predictable Decline in Hillary Clinton’s Popularity', 'kicker': 'FiveThirtyEight', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-05-31T19:58:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nate Silver', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Silver', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a31d8202-1130-545b-b538-aa5f40166fad', 'word_count': 922, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a31d8202-1130-545b-b538-aa5f40166fad'}, {'abstract': 'As Treasury bill rates continue to go up, some are saying the economy is getting too strong. But the yields are still well below the levels that prevailed two years ago.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/05/31/those-rising-bond-yields-still-low/', 'snippet': 'As Treasury bill rates continue to go up, some are saying the economy is getting too strong. But the yields are still well below the levels that prevailed two years ago.', 'lead_paragraph': ' As Floyd Norris notes in his High & Low Finance column, the new fear among market watchers is that the economy is getting too strong. As problems go, that might seem like a high class one to have, but those worries are again the topic du jour Friday, as the yields on 10-year Treasury bills rose again. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Those Rising Bond Yields: Still Low', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject',