 theme, it would seem to be about what happens when intelligence and rigor are brought to bear in the pursuit of the aesthetic.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If this issue has a theme, it would seem to be about what happens when intelligence and rigor are brought to bear in the pursuit of the aesthetic. As we all know, the intellect can be cruel and beauty can be shallow, but when these two get together, they can be a powerful force for good, and even happiness.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Editor’s Letter | Of Brains and Beauty', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-05-31T23:08:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Deborah Needleman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Deborah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Needleman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f5bc38d2-8e50-59ff-a527-05108840f6df', 'word_count': 538, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f5bc38d2-8e50-59ff-a527-05108840f6df'}, {'abstract': 'All the chops on the menu at the Chophouse Grille are beef, but pasta, chicken, lobster tail, shrimp and fish add variety.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/06/02/nyregion/a-review-of-the-chophouse-grille-in-mahopac.html', 'snippet': 'All the chops on the menu at the Chophouse Grille are beef, but pasta, chicken, lobster tail, shrimp and fish add variety.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Chophouse Grille, at the end of a short, set-back shopping strip on busy Route 6, is easy to miss. But local residents seem to have had no trouble finding this dining and drinking spot that Toni Vulaj and Matthew Camerino opened nine months ago. An after-work crowd fills the long, inviting bar to overflowing; and to secure a seat in the restaurant section, diners would